<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8"?>
<usx version="2.0">
  <book code="ISA" style="id">Isai</book>
  <para style="h">Isai</para>
  <para style="toc1">Isai</para>
  <para style="toc2">Isai</para>
  <para style="mt">Isai</para>
  <chapter number="1" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Amoz tapa Isai in Juda leengte Uzziah, Jotham, Ahaz leh Hezekiahte vaihawm lai a Juda leh Jerusalem tungtang thu a mengmuna amu khu tambang ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Aw vante ngai unlen, leitung aw na bil dawin, aziehpen Mangpa’n thu agen hi: “Tate ka vah a, ka khangliensah hi, hinanleh ka tungah ahelta uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Bawngtal in aneipa athei a, sabiltungin zong apu annpiehna kuong athei hi; hinanleh Israelten athei sih ua, ka miten angaituo ngaisih uhi.”
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Ka dei aw! Nam tawnkhiel, thulimlouna vanga puo mite, silhoilou bawlte hahlesuonte milepchiete tate ahi ua, Mangpa ataisan ua, Israelte Misiengthoupa athangpai sah ua, akinuahei mangsanta uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Bangzieh a hel nalai lai a, vuoh a um nalai lai ding na hi uoi mah? Lutang apum in achina a, lungtang pumpi aba gawpta hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Kengtaw nuoi apat in lutang dongin adamna mun mawngmawng a um sih hi, liemnate, vuohsidupnate, hima nai ngen a dim ahi; tuate mehbinglou ahi a, koiman atuom sih a, sathau zong nulou ahi nalai hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Na gam uh asesuoh ta a, na khopite uh meiin akatumta a, namitmuna ngel uah gamdang miten na gam uh ane gam siengta uhi Gamdang mite susiet leh nuoisie in a umta hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Tuachi’n Zion tanu khu grep-huon a buh neu nou leh tangmai lei a venna buhte bang ahita a, galte simsa khopi kinuasie bang ahita hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Galkapte Mangpa’n asuohta sun tawmnou khat hing na nuasie lou hitaleh Sodom ibangta ding a, Gomorrah ibangta ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Aw nou Sodom vaihawmte, Mangpa thu ngaikhie unlen, nou Gomorrah mipite aw, i Pasian dan ah na bil daw un.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />“Mangpa’n na kithoina neu noute uh kei a dinga bang phatuom ahiei mah? achi hi. Belamtal halmang sillatte leh ganta vathau ka deikhop ka neita hi. Bawngtalte, belamte ahisihleh kelte sisan ah kipahna ka nei sih hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />“Ka masanga kilan dinga na hing pei chiengun, ka inn huongsung tuon dingin koiin nou hing phut ahiei mah?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Pannabei sillat ding hing tawi nawn sih un, gimnamtui zong kei a dingin kidah huoi ahita hi, ha thate, khawl nite leh na khawmpi hatte u’toh na gitlouna uh ka thuohzou nawn sih hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Na ha thate uleh na hunbi nei pawite uh ka hinna in ahuo hi, kei dingin anohphah giap a, ka chimtah gawpta hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Thungen a na ban uh na zah pouma chiengun ka mit noute akipat ka phuol dinga; thungetna tamsem neinan u’lachin zong ka ngaikhe sih ding hi. Na khutte uh sisan a dim ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Kisil unlen, kisusiengthou un, ka masanga ka mitmuna akipat in na silbawl hoiloute uh koimang unlen, silgilou bawl tawpta un.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Silhoi bawl kizil unlen, thukhen-vaihawmna dih sui unlen, mi sugentheite thu hil unlen, pa neiloute hum unlen, meithaite thu genpieh un.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />“Hing pei unlen ngaituokhawm tadi vai, Mangpa’n achi hi, na khelnate uh san-au bang in san nanleh vua bangin avaam dinga, sandup bang in san nanleh samul bangin angou ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Gennoptah leh thumangtah a na um uleh gam a pieng silhoite na ne ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Hinanleh na utlou ua, na hel uleh, namsau a sattan in na um ding uhi, aziehpen Mangpa kam in agensa ahi.”
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Bangzieh a khopi muonhuoi kizuanu suohta adiei! thudih a vaihawmna toh kidim ana hi a; dihtatna asungah ana umngai a hinanleh tuin tuolthatte a um zawta hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Na dangkate sam-eeh akai siengta a, na zu tui toh akihalta hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Na leengtapate ahelhat ua, gutate lawm asuohta ua, michin in golguh sil adei ua, athawn a silpieh adel uhi. Pa neiloute ahum sih ua meithaite vai ahawm pieh sih uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Tuaziehin Mangpa galkapte Mangpa Israelte Mihatpa’n tambangin agen hi, “Ah! Ka melmate tungah ka thangpaina ka tangtung sah dinga, ka galte tungah phuba kala ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Na tungah ka khut ka ha dinga, na sam-eeh khu tang-al in kasil sieng ding a, tualeh nanga kipat sia tahlou zousie ka lamang ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />Na vaihawmnate amasapen bangin ka siempha kia dinga, tualeh nang hing thuhilte achiil lai a bangin ka siemtha kia dinga; tu nua chiengin miten khopi muon huoi leh dihtatna khopi ahing chita ding uhi.”
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />Thudih a vaihawm-thukhenna toh Zion ka tankhe dinga, tualeh asunga mi piengthate zong dihtatna toh tatkhieh ahi ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />Tualeh mi tawnkhielte leh mikhielte amangthai khawm ding ua, tualeh Mangpa taisan mite mei in akatum ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" />Aziehpen a gangpi sing milim dei tahte uh azumpi ding ua, tualeh nahuon telte uh ziehin na zala ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" />Aziehpen gangpi singna vul bangbang na hita ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" />Mihatte khu patzam ziel bang ahi dinga, tualeh asilbawlte uh meisi bang ahi dinga ani un akakhawm ding ua, koiman aphelzou sih ding hi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="2" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Amoz tapa Isai in Juda leh Jerusalem tungtang thu amu khu tambang ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Ni nukhia chiengin tambang ahing hiding a, Mangpa inn umna muol khu, taangte vum ah suhdet in a um dinga, tualeh muolte tungah, tawisangin a um ding hi; tualeh namte zousie apeikhawm ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Mi tampite ahing peikhawm ding ua, “Hing peiun Mangpa muol ah, Jakob Pasian inn ah pei vaiin, tuachi’n Aman alampite ahing hil dinga, alampite ah ipei ding uh,” achi ding uhi; aziehpen zion akipat in, dan ahing pawt dinga, tualeh Mangpa thu Jerusalem apat in, ahing pawt ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Aman namte kaal ah thu akhen dinga, Aman mi tampite athuhil dinga, tualeh a namsaute uh, lou hawna tuin akheng ding ua, tualeh ateipite uh, theikung heuna siakawite in akheng ding uhi; nam khat in namdangte douna in, namsau aleh nawn sih ding ua, kidou dan zong azil nawn sih ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Jakob innkuonte aw hing pei unlen, Mangpa vaah ah vah va ui.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Aziehpen na mi Jakob innkuonte na taisanta a, amaun suolam mite tat dan zuina in adim siengta uh a; Philistin mite banga aisan mite ahita ua, gamdang mite toh akizopta uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Agamte u’zong sana dangka in a dim a, agoute un beini a neisih hi; agam uh sakol in adim a, asakollengte un beini aneisih hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Agamte u’zong milimte in adim a, akhut mama ua abawlte uleh amauh khutmete a abawl uh, amauh bawlte ma abie uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Mite atakhiel siengta ua, hoilou na ngen a adim taziahun ngaidam sin.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Suongpi kawm ah lut unlen, leivui lah ah kibu un; Mangpa achizat huoina leh athupina apat kiphuol un.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Mihing kiletsahnate khu suhngiem in a um dinga, mite kideikhopna zong kunsah in a um ding hi; tua ni chiengin Mangpa bou tawisangin a um ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Aziehpen galkapte Mangpa ni khu ki liensah leh kingaisang zousiete tung ah atung dinga, amauh kitawi sang pouma akiluoi ngiem ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Lebanon muola sidar sing sangpipite leh tawisang a umte leh Bashan gam a gangpi sing zousie tungah;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Muolsang zousiete tungah leh, tawisanga um muol zousie tungah;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Inn sawngsang chinteng tungah leh kulpi bang nei zousie tungah,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Tualeh Tarshish tembaw chinteng tung leh sil lim kilawm zousiete tungah atung ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Mihing kiletsahnate suhngiem ahi dinga, mite kideikhopnate loingiem ahi ding hi. Tua ni chiengin Mangpa bou tawisang in a um ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Aman milimte asubei sieng ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Leitung nasatah a kilingsah dinga Mangpa athawchiengin, agiinhuoina leh avangletna thupina apat mite atai ding ua, suongpi hawmte leh leihawmte ah atai lut ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Tua ni chiengin miten bieh ding a abawl uh sana leh dangka milimte buite leh baahte kung ah apei ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Leitung nasatah a hotling ding a athaw chiengin, Mangpa zauhuoina chizat huoina apat avangletna thupinate akipat mite suongpi kawm leh kawlhawmte ah alut ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Anahkohawm a anahna hu um mihing gintat tawpsanta un; banglam panga muontah hi mama uh ahiei mah.
  </para>
  <chapter number="3" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Ngaiun, Mangpa galkapte Mangpa’n Jerusalem leh Juda gam a kipat in akingaatna uleh ahinna uh anneh tuidawn zousie alamangta hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Mihat leh galhang, vaihawmmi leh guolnei, ai-sanmi leh upate,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />sawmnga tung lamkai, mi zatat huoi, lemguottu, mi khut siem leh aisansiem mi zousie alamangta hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Tua hun chiengin amauh tunga lamkai dingin naupangte ka koi dinga, naungehten amauh tungah vai ahawm ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Mite khat leh khat akinuoisie tuo ding ua, tualeh michin ama innvengte toh kinuoisie in a um ding uhi; naupangte upate tungah kiliensahtah in agamta ding ua, mi thulimlouten mi zatathuoite tungah akiliensah ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Mi’n apa innsunga a unaupa atuuh a, “Nang sil leh ten na nei a ka tung uah vaihawm inlen, tualeh tami sietgawpna na khut nuoi ah um hen,” achi chieng in;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Tua ni chiengin, aman a niel dinga, “Ken na natna ka damsah thei sih ding hi; Aziehpen ka inn ah neh leh taah leh silleten ding a um sih hi; mite tungah vaihawm ding in hing koi sin,” achi ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Aziehpen Jerusalem akipalpua a, Juda apuata hi athugente u’leh anasepte uh Mangpa kalna ngen ahi ziehin, athupina mit alungthah sah ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Amel puoh dan un, amauh aheh a, akhelnate uh Sodom bangin akilang sah ua, akhelna uh aliakhu siengta ua; ahinna uh atung agih hi; aziehpen amauleh amauh sietna kitut uh ahita hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Midihtatte ahing hoi ding hi, chi un, aziehpen anasep ga uh ane ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Migilou tung agih hi, ama a dingin bangma ahoi sihding hi, aziehpen akhut nasep ga ama kunga pieh ahi ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Ka mite ahileh, naupangte amauh nuoisiete ahi ua, tualeh numeiten atung uah vai ahawm uhi. Ka mite aw na lamkaite un nou ahing sukhiel sahta uhi, tualeh na lampite uh asuseta uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Mangpa agen pieh dingin adingdoh a, tualeh mite vaihawm dingin ading hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Mangpa’n amite lah a upate leh miliente tungah vaihawm ding ahi: “Aziehpen nouten grep-huon nane khawngta ua, mi zawngte apat a na lah sum leh neitahte na inn uah a um hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Ka mite na tawhguoi ua, mi zawngte mai na gawtguoi uh, bang na china uh ahiei mah?” Mangpa galkapte Pasian in a chi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Tuathamlouin Mangpa’n Zion tanute akiliensah ua, ngawng vaipuohin leh mi mitsih et kawm in tawhei lot lot in apei ua, akengte uh asuon ging kong kong zieh un;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Tuaziehin Mangpa’n Zion tanute lutangah hima a umsah dinga, tualeh Mangpa’n azamawte uh adawhsah ding hi; achi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Tua ni chiengin Mangpa’n kizepna kilawmte kengbute, diel khuhte, ngawng awte;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />bilbate, taute kikhuna puonte,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />lugahna dielte, kenga khainiengte, kawngtente gimnamtui bawmte, taute,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />khutsipte, nakuo abate,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />pawi ni puonte, puonah tuolte, puontung silte, sum ipte leh,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />himlangte, puon malngatte, diel khitte leh puon tuolte, alamang ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Tualeh hichi ahing hiding hi, Gimnamtui taangin sil-ui gim a um dinga, kawngten taangin khauhuol, samphatah taangin lukieuna, puontuol hoitah taangin sai-ipuonten a um dinga, tualeh melhoina taangin melsietna a um ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Na mite namsau in a pua ding ua, na mihatte kidouna phuol ah apua ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />Zion kulkotpite mi shi suun in akap ding ua, tualeh amanu ahawm guoh ahi dinga, tuol ah atou ding hi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="4" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Tualeh tua ni chiengin numei sagi in pasal khat atudet ding ua, “Kouma ann ka kineh ding ua, kouma puon silin ka kitengna ding uhi; ka minsietna uh liemang dingin hing kitenpi in” achi ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Tua ni chiengin Mangpa silbawl theina khu kilawmtah leh thupitah in a um dinga, agam gate zong Israel suohta um sunte a dingin, kiletsahpi leh kithupisah tham ching ahi ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Tualeh hichi ahing hidinga, Zion a kinua sie sunte leh Jerusalem a um sunte, mi siengthou chia min law ahi ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Mangpa’n Zion tanute puohban nateng asawpsieng pieh a, tualeh vaihawmna hagau leh halmangna hagau in Jerusalem sisan alah ua kipat asawpsieng chieng in.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Tuachi’n Mangpa’n Zion muol tunga mun chinteng leh akikhawmpite tungah sun in meilum leh meikhu tualeh zan chiengin meikuong vah phatah a umsah dinga, aziehpen sil zousie tungah thupina in aliekhu ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Tualeh sun chienga nisa apata lie dingin, tualeh huipi leh guopi apat a kihumbitna ding leh bel dingin biehbuh a um ding hi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="5" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Ka it pen kung ah agrep huon tungtang thu ah ka it dan thu lain kasa maiding hi. Ka it pen in muol tung leihoina mun ah grep-huon anei hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />A kimkot in lei atou kuoh a, suongte atom sienga, grepgui hoipente asuon a, alai ah innsang alam a, khunah grep suhna khuh zong atou a, tuachi’n grep ga hoitah a ga dingin alam en a, hinanleh grep-hem ahing gata hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Tuin Jerusalem a tengte leh Juda mite aw, kei leh ka grep huon kaal thu hing khen pieh un.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Ka grep huon tunga kana bawlsa ban ah ka bawl thei ding kana bawl khah nailou bang a um nalai ei mah? Grep ga-pha mama ding ka lam et-et laipi, bangzieha grep-hem hing gata mawh adiei?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Tuin ngai un, ka grep huon tunga ka bawl ding ka hinghil ding, a imna dailing ka lamang dinga, ka haltum dinga, abaangte ka suse dinga, totchil in a um ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Ka suse sieng dinga, akiselnou sah nawn sih dinga, aleitang zong akisatnen nawn sih ding hi; hinanleh loulingnei leh khau lingneiten apou khum dinga, atunga guoh zuh louna dingin meilumte zong thu ka pe nalai ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Aziehpen galkapte Mangpa grep huon khu Israel innkuonte ahi a, tualeh Juda mite khu grepgui deithawhuoi tah ahi uhi; Aman thukhenna dih alam en a, hinanleh ngaivawi, suhgentheina ahing um zawta hi; dihtatna a lam en a, hinanleh ngaiin kaana a um hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Gam zanglai a amauh maimai tenna ding mun um nawnlou khop a, inn leh inn kimat a, lou leh lou kipe a um mite atunguh agih hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Galkapte Mangpa’n ka zahna ah thu agen a “Adihtah in inn thupi leh inn hoi tampite ateng ding umlou a nuasie in a um ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Aziehpen grep-huon acre sawm in Greptui bath (8 gallon) khat mai mai piengsah bep van in, tualeh buchi homer khat kituna in ephah khat maimai apiengsah bep ding hi.”
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Zu chiatah dawn dinga zingmawng matah a thou a, adawn kham masangsie a zan sawt pipi donga hahte, tung agih hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Tumging leh kaiging, khuongte leh theile thuoin zu dawnkhawm in guolnop abawl ua, hinanleh Mangpa nasepte angaisang sih ua, akhut sil bawlte zong angaituo ngai vateh sih uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Tuaziehin ka mite’n theina atahsapzieh un sal a puimangin a umta uhi; ami zatathuoite uh gilkiel in a um ua, a mipite uh dangta in adanggaw gawpta uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Tuaziehin sheol a kikeh lien a, akam teguollou a lien in akaah a, tuachi’n athupinate uh, amipite u’leh, akihisahnate uh tualeh akipah thanopna teng u’toh Sheol ah alut suh ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Mite suhngiemin a um ding ua, mi chin ngiem sahin a um ding ua, mi kiliensah a mit tung hate akisungiemta ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Hinanleh galkapte Mangpa khu vaihawmna ah tawisangin a um ding a, tualeh siengthoupa Pasian khu dihtatna ah siengthou in aum ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Tuachi’n belam noute atatna mun ngai uah ata diem diem ding ua, tualeh gam sesate lah a athaute mituom ten ane ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Solna khau a gitlouna kaite leh kangtalai khau a kai banga khelna kaite, tung agih hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Ama kinmeng henlen, “Anasep imu theina dingin kinaw hen, Israelte Siengthoupa lemguotna, imu theina dingun hing nai in, hing tung hen, chi te;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Silhoilou silhoi chia, silhoi lah silhoilou chizel, miel lah vah chi a, vah lah miel chi zel, sil hum lah sil kha a ngai a, sil kha lah sil hum a ngaite tung agih hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Amauh ngaidan a pil kisate leh amauh mitmu a, thei kisate tung agih hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Zu dawn lam a hatte, leh zu chia hai hangsante tung agih hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Golguhna neh zieha migilou siem tangsah a, midihtat dihna alahmang pieh zel uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Tuaziehin meikuongin bupawl akahtum sieng bang in, bu-si mei in ahaltum bangin, amauh thaguite amuot bangin a um dinga tualeh apallutna uh leivui bangin aleengmang tou ding hi. Aziehpen galkapte Mangpa dan adeilou ua, Israel Misiengthoupa thu a simmaw zieh un.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Tuaziehin Mangpa lungthahna amite tungah akuonga, amauh tungah akhut ahata a, avuo hi; tualeh muolte akilinga, amishi luongte uh kholai dungah, silnieh kibuo bangin avum hi. Tamte ziehin alungthahna akihei mang sih a akhut aha nalai lai hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />Gamlapi akipat namte adingin puonlap alehtou dinga, kawlmonga pat amaute hankhawm dingin khutkawi amut dinga, ngai vawi amauten kintahin ahing zuon pai ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />Alah ua koima agim sih ding a, akisuikha sih ding uhi, Koima a lusu sih ding ua, a imu sih ding hi; a kawnggahna uh akiphel sih dinga tualeh akedap khaute uh atan sih ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />Athaltangte uh ahiem mama a, tualeh athalpite uh loisa in aum a; a sakol kengchinte uh meisa suong abang dinga, asakolleng kengte uh zong pingpei bang mai ahi ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" />Athawmgin ukhu humpibahnei hawh abang dinga, humpibahnei lunlai bang maiin ahawh ding uhi; Ahi ahawhkhum ding ua, asa mat ding uh aman ua, bittah in apeimangpi ding ua, tualeh koiman ahundoh zou sihding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" />Tua ni chiengin, tuipi ging hethut bangin atung uah a hawh zoi zoi ding ua, tualeh mi’n gam ahing et uleh, Ngaiin, mielna leh lungkhamna ngen ahi a, tualeh vah khu meilum in amielsahta hi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="6" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Leengpa Uzziah ashi kumin Mangpa a leengtoupha sangtah a tawisanga um tunga tou ka mu a apuon tuol silin biehinn sung aluodim hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Atunglam ah Seraphimte ading ua, ha guh chiet anei ua, aha nite un amaitang uh akhu ua, ha nite in akephang uh akhu ua, ha nite in aleeng uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Tualeh Seraphimte khat leh khat kidawng tuo-in: “Galkapte Mangpa asiengthou hi, asiengthou hi, leitung pumpi athupina in a dim hi,” chiin akikou tuo zel uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Tualeh akikou thawm gingun kotpi khuomte akiling sah a, biehinn sung meikhu in adim hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Tuachi’n ken: “Ka tung agih hi, Mangthai ka hita ve! Nephu nieh mi kahi a, nephu nieh mite lah a teng kahi; ka mit in leengpa galkapte Mangpa ka muta hi” ka chi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Tuachi’n Seraphimte lah khat, maitam akipat mei-am taite a ate tawiin ka kungah ahing leenga,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />tua mei am in ka kam akhoi a, tualeh Aman: “Ngai vawi, tami in na nephu ka khoita a, na thulimlouna lahmang ahita a, na khelna sawpsieng ahita hi,” a chi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Tuachi’n Mangpa aw kaza a, tua aw in, “Koi ahiei ka sawl ding, koi ahiei kou a dinga kuon ding?” achi hi. Tuachi’n ken “Tanah ka um hi, Kei hing sawl in,” ka chi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Ama’n: “Kuon inlen, tam mite vahil in; “Zah pen za unlen, hinanleh theisiem sih un; mu pen mu unlen, hinanleh thei thei sih un; achi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Tam mite lungtang khausah inlen, abilte uh bingsah inlen, amitte uh singsah in. Tuachilou in amit un amu ding ua, abil un aza ding ua, alungtang un atheisiem kha ding ua, ahing kihei kha ding ua, hundam in a um kha ding uhi,” achi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Tuachi’n ken, “Mangpa bang tanvei hiding adiei?” Ka chi hi. Tualeh Ama’n. “Khopite susiet a aum a, ateng ding umlou a, innte a um ding mi umlou a, gam sung suhsiet sieng kilkel masang sie in,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Mangpa’n mite gamlapi a asuonkhieh a, gam sunga mun tampi taisan a a um masang sie dong ahi ding hi;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Hinanleh asungah sesawm suo se khat a um nalai dinga, tualeh ahing kile kia dinga, hinanleh haltum in a um belap ding uhi. Nahii sing lienpi ahisihleh gangpi sing lienpi kiphuasa abul a um nahlai bangin tua gam a abulte ah, chi siengthou bul khu a um ding hi,” achi hi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="7" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Tu in Juda leengpa Uzziah tapa Jotham Jotham, tapa Ahaz, damlai in hichi ahing hi a, Siria leengpa Rezin leh Israel leengpa Ramaliah tapa Pekah Jerusalem dou dingin akuontou ua, hinanleh azou sih uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Tualeh “Siria leh Ephraim apangkhawm uh” chi David innkuonte ava hil uhi. Tuachi’n a lungtang leh amite lungtang gamlah a sing huiin asem chienga akilin bangin akilingta hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Tuachi’n Mangpa’n Isai kungah, “Nang leh na tapa Shear-Jashub, tuikhuh sahtapen tui lahna tawpna a, puonsawp mite lou lam ah, Ahaz kimupi dingin kuontou unlen;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />akungah, pilvang inlen, sip khin khian in umin, Rezin leh Siria leh Remaliah tapa lungthahna ziehin zau sinlen lungkesin. Amaute gel ani un meisel tumbang khu-liliei bang giap ahibou uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Siria, Ephraim leh Remaliah tapa in nangma dou na ding in thu gilou aphiel ua;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />“Juda gam douin ikuontou ding ua, iva subuoi ding a, akulpi bang uh ivu-vang pieh dinga atung ua leeng vaihawm dingin Tabeel tapa ikoi ding hi,” a chi uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Mangpa’n tambangin agen hi: Athu sawm uh alawching sih ding a, atangtung tuom sih ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Aziehpen Siria lutang Damaska ahi a, tualeh Damaska lutang khu Rezin ahi bep hi. Kum sawmguh le-nga sungin Ephraim ase dim dem dinga, nam khat a simtah ahi nawn sih ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Tualeh Ephraim lutang Samaria ahi a, tualeh Samaria lutang khu Ramaliah tapa ahi giap hi. Na gintat sih uleh tundingin na umngai sihding uh,” chi in, achi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Tuathamlouin Mangpa’n Ahaz ahoupi kia a,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />“Mangpa na Pasian akipat in chiemtena ngen in, thuhpiin ahiei, ahisihleh tunglam sangtah in ahiei, ngen in,” achi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Hinanleh Ahaz in, “Ka ngen sih dinga Mangpa zong ka ze-et sih ding hi,” achi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Tuachi’n Isai in: “Nou David innkuonte aw, tuin ngaiun, mihing suh lunggim khu nou a dingin sil neu-nou ahiei mah, ka Pasian nangawn zong sulunggim nalai ding na hi u’maw?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Tuaziehin Mangpa ngeiin chiemtena noute ahing pe ding hi. Ngai in nungah siengthou agai dinga, tapa anei dinga, tualeh amin dingin Immanuel a chi ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Ama’n silhoilou nielna dan leh silhoi telna dan athei chiengin, bawngnawidat leh khuoizu ane ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Aziehpen silhoilou niel dan leh ahoi tel dan athei masangin, tua na giin leeng ni tegel taisan in a um ding hi, achi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Ephraim in Juda gam apawtsan ni akipat a ana tung ngai nailou nite nang leh na mite tungah leh napa innkuonte tungah Mangpa’n Asiria leengpa ahing tungsah ding hi.”
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Tua ni chiengin hichi ahing hi dinga, Mangpa’n Izipt luipite tan donga um thoute leh Assiria gam a um khuoite han dingin saisip atum ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Tualeh a hing pei ding ua, abawn un bangma umlouna phaijang lah leh suongpi keh kalte ah, tualeh lingkung zousie tung leh gantatna munte ah a dim ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Tua ni main Mangpa’n Euphrates luipi gal lam a Assiria leengpa apata akawm mulmetna tem in na luzang a samte leh na keng multe aheu dinga, ahi, na khamul nangawn aheu kieu ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Tua ni chiengin mi khat in bawngla khat leh belam ni maimai akhoi ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Tuachi’n nawitui kichingtah ziehin bawngnawidat a ne ding ua, Aziehpen gam sunga um michinin bawng nawidat leh khuoizu ane ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Tua ni chiengin hichi ahi dinga, dangka shekel sangkhat man grepgui sang khat pouna mun zousie ah, loulingnei leh khau lingneite apou ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Gamsung pumpi lingnei leh khau lingnei ngen asuohtaah ding ziehin, thalpi leh thaltang tawi in mite ahing pei ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Tualeh mi’n muol tupi a ahawsa munte nangawn ah, loulingnei leh khaulingneite na gin ziehun, koima na kuon nawn sih ding ua, bawngtalte leh belamte gamtatna mun asuohta ding hi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="8" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Tuachi’n Mangpa’n ka kungah, “Laibu ziel lienpi la inlen, Maher-shalal-hash-Baz tungtang mihing laikungin giel in.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Kei dinga theipitu muonhuoi siempu Uria leh Zeberekiah tapa Zekariah ka han dinga, amaun giel in achiemte ding uh, achi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Tuachi’n guolneinu kungah, ka haw a, tualeh amanu agai a, tapa aneita hi. Tuachi’n Mangpa’n ka kungah, “Amin dingin Maher-shalal-Hash-Baz phuo in achi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Aziehpen tua naupangin kanu ka pa chia kan dan athei masangin, Assiria leeng pa’n Damaska khopi hausatna leh Samaria khopi apat gallah sumte apomang ding hi,” achi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Mangpa’n ahing houpi kia a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />“Tam mite’n nem hiu hiau a luong diel diel Shiloah tuite adeisih ua, Rezin leh Ramaliah akipahpi uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Tuaziehin tuin ngai vawi, Mangpa’n Assiria leengpa leh athupina zousie toh amaute tungah luitui lien leh hattah aluong sah dinga, tuachi’n luiguom zousie aluonglet dinga, apieu teng adimlet ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Juda gam sungah aluong dinga, tuipi bangin aluonglet ding a, ngawng tan tumin aluong ding hi. Tualeh aha zah in Aw Immanuel nagam vailam adaapsuoh ding hi.”
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Nou namte aw, pangkhawm un suhthelthang a um ding nahi uhi. Mun gamlapi a umte zousie’n nabil uh daw unlen, na kawng uh gah un, suhnen a um ding na hi uh, kigal gingun, gal dou dingin, galvan in kithuom un.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Thu kikumkhawm un, hinanleh phatuom sih va, thu gen un, apiching sih ding, aziehpen Pasian koute toh umkhawm ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Aziehpen Mangpa’n khut hattah ka tunga nga pum in tambangin ahing houpi a, tam mite gamtat dan zuilou dingin ahing hil hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />“Tam miten thu guhphiel achina tungtangte uh thu guhpiel chipi sinlen, agiinte u’zong giing sinlen, zau sihun.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Galkapte Mangpa, Ama ngel khu susiengthou unlen, ama ahi na giin ding uh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Ama khu na mun siengthou ahi dinga, hinanleh Israel innkuonte gel adingin kipalpuana suong leh kidalna suongpi ahi dinga, Jerusalem a tengte adingin thang leh piel ahi ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Tualeh alah ua mi tampite akipalpua ding ua, akehzah ding ua, thangah a awh ding ua, tualeh mat in a um ding uhi.”
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Tam theipina thu kaan inlen, ka nuazuite lah ah dan namkip in, chiemte in.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Tualeh ken Jakob innkuonte lah a amai phuol a um Mangpa ka ngah dinga, Ama ka kineppi ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Ngai vawi, keima leh Mangpa’n ahing pieh naupangte tanah ka um uhi, koute Zion muol a teng galkapte Mangpa apata Israel gam sung chiemtena leh sil lamdangte ka hi uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Tualeh amaun na kung ua “Dawisiemte leh aisan siem a phuisamte dong un ahing chi chiengun,” miten a Pasian uh asui zoh ding uh hilou ahiei mah? Mihingin mi shi a dong zaw ding amah? Chi un.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Dan thu leh theipina thu doh ding ahi a, tam thu dungzui a thu agen sih uleh ama uah vah a umlou zieh ahi ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Mangbang leh gilkiel pum in apei suoh ding ua, tualeh hichi ahing hi dinga, ahing gilkiel chiengun, ahing lung himaw ding ua, vandah in aleengpa uleh a Pasian uh ahamsiet ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Tualeh leilam a en ding ua, lungdonna leh mielna, lam et beina leh lungkham mielna, amu ding ua, miellah a nawlut in a um ding uhi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="9" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Hinanleh lunggim a umnu adingin nguina mawngmawng a um nawn sih ding hi. Nidanglai in Zebulun gam leh Naphtali gam simmaw huoi in ana umsah a, hun nukhia lam ah Jordan gal a Zentelte galili gama tuipi gei a lampite a thupisahta ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Miel nuoi a gamta miten vah thupitah amuta ua, shina lim gam a tengte tungah khovah ahing taangta hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Nangman namte na pungsahta a, tualeh alungnopna uh na pungsah a, bu lah laia kipahna bang leh miten, galvanlah akihawm chieng ua akipah, mabangun na masangah akipah uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Aziehpen apuohgih puohna hahkol leh, aliengzang ua zawl leh ama bawlsepa, chieng zong Midiante zawna nia na sattawng, pieh bangin na sattawng piehta hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Aziehpen Husa thupitah a kidouna phuol a, galhatte kedapte leh sisan banna puonsilte, meiphuolpi tawna dingin akizang ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Aziehpen ei a dingin naupang apienga tapa, pieh in iumta hi; aliengkou ah vaihawmna akinga dinga; tualeh amin: “Lamdang, thumoppa, Bangkimbawlthei Pasian, kumtawn pa, Lemna Mang,” akichi ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />A gam vai hawmna leh, kilemna pundanin tawp ni anei sih ding a. David Mangtoupha tungah leh, aleenggam tunga thu pe dingin, vaihawmna leh thudihna sudet dingin, tuani akipat kumtawn dongin, galkapte Mangpa phatuomngaina in, bawl ahi ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Mangpa’n Jakob douna in thu ahah a, Israel tungah atuta hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Mi zousie, Ephraimte leh Samaria khopi a tengte leh lungtang kisathei leh ki-uongsahtah a thugente zousie’n athei ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />“Tehleite achimta a, hinanleh suong kikhengte in ilamthana ding hi, theipi kungte akiphuata a, hinanleh Sidar singte a heng ding ihi,” achi ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Tuaziehin Mangpa’n Rezin melmate ama dou dingin asuhat ding a, agalte atohthou dinga, ading khawm sah ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Siriate amailam uah, tualeh Philistinte anualam uah a um ding ua, tuachi’n amaun akam uh kaah in Israelte anomval ding uhi. Tamte ziehin alungthahna adai tuom sih dinga, amaute dou in akhut aha nalai ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Aziehpen amauh vopa kung lam ah mipite akihei sih ua, galkapte Mangpa zong asui tuom sih uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Tuaziehin Mangpa’n Israel apat in alutang leh amei, tumsing kung leh abate ni khat thu in asattan ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Upa leh mizatathuoi khu alutang ahi a, zuou thu hil guolnei khu amei ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Aziehpen tam mipite lamkaiten amauh asukhiel sah ua, Tualeh ami puite uh amangthai sah uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Tuaziehin atangvalte u’tungah Mangpa’n kipahna anei sih a, Pa neiloute leh meithaite tungah zong hepina anei sih ding hi. Aziehpen michin lepchie leh silhoilou bawl ngen ahi ua, tualeh kam zousie in sil mothuoi agen uhi. Tamte zousie ziehin alungthahna akiheimang sih a, amaute tung ah akhut aha nalai lai ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Aziehpen gitlouna in meikuong bangin akaa a, ling le-khaute zong akatum ding a, gammang satah lahpi zong akaa-a, tunglam ah meikhu akizieltou vapual ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Galkapte Mangpa thangpaina ziehin gam akatumta a, mipite pen mei a vah ding sing bang ahi ding hi. Koiman asanggampa nangawn zong ahudoh sih ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Tualeh akhut zietlam in amaithop ding ua, hinanleh agilkiel veve ding hi, aveilam khut un avaltum ding ua hinanleh alungkim tuom sih ding uhi, michinin ama sa ane ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Manasseh in Ephraim adou ding a, Ephraim in Manasseh adou ding hi; Amaute-gel in Juda adou khawm ding uhi; tamte zousie ziehin alungthahna akihei mang tuom sih a, akhut aha nalai lai hi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="10" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Thutanna dihtatloutah a thutante leh mite suhgentheina ding bep a dan thupieh gielte tung agih hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Ka mite lah a tasamte apat thukhenna dihna lahmang pieh a, tualeh mi zawngte lah apat hamphatna lamang ding leh meithaite galvan tom banga tom dinga kisate tualeh pa neiloute ne gam dinga a kiguongte tung agih hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Tualeh gamlapi apat a gawtna leh na sietna uh ahing tun chiengin, bang chita ding nahi uoi mah? Panpina ngen a koi kunga tai ding nahi uoi mah? Tualeh na thupina uh hei ah na nuasie ta ding uoi?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Keima louin suongkultaangte lah ah akun ding ua, tualeh tha a umte lah ah apua ding uhi. Tamte zousie ziehin alungthahna adai tuom sih a, hinanleh amaute douna in akhut aha nalai lai hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Ka lungthahna chieng, Assiria tung agih hi, tualeh akhut ua chiengpum khu ka lungkimlouna ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Pasian neilou namte douding leh ka thangpaina mipite dou dingin ama ka sawl a, amaute gallah banga la ding leh samat bang a man dingin ama thu ka pe dinga, kholai buonnawi chil bangin amaute chiil dingin zong thu ka pe ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Hinanleh Assiria in tuabang a tup ahi sih a, alungsim ah zong angaituo khasih hi. Hinanleh a tawmtham hilou in, nam tampite susiet ahi alungsim a atup zaw.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Aziehpen aman: “Ka miliente zousie leengte ahi sih uh amah?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Kalno khuo khu Karkemish khuo bang hitalou amah? Hamath khuo khu Arpad khuo bang hilou amah? Samaria khopi zong Damaska khopi bang hilou amah?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Ka khut in milim biehna leenggamte amukheta hi, Amilim khenthute uh Jerusalem leh Samaria a milimte sangin athupi zaw hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Samaria leh amilimte tunga ka bawl banga, Jerusalem leh a milimte tunga bawllou ding ka hiei mah?” achi chi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Tuaziehin hichi ahing hi dinga, Mangpa’n Zion muol tung leh Jerusalem tunga anasep zousie a tangtunsah chiengin, Assiria leengpa lungtang kisahtheina leh akiletsahna mit sanghana ziehin ka gawt ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Aziehpen aman: “Ka bantha hat a tamte ka bawl ahia, tualeh ka pilna leh ka lemgel siem na ziehin nam dangte gamgi zong ka suonmanga, agoute uh kalah pieh a, tuachi’n bawngtal hang bang leengtoupha a toute ka kaikheta hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Ka khut in mite hausatna khu vabu bangin amuta hi; tualeh mi’n vatuite api’n aloisan nua a, alahkhawm bangun leitung pumpi ka lakhawmta hi; Tualeh ha-jap leh kamkaah a, en kiu-kieu mawngmawng koima a um sih hi.”
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Heipi ama zanga singsatpa tungah akiliensah ding amah? Ahisihleh sing-atna ama zanga sing-atpa sangin athupizaw amah? Chieng in ama lamtoupa, doptou tum henlen phohbul in sing hilou khat alehtou mawh thei diei mah? a chi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Tuaziehin Mangpa, galkapte Mangpa’n ami hat thahoi leh thaute lah ah gawnna ahing sawl dinga tualeh athupina nuoi ah meikuong bang khat akuongsah ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Tuachi’n Israel vah khu meikuong ahing hi ding a, a Misiengthoupa khu meikuong ahing hi ding hi; tualeh nikhat thu in ling leh loulingneite akatum ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Tualeh agammang thupina akatum ding a, agam gasuo Hagau leh tahsa pum nasan in; tualeh china gim gawng gawp bang ahita ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Tuachi’n gammanglah a sing umsunte, naupang nangawn in agel phah giap banga tawm ahi ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Tua ni chiengin hichi ahing hidinga, Israel dam nalai sunte leh Jakob innkuonte lah a na suohta sunte, amauh zougawpte tungah akingam nawn sih ding ua, Mangpa Israelte Misiengthoupa tungah thutahin akingam zawta ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Adam sunte akia-kia ding ua, Jakob umsunte Pasian kungah akile kia ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Aziehpen Aw Israel na mite tuipi pieu a senel bangin tam nan uleh, adam sunte maimai ahing kinuale kia ding uh a, susietna thutanna khu ditatna toh aluonglet ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Aziehpen galkapte Mangpa Pasian in tawpna tung ngei dinga aguot khu agam pumpi laikim tah ah atang tun ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Tuaziehin galkapte Mangpa Pasian in tambangin agen hi, “Zion a teng ka mite aw, Assiriate giing sih un, Izipt mite bawl bangin, phohbul in ahing sat dinga, tualeh achieng na tungah aleh ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Aziehpen tomnou sungin ka lungthahna abei dinga, tualeh ka lungthahna khu amaute manthaina ahi ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />Tualeh galkapte Mangpa’n Oreb suongpi a Midiante atha lai bangin, amaute dou dingin vuohna khauhuolte atohthou dinga; Ama’n tuipi tunga achieng avihtou lai a, Izipt gama sil tung bang ahi ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />Tua ni chiengin hichi ahing hi dinga, na liengkou apat apuohgihte lahmang ahita dinga, tualeh na ngawnga kipat in ahahkol lahmang ahita ding hi, Ahi sathaunu ziehin hahkol khu suhsiet in a umta ding hi.”
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />Ama Aiath khuo ahing tunga, Migron khuo tawnin apeisuoh a, Mikmash khuo ah agalthuomte akoi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" />Muol dung tawn in apei a, Geba khuo ah agieh hi, Ramah khuo a zau a, Saul khuo Gibeah ataimang hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" />Aw Gallim tanu, nahpitahin kikou in, Laish khuo dongin kizasah inlen; Aw Anathoth hepihuoi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" />Madmenah khuo zau in ataimanga, Gebim khuo a tengte kibutna ding sui in ataizah uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" />Tua ni mama in Nob khuo ah ataam nalai dinga, Zion tanu muol leh Jerusalem muol khu akhuttum athinkhum ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" />Ngaivawi, Mangpa, galkapte Mangpa’n chizathuoi tahin aba mengte asattan dinga, asang tuomte aphua ding a tualeh akisatheite akaingiem ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" />Aman gammang satahte khu heipi in aphua dinga, tualeh Lebanon gammang zong mihatpa mai ah apua ding hi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="11" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Jesse kungpi akipat aba khat ahing mengdoh dinga, Tualeh ahuite akipat in, aba ahing khangdoh ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Mangpa Hagau, pilna leh theisiemna hagau, lemguotna leh hatna hagau, theina leh Mangpa giinna hagau, atungah a um ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Akipahna khu Mangpa giindan siemna ahi ding hi; tualeh amit a amu bangin thukhenna abawl sih dinga, abil a azah bangin thutanna abawl sih ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Hinanleh dihtatna toh mi zawngte thu akhen pieh ding a, Tualeh leitunga minunnemte adingin khentuom neilou in thutanna abawl zaw ding hi. Ama’n akam a chiengpum in leitung asat ding a, tualeh akama hu in migiloute athat ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Dihtatna khu akawng gahna ahi dinga, tualeh ginumna khu atai gahna ahi ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Ngie khu belamnou toh a umkhawm ding ua, kamkei toh kelnou alum khawmta ding hi; tualeh bawngnou leh humpibahnei lunlai leh gan vah thaute a lumkhawmta ding hi; tualeh naupang neu khat in amaute apui kawi kawita ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Bawngpi leh vompi loupa pet in atakhawmta ding ua, anoute uh a lumkhawmta ding uhi. Humpibahnei in bawngtal bangin bu pawlte aneta ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Naupang nawi nelaite muoltan ko gei ah aki apmaita ding ua, naupang nawi neh tawp pan panten, gulsie ko sung akhut un asawhta ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Ka muol siengthou zousie ah kisuh natna leh kisuhsietna a um nawnta sih ding hi. Aziehpen tui in tuipi atuomsuoh bangin, leitung Mangpa theinain adim ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Tua ni chiengin, Jesse zungpi khu namchin a dingin chiemtena in a ding diinga, Aziehpen Jentelte’n Ama asui ding ua, tualeh akhawlna mun khu thupitah ahi ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Tualeh tua ni chiengin, Mangpa’n amite ashimawh nuasie a umsunte nuapuidoh kia dingin; Assiria gam leh Izipt gam akipat Pathros gam leh Ethiopia gam akipat Elam gam leh Shinar gam akipat Hamath khuo leh tuipi pang gamte leh tui laisie gamte apat a puikhawm kia dingin Mangpa’n anivei na dingin akhut aha kia ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Aman namte adingin chiemtena puonlap atadoh dinga, Israel kinotdohte apuikhawm dinga, Juda taizahte, leitung ning li apat in apuikhawm ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Tuachi’n Ephraim thangsietna abeita dinga, Juda mite lungkham mangbatna tunte sattan ahita ding ua, Ephraim in Juda athangsiet nawn sih ding hi. Tualeh Juda in zong Ephraim asubuoi nawn sih ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Hinanleh amaute khu tumlam manaw in aleeng suh ding ua, Philistinte liengkou ah atu ding ua, tualeh ni suona lam a mite ani un asimkhawm ding ua, Edom leh Moab tungah khut aha ding ua, tuachi’n Ammon miten athu uh amangta ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Tualeh Mangpa’n Izipt tuipi lei banga zum khu nasatahin asuse dinga, tualeh huipi lum-vapom alangsah dinga, tuipi tungah akhuttum aleh dinga, tualeh luidung sagi suoh ding khopin asat dinga, tuachi’n mite akengphang u’zong pahlou in agalkai ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Tuachi’n Izipt gam akipat a ahing peitou lai ua, Israelte dinga lamlien ana um bangin, Amite ashimawh umsun nuasie a umte dingin, Assiria gam akipat in lamlienpi ana umta ding hi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="12" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Tua ni chiengin nangman: “Aw Mangpa nang ka hing phat ding hi Ka tungah lungthah nanlachin zong, na lungthahna akiheimangta a, nangman na hing hamuonta hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />“Ngai in Pasian ka hinna ahi a, Ka muong dinga, ka zau nawn sih ding hi. Aziehpen Jehovah Mangpa khu, kahatna leh ka la ahi a, Ama ka hundamna zong ahing hita hi;” na chi ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Tuaziehin hundamna tuikhuh akipat in kipahtahin tui na tawita ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Tua ni chiengin nouten “Mangpa phat unlen, Amin lou unlen, asil bawlte Zentelte lah ah theisah unlen, Amin tawisanga um ding ahi, chi’n phuong un.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />“Mangpa kungah pahtawina la sa un, Aman sil thupite abawltah ziehin, tam khu leitung pumpi ah theisahin a umta hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Zion a tengte aw, ngaitah in kikou unlen, nuom in la sa un, aziehpen Israelte Siengthoupa na lah uah,” thupitah in a um hi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="13" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Babilon tunga puohgih Amoz tapa Isai in ana mu khu;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Mi liente a alut theina ding un muolvum sang tungah chiemtena puonlap tahkhie unlen, aw ngaitah in amauh han unlen, khut zap un.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Keima mama in, ka suhsiengthoute thu ka peta hi, ka lungthahna sutangtung dingin, ka galkap hangsante leh, ka pahtawina nuomsate zong ka hanta hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Ngai un, mipi tampi husa banga muol tunga thawmging vengvung khu ngai un, Mi atam atam husa, namchin leenggam kikhawm-khawmte husa chieh vengvung khu, Galkapte Mangpa’n kidouna adinga galkapte akhopkhawm ahita hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Amaute gam, gamlapi kawlmonga kipat in ahing kuon ua, Gam pumpi suse dinga Mangpa thangpaina galvanzah ahi ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Kap in mau vengvung un, Mangpa ni anaita hi, Bangkimbawlthei akipat a manthaina hing tung bang mai in ahing tung ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Tuaziehin khut zousie azaw dinga, tualeh michin lungtang azunmang ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Tualeh azau ding ua, natna leh thuohgimna in amaute amanta dinga, numei nau vei bangin natna thuoh in a um ding ua, khat leh khat lamdang kisa tuoin amai uh meikuong abang ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Ngai in, gam suse ding leh asung a, mikhielte mangthaisah dingin, Mangpa ni khu thangpaina leh lungthah na, giloutah leh zauhuoitah toh, ahing tung ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Aziehpen van aasite leh bawm luoiten avah uh ataangsah nawn sih ding ua, ni a hing suoh chiengin mielsah in a um dinga, tualeh hapi in zong avahna ataangsah sih ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Leitung agitlouna ziehin ka gawt dinga, migiloute zong athulimlounate ziehun ka gawt ding hi, tualeh mikiliensahte uonghamna ka tawpsah dinga, tualeh mi kisatheite zauhuoina ka luoingiem ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Mihingte khu sana siengset sanga vaangzaw in ka bawl dinga, Ophir sana tang sanga vaangzaw in ka bawl ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Tuaziehin galkapte Mangpa thangpaina leh, alungthahna zauhuoina niin vante ka lohling dinga, tualeh leitung amun apat akisuon mang ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Gamvah mi dellai sasan bang leh, ching ding neilou belam bang ahi dinga, mi chin amauh mite lam ah akihei ding ua, tualeh michin amauh gam chiet ah atailut ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Michin akimukha pouma dawtpailetin a um dinga, tualeh koipou matkhah a um pouma, namsau in ashi ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Atate u’zong amitmu ngel uah tuoltang satna in akinei ding a aguoi dimdem ding uhi; a innte uh akibulu dinga, azite uh pawngsuol in a um ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Ngai in, amauh dou dingin Medete ka tohthou ding a, amaun dangka zong angaisah sih ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Athalpite un tangvalte athatgam ding a, naubu apata piengkhe pouma tungah hepina malmal anei sih ding ua, amit un naupangte akhawi tuom sih ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Tualeh Babilon leenggamte thupina, Kaldea mite kisahtheipi kilawmna khu, Pasian in asuhmang chiengin Sodom leh Gomorrah abangta ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Bangchihtan in mi ateng nawn sih dinga, akhang akhangin koiman aluo nawn sih ding hi; khunah Arab miten apuon inn uh azah nawn sih ding ua, belam chingten khunah abelamhonte uh, alumsah nawn sih ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Hinanleh khum gamdai a gamsate alumta ding uh a, tualeh a innte uah simbute adim dinga, Gamva kengsangte ateng ding ua, sakelte khunah aki-apmaita ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Akulpi venna innsangte uah ngiate aham ding ua, aleeng innpi nuomtahsungah si-alte aham ding uhi. Ahun a hing tung pai ding a, anite suhsau ahi sih ding hi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="14" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Mangpa’n Jakob tungah lainatna anei dinga, tualeh Israelte atel kia dinga amauh gam mama ah atengsah ding hi. Tualeh gamdang miten amaute azop ding ua, Jakob innkuonte abel denta ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Tuachi’n mite’n amauh azawpi ding ua, amun uah atut ding uhi; tualeh Israel innkuonten amaute, Mangpa gamsungah, suohpate leh suohnute’n aneita ding uhi; Tualeh amauh sal a nei mite khu, sal in alenei zawta ding ua, amauh bawlgentheite tungah vai ahawmta ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Tualeh na lungkhamna apat, na zauna apat leh nasem ding a bawl a na umna na koltanna hasatah apat bang Mangpa’n nou Israel ang khawldamsah hun chiengin,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Tami paunah Babilon leengpa elhouna a zang pum in na kikou khum dinga, “Bangchidan a mi bawlgentheipa khu khawl ata e! Sana khopi asip dide tamawh a! na chi ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Mangpa’n migiloute chieng leh vaihawmte leengchieng asattanta hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Thangpaina pum a mipite tawplou a vuo vuo-a lungthah pum a namte tunga vaihawm mi khu, gawt in a um a tualeh koiman adal sih hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Leitung pumpi atawldamta a, asip dide a, la sain akikoukhie uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Ahi, Saipras singte leh Lebanon a sidar singte nangawn na tungah lungdam in, suhngiem a na um akipat in, koute hing phua ding koima a um nawn sih hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Nuoilam a Sheol nang hing na tuoh ding ngahlain aphe vengvunga, nangma dingin mi shite tohthou in a um ua, leitunga milien zousie leh nam chin a leengte zousie a leengtoupha ua kipat in akaithouta hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Amaute zousie in na kungah thu agen ding ua, nang zong koute banga hatlou nahita maw? Nang zong koute bang nata ve maw? ang chi ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Na kithupisahna na tum ging husa gingngai tengtoh Sheol a puisuh in a umta hi. Na nuoi ah than akipha dim a, na tungah lungnouten ang tuom ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />“Aw Lusifer phalvah tapa, Bangchidan a van akipata hing kesuh na tai? Nang namchin suzawngkhalpa, bang achileh lei lah a satkhiet suh a um natai mah!
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Na lungtang in van ah ka kaltou dinga Pasian aasite tungah ka mangtoupha ka domsang ding a, maltawp a kikhopna muol ah ka tou ding hi, na chita hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Meilum sangpente tunglam peh ah ka kaltou dinga, Tungnung Pen bangin ka um ding hi, nachi viel hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Hinanleh Sheol kokhuh thuhpi tawpa puisuh a um ding na hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />A hing mu pouma in ahing en saal ding ua, tampa himaw leitung sulinga leenggam zousie kilingsahpa, chi’n ahing ngaituo ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Leitung gamdai banga bawla, tualeh akhopite susie a, asuongkul taangte a innlam a nuapeisah nuomloupa ahing chi ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Namchin leengte zousie abawn un a inn chiet uah athupina u’toh a lum ua a imu chiet uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Hinanleh nangpen ahunlou a pieng, kidah-huoitah bangin, na hankhuh apata paidoh in na umta hi. Namsau a dawtpaileta tha a umte, hankhuh suongte donga peisuhte bang leh miten mishi luong atotchil bangmai nahi ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Na gam na suseta a, na mipite na tha ziehin, alah uah amaute toh vuikhawm a umlou ding na hi. “Silhoilou bawlte hahlesuonte min akilou kha sih ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Apu apate uh khelna ziehin atate uh that dingin kigingkhol masa un, gam luo dinga ahing khandoh louna ding u’leh leitung pumpi khopite a dimsah louna ding un.”
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />“Galkapte Mangpa’n amauh dou dingin ka kisa ding hi,” achi hi, “Babilon akipat in min leh ashimawh umsunte hahlesuonte ka sattan ding, Mangpa’n achi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Babilon gam sakute tenna ding leh tui leh buonnaang kihal ka suohsah dinga, suhsietna munphie in ka phiet nalai ding hi,” galkapte Mangpa’n, achi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Galkapte Mangpa akichiemta a, “Pelloin ka geel bangin ahing tung ding hi, tualeh ka tup leh guotsa bangin a um ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Ka gam sungah Assiria ka khenthang dinga, ka muol tungte kengin ka tuonchil ding hi. Tuachi’n amaute apat in a hahkol a sutkhe dinga, aliengkou ua kipat in apuohgih uh ka lamang ding hi.”
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />Tami ahi, leitung pumpi adinga ka tup leh ka guot, tualeh tami ahi nam pumpi tung a khut kizah khu.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />Mangpa’n ana tupsa khu koi ahiei dal thei ding? Tualeh akhut azahta a, koi ahiei nua heikia thei ding?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />Lengpa Ahaz shi kumin tami puohgih kigen khu ana tangtungta hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" />“Aw nou Philistin zousiete, nouma ahing satna chieng akitan ziehin lungnuom in kipah sih un, gulpi zungpi akipat in gul gukha ahing pawtdoh dinga, tualeh aga khu gul leengthei zauhuoitah ahi ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" />Mi zawngte tamasaten neh amu ding ua, mi tasamte bittah in alum ding ua, hinanleh nangma hahlesuonte kiel in ashi ding ua, tualeh ashimawh umsunte, kiel in athat ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" />Kotpite aw kap in mau un, Aw khopi kikoukhie in, nou Philistin zousiete na zunmang siengta un, aziehpen mallam akipat meikhu hing pawt ding ahi, tualeh ahun guotsate ah koima amatangin a umsih ding hi.”
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" />Mi’n nam thangkoute bang chi’n adawngta ding uoi? “Mangpa’n Zion amukheta a, amite lah a gentheite tua sungah akibu ta ding uhi.”
  </para>
  <chapter number="15" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Moab puohgih khu, zankhat thu a Moab gam a Ar khopi suhsietin a um a, bangmalou a bawl ahita, zankhat thu a Moab gam Kir khopi suhsiet ahiziehin, Moab suhmangthai ahita hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Ama biehinn leh Dibon dongin apeitou a, munsangte a kap dingin apeitou ua, Moab in Nebo leh Medeba akaa khum ding hi. Alutangte zousie uh akiheu kieu ding a, khamul teng zong akiheu kieu ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />A kholai lampite uah sai-ip puon asil ding ua, a inn tungte uleh akholai dungte uah michin nasatah in kap in amau ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Heshbon leh Elealeh akikoukhe ding ua, akikou aw uh Jahaz tandongah akiza ding hi; Tuaziehin Moab galkap galvan a kivonte akikoukhe ding ua, akawngte uh akithing ding a ahinna uh patau in achi tunding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Moab ziehin ka lungtang akikou dinga, a galtaite Zoar khuo atai ua, bawngla kumthum a upa bang maiin, Luhith kholam ah kap kawm in akaltou ding ua, Honoraim lampi ah sietna ding kakhumin akikou ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Aziehpen, Nimrim tuite suhsietin a um dinga, hampa hingte avuoimang siengta a; hampate apuata, hampa hing mawngmawng a um nawn sih hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Tuaziehin anei alamte u’leh, agou kholkhawmte uh huisum luita lam ah, agalte un apomang sieng ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Aziehpen kap a akikouna aw uh Moab gamgi kim vel ah atungta hi; Aka le maunate uh Eglaim leh Beer Elim atungta hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Aziehpen Dimon tuite sisan in adim sieng dinga, Dimon tungah atamzawsem ka tungsah nalai ding hi. Moab akipata taidohte leh agama shi mawh umsunte tungah humpibahneite ka sawl ding hi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="16" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Gam vaihawmte kungah Sela akipat in gamdai dongin, Zion tanu muol tandongin belamnou hah un.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Aziehpen va abu apata kiheudoh a leeng kawi kawite bangin, Moab tanute Arnon lui kaanna ah a um ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />“Hing lemguotpieh unlen vai hing hawm piehun, suntanglai in na him zanlai bangin bawl inlen, akinotdohte phuol inlen, galtai suohtate man sahsin.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Aw Moab ka mi nawdohte na kung uah tengsah tadi inlen, amaute susepa akipat in akibutna uh hi in. Sum lahpieh mi abei dinga, Suse mi atawpta hi; mi nuoisiete zong gamsung apat suhmangin aumta uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Hepina toh mangtoupha tunding ahita dinga, tualeh mi khat thutah in David puon inn sungah atou dinga, vaihawmna dih sui in thu akhen dinga, tualeh dihtatna atungsah pai ding hi.”
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Moab kisahtheina thu leh akiletsah mama nate, aki-ot sahnate, akiletsahna leh alungthah dante kana zata uhi; hinanleh azuou thu gente bangmalou ahi bou hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Tuaziehin Moabte, Moab gam a dingin kap leh mau in a um ding ua, michinteng kap in amau ding uhi. Ker-hareseth a suongphumte ziehin na suun ding uh, pellou a vuoh in a um ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Aziehpen Heshbon loute atulta a, Sibmah grepguite avuoita hi; namchin milienten grepgui hoi penpente asutan siengta ua, tuate khu Jazer khuo dongin azam a, gamdai tandong ah a zam lut ua, abate azam sau sengseng a, tuipi ah azam galkai uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Tuaziehin Jazer grepgui khu Sibmah grepgui ka-in ka kakhum ding a: Aw Heshbon leh Elealeh, ka hitui ka hing buohkhum ding hi; Aziehpen na nipilai theigate uleh na bulahte uh tunga galdouna kikou aw atawpta hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Thei huonte tunga kipahna lahmang ahita a, lou hoitah akipat in lungnopna zong akilamangta hi; tualeh grep huonte ah la akisa nawn sih dinga, kikou husa zong a umnawn sih ding hi; grep chilna khuh ah koiman uoin achilkhe nawn sih ding ua, grep la a akikouna uh ka tawpsahta hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Tuaziehin ka lungtangin gawsem ging bangin Moab asuun a, tualeh ka lungsim sung lam ah Kir-Hereseth suunna a um hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Tualeh munsangte a Moab ahing kisuhgim akimu chiengin, thungen dingin amunsiengthou ah ahing pei ding a, hinanleh alawching sih ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Tam thu nidanglai a Moab tungtang a, Mangpa’n ana gensa ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Hinanleh tuin Mangpa’n ana genta a, “Kilaw mite kum sim banga sim a, kum thum sungin Moab thupina leh amipi zousiete toh simmawhuoi tah a bawl in a um dinga, asuohta sunte zong tawmnou khat ahi ding ua, azawngkhal mama ding uhi;” achi hi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="17" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Tami Damaska khopi tungtang a puohgih kigen khu ahi. Ngaiun, Damaska khu khopi ahina atawpta dinga; tualeh innchim kisevum ahita ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Aroer khopite zong nuasie in aumta a, belamhonte gamtatna ahita dinga, khunah alum ding ua, koiman azausah nawn sih ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Ephraim apat in kulpite abei dinga, Damaska akipat in leenggam abei ding hi. Tualeh Siria mi ashimawh umsunte khu Israel tate thupina ahita ding uhi, galkapte Mangpa’n achi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Tuani chiengin Jakob na thupina suhngiemin aum dinga, tualeh atahsa thauna zong ahing gawngta ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Tuachi’n bu lapa’n bu vuite akhut a alah a butangte alahkhawm bang ahi ding hi; tualeh Rephaim phaijanga buvui lapa bang ahi ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Hinapiin grep sang kinuasie bangin a um nalai dinga, mi’n Olive sing anuhthop chienga adawn dang lam a aga ni leh thum toukhat um bang in, abazamte dawnlam ah li tou nga tou aum ding; Israelte Mangpa Pasian in achi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Tua ni chiengin mi’n ama siempa lam a en dinga, Israelte Misiengthoupa azatat ta ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Aman akhutsuoh uh maitamte a en nawn sih dinga, akhutme ua abawl uh Ashera songlaite ahisihleh gimnamtui halna maitamte zong azatat nawn sih ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Tua ni chiengin a khopi dettahte u’khu adawn vum a singba kinuasie leh Israelte zieh a ataisansa uh munte abang dinga, lou gam asuoh siengta ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Aziehpen na hundamna uh Pasian na manghilta ua, na hatna uh suongpi na theipha nawn sih uhi. Tuaziehin singkung kilawmtahte nasuon ding ua, tuanah aba tuomte phut lut in na zop ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Na suonni in na khangsah pai dinga, tualeh zingmawng chiengin na chi na pahpalsah ding hi; hinanleh bu lahna khu lungkhamna leh natna thupitah ahi ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Tuipi luong ging banga, mipi tampi husa neite aw, tualeh tuipi hattah luong ging banga ging zoizoi namte na tung uh agih hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Namte tui tampite luong ging bangin ging henhon bang nan uleh Pasian in amaute aphawh dinga, gamlapi ah ataimang ding uhi. Muol tunga bushi huiin amut leeng bang leh pingpei mai a sil khat kilia bangin del in a um ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Tuachi’n envawi, nitah lam in sietna chizat huoi ahing tunga, phalvah masangin ama aum nawn sih hi. Tami ei hing bulute tanvou ahi a, ahing tomgamte vang etna ahi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="18" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Ethoipia gam luigal lam a, ahazah lim nuoi a um gam tung agih hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Tuipi tunga kibawl gunkuongte a palai sawlte, Nou thangkou taihatte aw, din sang zetzot leh vun mam het hot namte kungah peiun, achiil apat a tutan a nam zauhuoite kungah peiun; nam thahat leh guoltungtuong agam uh luiten akhenzah gam ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Nou khovel a um zousiete leh leitunga tengte aw, muol tunga chiemtena diallap akhai laiin enun, tualeh pengkul amut chiengin ngai un.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Aziehpen Mangpa’n ka kungah tambangin agen hi, “Kei pen ka kitawldam dinga, ka tenna mun akipat in ka gal et dinga nisa tang nuoi a kholum siengtah bangleh bulah kholum lai a meizun bangin ka gal et ding hi,” achi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Aziehpen grep law hun masanga, apate aheu a, apate grep puom ahing suoh hun chiengin, Aman azihdawnte khu aheuna temta in a attan ding hi, tualeh abazamte aheungim ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Tuate khu muol a sasiel ne vate leh gamsate adinga nuasie ahi ding uhi. Sasiel ne vate’n tuate nipi sungin ann in asen ding ua, leitung gamsaten phalbi sungin ann in asen ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Tua hun chiengin mi sang zehzawhte leh vun mamte leh achiil apat a tutan a nam ginhuoiten galkapte Mangpa kungah silpiehte ahing tawi ding a, nam thupi totden a um, agam uh luiten akhenzah ten, galkapte Mangpa min umna Zion muol ah silpiehte ahing tawi ding uhi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="19" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Izipt tungtanga puohgih kigen khu, Ngaiin, meipi hattah tunga tuongin Izipt gam tungah ahing tung dinga, Izipt mite lungtang asung uah a zunmang ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Izipt mite leh Izipt mite ka kidousah dinga, michin in ama sanggampa adou dinga, michin in ama innveng adou dinga, khopi leh khopi akidou dinga, leenggam leh leenggam akidou ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Tualeh Izipt mite hagau asung uah ahawmguoh in a um dinga, alemguotna uh ka suse ding hi. Tuachi’n milimte leh bum siemte, dawi siemte leh aisan siemte a dong ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Tualeh Izipt mite khu thuneitu giloutah khat khut ah ka pekhe dinga, tualeh leeng ginhuoitah khat in atung uah vai ahawm ding hi, Mangpa galkapte Mangpa’n achi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Tuipi akipat tuite akang dinga, tualeh luipi akangsan dinga, agaw ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Lui dungte anamse dinga, kivenbitna luitate akiem dinga, pumpengte leh phaipheng phungte a gaw sieng ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Luipi gei leh luipi pieu a pumpeng kung poute leh luipi panga haichi kichiing zousie avuoi sieng dinga, nawmangin a um ding ua, a um nawnsih ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Nga man mite’n a suun ding ua, Nile luidunga ngakuoi khai mite zousie in akaa ding uhi, tualeh tui tunga lensepte’n zong athuohgim ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Tuathamlou in, puonmalngat khau bawl a nasemte alungke ding ua, tualeh puon vam gaan mite azala ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Aneh suina suongphum akise gawp dinga, tualeh sum law a nasem zousie alunggim ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Zoan vaihawm miliente amo tahtah uhi; Pharaoh mipil lemguotpiten thu mothuoi ahil uhi. Bangchidan a Pharaoh kunga, “Kei mipil tapa ka hi, khanglui lai a leengte tapa ka hi,” nachi thei ahiei?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Hei sunga um ahi uoi? Na mipilte heilang a um ahi uoi? Tu in galkapte Mangpa’n Izipt gam tunga asiltup amauten thei uhenlen hing hil uleh asih diei!
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Zoan miliente ahing mota uh a, Noph miliente solzouin a umta uhi; agam sunga namte kingahna Izipt khu puimangin a umta hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Mangpa’n Izipt mite lah ah lung-apna hagau akoi a, tualeh zukhammi aluoh a ahawi dengdong bangin, Izipt mite anasep chinteng uah abawlkhiel sahta hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Izipt mite adingin lutangin ahiei, meiin ahiei, tumsing ba in ahiei, pumpengin ahiei, bawlpieh thei bangma a um nawn sih ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Tuani chiengin Izipt mite numei abang ding ua, galkapte Mangpa’n atung ua akhut athinkhum ziehin zau in achitun ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Tualeh Juda gam khu Iziptte adingin chizat-huoitah ahi dinga, amin uh loukha pouma azau ding uhi, atung ua tung ding galkapte Mangpa silguotte ziehin.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Tua ni chiengin Izipt gamsunga khopi ngate, Kanaan ham in aham ding ua, galkapte Mangpa kungah akichiem ding uhi; khopi khat khu sietna khopi akichi ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Tua ni chiengin Izipt gam laikim tah ah Mangpa dingin maitam khat a um dinga tualeh agam zul ah Mangpa adingin suongkhuom khat akiphut ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Tua suong kiphut khu Izipt gam a galkapte Mangpa adingin chiemtena leh theipitu ahi ding hi; aziehpen sugenthei mite ziehin Mangpa ahan ding ua, tualeh aman amaute adingin hundampa silbawtheitah leh hattah, asawl dinga, tuachi’n amauh ahundoh ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Tuachi’n Izipt ah Mangpa akitheita dinga, tuani chiengin Izipt miten Mangpa atheita ding ua, kithoina leh sillat alan ding ua, Ahi, Mangpa kungah akichiem ding ua, atangtun ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Tualeh Mangpa’n Iziptte asat dinga, avothop dinga, asudam ding hi; tualeh Mangpa kungah ahing kinuale kia ding ua, Aman angetna uh angaikhe dinga, amauh adamsah ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Tua ni chiengin Izipt akipat in Assiria gam tan dongin lamlien khat a um dinga, tuachi’n Assiriate, Izipt gam ah ahaw ding ua, tualeh Iziptte zong Assiria gam ah ahaw ding uhi. Tuachin Izipt miten Assiriate toh Pasian nna asemkhawmta ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Tua ni chiengin, Israel, Izipt leh Assiria toh thumte lah a khat ahi dinga, agamsung uah guolzawlna ahita ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Galkapte Mangpa’n “Ka mi Iziptte leh ka khutsuoh Assiriate leh ka goutan Israelte guolzawl in um hen,” chiin aguolzawl ding hi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="20" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Assiria leengpa Sargon in a galkap lamkai lienpen Tartan asawl lai a, Ashdod ahing tun kum in, Ashdod adou a, alata hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Tuami hunlai main Mangpa’n Amoz tapa Isai kam zangin thu agen a; “Kuon inlen na kawng a sai-ip puon sutkhie inlen, na kenga kedap sutkhie in,” chi’n agen hi. Ama’n tuabangin abawl a, guohtang leh keng guoh in apei hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Tuachi’n Mangpa’n “Ka suohpa Isai in Iziptte tung leh Ethiopiate tunga chiemtena leh sillamdang ding a, kum thum sung saguoh leh kedap but lou a avah bangin,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Assiria leengpan Izipt mi suongkul taangte leh Ethiopia saltangte ateh akhangin saguoh leh keng guoh in, tualeh tawdoh sain Iziptte zalahna dingin apuimang ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Tuachi’n akinepna pen uh Ethiopiate leh akithupisahna pen uh Izipt ziehin lunggim leh maizum in a umta ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Tua ni chiengin tami luipi gei a teng te’n En un, i muonpen leh eite hing panpi ding leh hing hunkhe dinga itaina uh Assiria lah hichi ahita a, bang ichi suohtatta ding uoi?” achi ding uhi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="21" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Tuipi gei a gamdai puohgih khu tami ahi: Simlam a pingpei apeisuoh bangin, gamdai akipat leh gam zauhuoi a kipat in ahing pei hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Mengmuna lunggim huoitah ka kungah phuon in a uma, lepchietah a bawl miin lepchietah in abawl a, mangthaisah mi in amangthaisah hi. Aw Elam peitou in, Aw Media imkhum in, Keima’n athum leh maunate uh ka beisah ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Tuaziehin ka kawng natna in adim a, numei nauvei natna bangin, natna in ahing manta hi; ka zah in ka kunsuh a, ka mu in kalungkham hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Ka lungtang abata a, zauna in ahing chizasahta hi; ka ngahla zan khu, kei a dinga zauna zan asuohsahta hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Annkuong lui unlen, galvenna innsangah veng mi koi unlen, ne unlen dawn un, nou miliente aw, thou unlen lum khu sathau nu un!
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Aziehpen Mangpa’n ka kungah tambangin agen hi, “Pei inlen galveng mi koi inlen, ama’n amu pouma phuongzah heh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Tualeh ama’n sakolleng khat toh sakol tung tuong kop khat leh sabiltung leengkai leh sangawngsau leengkai amu a, pilvang tah leh ngaisahna thupitah toh angai khe kilkel hi.”
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Tuachi’n humpibahnei bangin akikou a, “Ka Mangpa sun chiengin galvenna innsang tungah ka ding ngitnget a, zan chinin ka galvenna mun ah ka um ngitnget hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />En vawi, tanah sakolleng a tuong mi leh sakol tungtuong mi akop-kop in ahing pei uhi, chiin akikou hi. Tualeh Ama’n ahing dawnga, “Babilon apuata, apuata amilim bawlthute zousie, lei lah ah akeehzahta hi,” achi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Aw ka buphuol, ka phuol a butang zapsiengsate galkapte Mangpa, Israelte Pasian akipat a ka zah noute kungah ka phuongzahta hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Dumah tungtanga puohgih khu tami ahi. Aman Seir muol a kipat in kei ahing han a, “Galvengpa zan bang achi tai? Galvengpa zan bang achi tai?” a chi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Galvengpa’n a dawnga, “Zingmawng hiding hita tualeh zan zong hing tung hita, na kan nop leh kan inlen, hing kilekia in” achita hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Arabia puohgih khu tami ahi, Aw Nou Dedan mi ahonhon a khuolzin Arabia gamlah ah na gieh ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Aw Tema gam a tengten, dangtahte a dingin tui ahing tawi ua, ataimangte tanghou toh ana lamdawn uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Aziehpen amauh namsaute leh namsau kidohsate akipat, thalpi kiluoisa akipat leh kidouna huoisetah akipat a taimang ahi uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Aziehpen Mangpa’n tambangin ka kungah agen hi, “Sum thalawte kum sim banga sim, kum khat sungin Kedarte thupina zousie abei ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Tualeh thalkap lah a suohta umsun leh Kedar mite lah a mihat phaza akiem hiei hiei ding hi; aziehpen Israelte Mangpa Pasian in ana gensa ahita hi,” achi hi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="22" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Mengmuna phaijang puohgih tami ahi. Bang nachi na uh ahiei, na bawn ua inntunga na kaltou sieng uh?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Lungnopna husa a dim noute, khopi nunnuom leh khopi buoi vengvungte, na mi kithatte namsau a kithat ahisih a, kidouna a shi zong ahisih uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Na vaihawmte zousie ataizah khawmta ua, thalkap mite kaan in a um uhi, Nangma sung a um zousie kaankhawm in a um ua, gamlapi apat a taimangte khu.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Tuaziehin Ken, “Hing ensih unlen lelam en un, ka mite tanute gallah a kilate zieha hasetah a kap ut kahi, hing hamuon buoise vanglah da mai un,” ka chi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Aziehpen Mangpa galkapte Pasian akipat in Mengmuna phaijangah mangbatna, totchilna leh chimawna ni ahia, kulbangte suhchipna ni leh muolte kunga kikouna ni ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Elam in thaltangbawm akuo a, sakolleng leh sakol tungtuongte toh, Tualeh Kir in alum adawhsah hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Tualeh na phaijang deipente sakolleng in adim dinga; Tualeh sakol tungtuong mite zong khopi kulpikotpi ah galdou dingin akichieng uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Aman Judate kihumbitna ahohkhie a, tualeh tua ni in gammang inn a galvan kikoikhawmte na enta uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />David khopi sietna zong na muta a, tua khu tampitah ahi, tualeh tuikhuh hangtazaw tuite na kholkhawmta uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Tualeh Jerusalem a innte na sim ua, kulbang huhna dingin innte na phelsie uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Tuikul lui a tui umna dingin, kulpibaang nite kikaal ah tuibem na bawl ua, hinanleh tuami bawlpa na en sih ua, nidanglai a abawl dingdan na ngaituopa zatatna malmal na nei sih uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Tua niin galkapte Mangpa Pasian in, kap ding leh suun dingin leh na sam uh heukieu ding leh sai-ip puon sil dingin ahing han ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Hinanleh ngaivawi, lungnopna leh nopbawlna, bawng gawnate, belam thate sa nehnate leh zudawnnate a umzawta hi; “I ne un idawn ding uhi, aziehpen zing chienga shi ding ihi uh,” achi uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Galkapte Mangpa Pasian in kabil ah tami ahing hil hi; “Pellou in tami tatkhielna khu na shi masangsie un, ngaidam ahi nawn sih ding hi,” galkapte Mangpa Pasian in achi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Galkapte Mangpa Pasian in tambangin agen hi; “Pei inlen, tam sumkempa a innkuon sung ua thuneipa Shebna kungah vagen in.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Tanah bang na nei ei, tualeh koi na nei a ahiei? Mi’n ama a dinga mun sanga han akikhuoh bang leh, suongpi a umna ding akikhuoh banga, tam mun a han na kikhuoh ahiei mah?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Ngaiin, Mangpa’n nang ahing man dinga ahing paimang ding hi; a hing man dinga ahing tudet ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Pellouin Aman nang ahing peilumlet dinga, gam lienpi sungah bawlung bangin ahing seplut ding hi; khunah na shi dinga, tualeh na thupina sakolleng khu napu innsung maizumna ahita ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Tuachi’n na panna sangtah akipat in ka hing notkhe dinga, tualeh na dinmun apat in ka hing luoikhe ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Tua ni chiengin Hilkiah tapa ka suohpa Eliakim ka han ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Tualeh na leeng puontuol ama ka silsah dinga, na kawnggahin ama ka suhat dinga, nagam vaihawmna thuneina akhut ah ka peta ding hi. Tuachi’n ama khu Jerusalem a umte leh Juda innkuonte a dingin pa ahita ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />David innkuonte chabi aliengkou ah ka koi dinga; tuachi’n aman ahong dinga, koiman akha sih dinga, akha dinga koiman ahong sih ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Ama khu mun khat a siakil khetdet bangin ka khendet dinga, tuachi’n ama khu apa innkuonte a dingin Mangtoupha thupitah ahi ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Apa innkuonte thupina leh ahah-asuonte thupina zousie leh bel leh kuong aneu a lien, hengkuong akipat tuibel tanpha in ama tungah akikhai ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Galkapte Mangpa Pasian in, tua ni chiengin siakil mundettah a kikildette khu bawdoh in a um dinga, sattan ahi ding, apua ding a, tualeh atunga puohgih khu satkhiehin a um dinga, aziehpen Mangpa’n agensa ahi.”
  </para>
  <chapter number="23" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Tai-ar tungtanga kiphuong puohgih tami ahi, Nou Tarshish tembawte, kap in mau un, Aziehpen khopi sung lutna ding tembawh khawlmun umlou khop a susiet in a umta hi; Saipras gam a kipat in amaute kungah suhlat in a umta hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Nou tuipi panga tengte aw sip dide un, Aw Sidon gam a summet bawlte, na thupote un tuipi gal akaita uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Sidon in Shihor akipat buchi tuilienpi tungah ahing puo a, Nile luipi bulahte khu Tai-ar adinga sum muna ahi a, namte a dinga summet bawlna mun ahita hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Aw Sidon, maizum in, Aziehpen tuipi in thu agenta hi, tuipi thahatna in, “Nauvei natna ka thuoh ngaisih a, tate zong ka hing ngai sih hi tangvalte lah ka khoilien sih a, nungah siengthoute zong ka vahlien sih hi.”
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Tai-ar khopi puana thu Izipt gama hing tung azah chiengun, nauvei bangin athuoh ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Tarshish ah galkai unlen, tuipi panga tengte kap in mau un.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Tami hi maw na nopsahna khopi uh, tanglai nite khutsuoh ahita bou hi; akengte in gamlapi a um ding a pui zel khu?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Manglukhu khusah a um Tai-ar khopi tungtang a thuhil ding koi ahiei? Asummet bawlte lah milien ngen ahi ua, summet bawla kivaite lah leitunga mi zatat-huoi ngen ahi uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Galkapte Mangpa’n thupina leh kiletsahna zousie loingiem ding leh zatat-huoi lou a koi a, leitunga mizatat huoite khu simmaw huoitah a bawl dingin ana guot zouta hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Aw Tarshish tanu, Nile luipi bangin na gam sung ah luonglet in, thahatna a um nawn sih hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Tuipi tungah akhut azah a, leenggamte akiling sah hi. Mangpa’n Kanaan gam tungtangah akulpite uh suse dingin thu apeta hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Tualeh Ama’n, “Aw nang nungah siengthou bawlsiet a um Sidon tanu aw, lungnuom in na kipah nawn sih ding hi, thou inlen Saipras gam ah galkai in khunah zong khawldamna na mutuom sih ding hi.”
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />En in, Kaldai mite gam, tam mite aum nawn sih uh; Assiriaten gamdai a gamsate umna dingin abawlta uhi, Galvenna inn sangte alam ua, leeng innpi huongsungte abawl ua asuse dimdem uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Nou Tarshish tembawhte aw, kap in mau un, Aziehpen na hatna uh suhsiet in a umta hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Tua ni chiengin hichi ahi dinga, leengpa khat damsung kum sawm sagi bangin Tai-ar khu kum sawm sagi manghil in a um ding, Kum sawm sagi abei chiengin, Kizuanu la bangin Tai-ar tungah ahing tung ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />“Nang kizua manghil a umnu, kaiging la inlen, khopi sungah vah kawikawi inlen, ginglawm ngaitah bawl inlen, thei ngitnget a na umna dingin la ngai tampi sa-in.”
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Kum sawmsagi abei chiengin hichi ahi ding, Mangpa’n Tai-ar ave ding a, tuachi’n amanu khu asum lawna ah anua kia dinga, leitung pumpi leenggam zousie lah ah akizua ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />A metna leh asum lawsate, Mangpa adinga siensuo ahi ding, koikhawm ahiei kholkhawm ahiei ahisih ding a, aziehpen amanu sum mu khu Mangpa mai a, umte a ding ahi dinga niengtah a neh ding leh, puonsil hoitah kichingtah a, asil theina ding uh ahi ding hi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="24" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Ngaiin, Mangpa’n leitung ahawm in abawl a, tenna giehna lou in a umsah a, alumlet a, asunga tengte zong athethangta hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Tualeh hichi ahi ding, Mipite tunga um bangin siempu tungah zong a um ding, suohpa tunga umbangin apu tungah a um ding, Suohnu tunga umbangin azuapa tungah a um ding, Leitawi mi tunga um bangin leitawi sahmi tungah a um ding, Leibasahpa tunga um bangin leiba ba mi tungah a um ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Gam pumpi susiet dimdem leh ahawm a koiin a um ding hi; aziehpen Mangpa’n tam thu ana gensa ahita hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Leitungin asuun a, atulta hi, khovel aba gawpta a, atulta hi, Leitunga mi kisatheite zong abata uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Leitung zong asunga tengte nuoi ah abuata a; Aziehpen amaun dan abotseta ua; thupieh asulamdang ua, kumtawn thuhun asuseta uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Tuaziehin hamselawna in leitung apumvalta a, asunga tengte zong athulim nawn sih uhi, tuaziehin leitunga tengte meiin akata a, tawmnoukhat nuasie in a um uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Uoin tha atung nawn sih a, grepgui zong avuoi gawpta, tualeh lungtanga kipahte zousie thum in amau uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Khuongta tum a lungnop nate atawpta a, kipah a nopsahna husate asipta a, kaiging tum a kipahna zong adaita hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Zu dawn kawm in la asa nawn sih ding ua, Zuchia dawnten kha asata ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Buoina khopi susiet in a umta a, koima lut theilouna dingin inn zousie akikhata ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Kholaidungah zu duin akikou ding ua, lungnopna zousie lungkhamna asuohta a, gamsung lungnopna zousie abeita hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Khopi sungah sietna nuasie in a um a, kulkotpite satsiet in a umta hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Gamsunga mipite lah a hichibang ahing um chiengin, Olive singkung kinuhling bangin, tualeh grep ga law nua a asang um bangin a um ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Amaun aw ngaitahin Mangpa thupina ziehin la asa ding ua, tuipi akipat in ngaitah in akikou ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Tuaziehin zingmawng khovah ah Mangpa thupina pahtawi unlen, Israelte Mangpa Pasian tuipi panga gamte ah pahtawi un.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Leimong tawp akipat midihtatpa kungah thupina um hen chia la kisa ka zata uhi Hinanleh ken “Mangthang ka hita, mangthang ka hita, ka tung agih hi! Lepchietah a gamta ten, lepchietah in abawl ua, lepchietah a gamtaten nasatah a lepchie in abawl uhi,” ka chi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Leitunga teng noute aw, zaunate, kokhuhte leh thangte na tung uah a um hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Tualeh hichi ahing hiding hi, koipou thawmging zauhuoi apat taimangte kokhuh sungah ake dinga, tualeh koipou kokhuh laikim akipat kaltoute khu thangah a awh ding hi. Aziehpen tunglam a kottate honsa in a um a, leitung kingahna suongphumte zong akihotling hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Leitung nasatah a susiet in a um a, leitung akehgawpa akihong hi, tualeh leitung nasatah a suhlingin a um hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Leitung zukhammi bangin ahawi dong donga, sahle-hang dennan akinei dinga, buh e kihot bangin akihot ding hi. Asil bawlkhelnate atungah agih mama ding a, apua dinga, athoudoh nawn sih ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Tua ni chiengin hichi ahi dinga, Mangpa’n tunglam a mi vangliente agawt dinga, leitunga leengte zong agawt ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Tualeh suongkul a taangte kokhuh a agawmkhawm bangin, gawmkhawm in aum ding ua, tuachi’n suongkul a khakhum in a um ding ua, tualeh ni tampi nuachiengin gawt in a um ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Tua hun chiengin hapi azala dinga, tualeh ni zong amaizum ding hi, Aziehpen galkapte Mangpa’n Zion muol leh Jerusalem khuo a upate masangah, leeng hina toh thupitah in vai ahawm ding hi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="25" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Aw Mangpa nang ka Pasian nahi a, Ka hing pahtawi dinga, na min ka phat ding hi. Aziehpen nangman sillamdangte na bawl a, Ni danglai a na lemguotte khu, gin umna leh thutah ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Aziehpen, Nang khopite silsie kisiekhawm bangin na bawla, Kulpi nei khopite na susie a, gamdang mite leeng innpi, khopi hinawnlou dingin na bawl a, akilam tha kia nawn sih ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Tuaziehin mihatten nang ahing pahtawi ding ua, nam zauhuoitah khopiten nang ahing giing ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Aziehpen nangma mi zawngte thahatna na hi a, mitasamte leh lunggimte hatna nahi a, huipihat chienga kibuhna nahi a, nisat chienga limbel nihim nahi hi. Aziehpen hepina neiloute husa khu, huipi’n baang amut bang ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Mun gaw a kholum bangin, gamdangmite thawm na sipsah ding hi; kholum khu meilum him in alie vot bangin, mi zauhuoite lasah na sipsah ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Tualeh tam muol ah galkapte Mangpa’n mi zousie a dingin sil thaute in pawi abawl dinga, zuningkai leh ganta a thau mama chintuigute toh; tualeh zuning kikhai siengthou tuipen pen toh pawi abawl ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Tualeh Aman tami muol tungah mi zousie kikhuna puon, nam chinteng tunga kizah maikhuna khu hohkhie in asumang ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Ama shina khu kumtawn a dingin apumval dinga, tualeh Mangpa Pasian in mi zousie mai akipat in ahitui uh asia sieng pieh ding hi; tualeh leitung pumpi akipat in amite zalatna alamangta ding hi; aziehpen Mangpa’n tam thu agensa ahita hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Tua ni chiengin, “Ngai un, tami i Pasian uh ahi, Ama ahi ina ngah ngitnget uh, Ama’n eite ahing hundam ding hi; Tami ina ngahngah uh Mangpa ahi; Ahundamna ah ikipah in inuomta ding hi,” akichi ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Aziehpen tam muol tungah Mangpa khut akingata ding a, Moab khu bupawl eehthahna a akitotchil bangin Ama nuoi ah totchil in a um ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Tualeh tuizap miten banzah a tui azap bangun, Ama’n alah uah akhut azah dinga, tualeh Ama’n akiletsahna uleh alepchiena khut uh asat ngiem ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Na kulpi baangte leh kulpi sangtahte, Ama’n asungiem dinga, achimsah dinga, tuol lah ah leivui asuohsah ding hi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="26" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Tua ni chiengin Juda gam sungah tam la akisa ding hi, “Khopi muonhuoitah i nei ua, Pasian in hundamna khu kulbaangte leh kulpite a dingin aguot ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Nam dihtat, thutah zuite alut theina dingun, kulpi kotkhate hongun.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Na tunga lungtang kiptah a nga mi in nangma ahing muon ziehin, lungmuonna kim nei dingin na kem ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Mangpa khu kumtawn in muongun; aziehpen Jehovah ah tangtawn hatna a um hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Aziehpen Aman mun sangtah a umte aluoikhie a, khopi sangtahte aluoi ngiem a, Lei toh kikim in a sungiem a, Leivui lah ah aluoi ngiemta hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Kengin atuonchil ding ua, mi zawngte keng leh mi tasamte kalsuon in, atuonchil den ding hi.”
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Mi thudihte lampi khu dihtatna ahia, Aw Nang midihtat tawp in midih lampi khu, na guot pieh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Ahi, Mangpa aw, na vaihawmna lampi ah, Nangma ka hing ngah uhi, Ka hinna un alunggul khu Na min leh, nangma thei ngitngetna khu ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Zanlai chiengin ka hinna in Nangma ahing lunggul a, Ahi ka sunga ka hinna hagau in zingmawng matahin nangma ahing sui hi, aziehpen na vaihawmna leitunga a um chiengin, Khovel a tengten dihtatna azil ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Migilou pen deisah nanlachin, dihtatna azil tuomsih ding hi, dihtatna gam ah dihloutah in abawl ding a, Mangpa thupina amusih ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Mangpa na khut zahtou a aum chiengin, amusih ding uhi, hinanleh amu ding ua, mite athangsiet ziehun azum ding uhi, ahi, na galte mei in amauh akatum ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Mangpa kou a dingin galmuonna nang bawl pieh a, aziehpen ka nasep zousie uh nangma hing bawl pieh ngen ahibou hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Aw Mangpa ka Pasian uh, nangma chilou leeng dangten zong ka tung uah vai ahawm uhi, Hinanleh nangma ziehin kouten na min bou ka thei ngitnget ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Amaute a shita ua, ahing sih ding uhi, nihim bang bep ahi ua, athou nawn sih ding uhi. Tuaziehin amauh na gawta, na mangthaisahta hi. Tualeh amauh theizingna zong na sumangta hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Hinanleh Aw Mangpa nam na pungsah a, nam na supung a, Nangma pahtawi in na um hi. Nangman agamgite uh na kehlienta hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Aw Mangpa, mangbangin nangma ahing sui ua, Na gawtna atung ua atun chiengin, na mai ah thungetna anei zel uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Numei naupai anau nei hun kuon chienga, na sasenga kap a kipeh in a um a, Mangpa aw, na mitmu ah tuabangin ka um uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Nau ka pai ua, nauvei in na kasa ua, hui hingkhie bang bep ka hi uhi; leitungah tatdohna nasep bangma ka sem doh sih uhi; tualeh leitunga tengte zong apua sih uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Na mishite ahing kia ding ua, keima tahsa shisa luong toh athou khawm ding uhi. Nou leivui lah a umte aw, khanglou unlen, la saun, Aziehpen na daituite uh haichi daitui ahi a, tuachi’n leitungin mi shite adeldohta ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Ka mite hing pei unlen, na pindan sung uah lut un, tualeh kot kikhakhum unlen, lungthahna abei masangsie’n hun tomnou sung ki phuol tadi un.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Aziehpen Ngai un, agitlouna zieh ua leitunga tengte gawt dingin Mangpa a umna akipat in ahing pei hi. Tualeh leitungin atunga sisan kisuote agendoh dinga, tualeh atunga tha-a umte khukhum in a sel nawn sih ding hi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="27" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Tua ni chiengin Mangpa’n A namsau hiem, lien leh hattah in Leviathan gulpi leng leh Leviathan gulpi kiviel ngeungou a gawt ding a, Tuipi a gulpi athat ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Tua ni chiengin “Zu san piengsah grep-huon kilawmtah pahtawi in la sa un.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Kei Mangpa khu a vengpa ka hi a, hunchin in tui ka buoh a, Koiman asuhsiet louna dingin, sun leh zan in ka veng hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Lungthahna ka neisih a, louling neite leh khauling neiten, hing dou uleh aw, amauh ka palsuoh dinga, ka haltum khawm sieng ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Ahisihleh ahing kileppi theina dingin, ka hatna tudet hen, tuachi’n kilemna a bawl ding hi.”
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Hun hing tung dingah, Jakob in hui ahing hadinga, Israelte aselnou ding ua, apallun ding uhi, tuachi’n leitung pumpi aga in adimsah ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Ama vawte avuoh bangin, Israelte avota amah? Ahisihleh Ama kithana bangin, Ama tha in a umta amah?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Ama na sawlmang laiin ahun giap in ama na kinielpi a, suolam hui alaan niin ahu thupitahin ama na semmangta hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Tuaziehin tami’n Jakob khelna khukhum ahita dinga, tualeh tami akhelna zousie uh lahmangna bukim ga ahi ding hi. Maitam a suong zousie suongngot gawtguoi banga abawltah chiengin, Asherim leh gimnamtui halna maitamte ading nawn sih ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Kulpi dettah nei khopite suhmangin aum dinga, khuna tengte gamdai kinuasie bangin taisan in a um ding uhi, khunah bawngnoute agamta ding ua, khunah alum ding ua, abamengte ane khawng ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Abamengte avuoi a agaw chiengin hiehtawng ahi ding ua, numeite ahing pei ding ua, mei ah avang ding uhi. Aziehpen theisiemna neilou nam ahi ua, tuaziehin amauh siempa’n amauh ahepi sih dinga, amauh bawlpa’n amauh deisahna amusah sih ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Tuani chiengin hichi ahi dinga, Mangpa’n Euphrates luipi luong apat Izipt luita dongin agate asatkhe dinga, tualeh nou Israel tate aw khat khat a lahkhawm in na umta ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Tua ni chiengin pengkul thupitah ahing kimut dinga, Assiria gam a mangthai dinga umsate bang, Izipt gam a nawdoh a umte bang, ahing peita ding ua, Jerusalem muol siengthou ah Mangpa abeta ding uhi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="28" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Ephriam zukhamhatte leh kisahtheina manglukhu athupina kilawmna uh, pahpe vul kuon zu in athuzawgawp phaijang hausatah lutanga um, zu in aloingiem, tung agih hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Ngai in, Mangpa’n mihat leh silbawltheitah khat anei hi, Ama gielpi leh sietna huipi leh gamsung tummang tui luong hattah bang mai in akhut in tuolse nan anei ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Ephraim zukham hatte kisahtheina manglukhu uh kengnuoi a totden in a um ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Tualeh akilawmna thupitah, phaijang hausatah lutanga um khu, pape vul kuon bangleh nipi hing tun masanga theipi min masapen a entu in amu a, akhut a law pai a, anehkhawng pai bang ahi ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Tua ni chiengin galkapte Mangpa khu amite lah a suohta umsunte a dingin thupina manglukhu leh kilawmna lukhu ahi ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Vaihawmna ding a toupa adinga thudihna hagau ahi dinga, galphuol a kipat a kulpi kotpi lam zuon a hing pei kiate a dingin ama thahatna ahi ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Hinanleh amaun zu ziehin asukhielta ua zuchiatah khamin apua thop thop ua, siempute leh zawlneite zuchia khamin akilawmlia ua, amaute zukham in apua siengta ua, zu thuzaw in a um siengta uhi; zuchia akham ziehun apua thop thop ua, mengmuna dihloupi amu ua, vaihawmna ah akipalpua uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Dawkan tung zousie luoh leh silnieh ngen in adim a, kidahhuoi umlouna mun mawngmawng a umsih hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />“Koi ahiei theina hil ding, tualeh koi ahiei thuhilna atheisiem sah ding? Nawi neh tawpte leh nawi ngawlsate ahil ding uh adiei?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Aziehpen thuhilna tunga thuhilna, aguol tunga aguol, tanah tawmnoukhat, khunah tawmnoukhat.”
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Aziehpen Mangpa’n kam lamdang leh gam tuom mite ham in, tam mite kungah thu agen ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Amaute kungah, “Tami ahi khawldamna, thatawlte khawldamsah un, tualeh tami kisuhhalna ahi,” achi a, hinanleh amaun angaikhe ut sih uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Hinanleh amaute a dingin Mangpa thu khu thuhilna tunga thuhilna aguol guol a kichiengtou in tanah themkhat khunah tawmkhat ava pei ua, athalpua ua, akitatkeh gawp ua, thanga a awh na ding uleh mat a aumna ding uh ahita hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Tuaziehin nou mi simmawhatte, Jerusalem a tam mite tunga vaihawmte Mangpa thu ngaiun.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Aziehpen “Nouten shina toh thuhun ka bawl ua, mishikhuo toh kithukimna ka neita uhi, vuohna leh satna khauhuol in tuilien banga ahing luonkhum chiengin, koute ahing sukha sih ding hi, aziehpen zuouthu kibutna in ka nei ua, tualeh zuouthu nuoi ah ka kiphuol uhi,” nachi uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Tuaziehin Mangpa Pasian in tambangin agen hi, “Ngai un, Zion ah suong, suong etchiensa, aninga suong manphatah kingahna kiptah hiding suongphum dihtah ka phum hi. Koi hinanleh ama gingta pouma akin hehu sih ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Vaihawmna dih khu tena khau kahisah dinga, tualeh dihtatna khu atenadih sialum kikhaiin ka zang ding hi. Tuachi’n zuouthu a kibutna giel in aphietmang dinga, tualeh tuiten kibutna munte a tummang ding hi.”
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Tuachi’n shina toh na thuhun uh bangmalou asuoh dinga, tualeh mishikhuo toh na kithukimna uh apiching sih ding hi; tualeh vuohna leh satna khauhuol tuilien banga ahing let chiengin, totchil in na um ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />A hing luon chin-in noute ahing taimang zel dinga, zingmawng chin leh asun azan in aluong dinga, thutut umzie theisiemna khu zauna chizathuoi ahi ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Aziehpen lupna khu mi khat ki-zietzang na ding in atom senga, tualeh puonsil zong mi khat ki lukhuna dingin a neu seng hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Aziehpen anasep, chizat huoitah asep theina dingin leh asilbawl, chituom asep theina dingin, Mangpa khu Perazim muol a athaw bangin athou dinga, Gibeon phaijanga alungthah bangin alungthah ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Tuaziehin tuin simmawhatte hinawn sihun, tua asihleh na kolbute uh asudet semsem kha ding hi, aziehpen leitung pumpi nangawn suhmangthai ding a aguotsa ahi chi galkapte Mangpa Pasian apat in ka zata hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Bil daw unlen ka aw za un, ngaikhie unlen ka thugen za un.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Loukaipa’n buchithena dingin sunkhuoin lou akai amah? Aleikhalte sukehin asatnen ngitnget ngai amah?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Aloukaite azeljang zou chiengin leengmasel tangte athe sih amah? Tualeh pasikhawm tangte zong athe sih amah? Tualeh mim aguol guol in asuon a, sakolbu leh taang akiguotna munte ah athe sih uh amah?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />Aziehpen ama dihtah a thuhil in a um a, a Pasian in ama ahil hi,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />Aziehpen koiman busatna in leengmasel asat ngai sih a, pasikhawm tungah kangtalai keng lia in achilsah ngai sih uhi, leengmasel khu chiengkangin akisat a pasikhawm pen khetbuh in akisat hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />Tanghou dingin butang akigawtguoi a, Tuaziehin aman phuol ah achil ngaisih ding akangtalai keng leh sakolte chil sah in agawtvui ngai sih ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" />Tamte zong galkapte Mangpa, thumoppa lamdang leh pilna hoitah a, hing kipan ahi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="29" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Ariel aw Ariel David tenna khopi na tung agih hi, akum akum a belapin pawite avelvel in hing tung hen.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Hinapiin Ariel ka lunggimsah nalai dinga, tuachi’n ka leh mauna a um dinga, tualeh tami kei a dingin Ariel kana bang ahi ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Nangma douna dingin na kimkot ah giehphuol ka sat dinga, na kimkot ah leipal ka hing sekhum dinga, nangma douna dingin kulpite ka hing khokhum ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Nang pen puasah in na um dinga, lei lah akipat na ham ding a, na thugen lei vui lah akipat in ngiemnou in ahing pawtkhe ding a, na aw pen leinuoi akipat dawi aisan siemte aw abang ding hi, tualeh na thugen khu leivui lah akipata dapham abang giap ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Tuathamlou in nangma hing dou mipi tampite leivui nel bang ahi ding ua, mi zauhuoi mipite khu bushi leeng mang bang ahi ding uhi; Ahi, tuate khu mitphiet kaal in thakhat in ahing um ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Galkapte Mangpa’n vanpi ging leh zilling leh thawmging ngaitah toh kithuo pingpei leh huipi hattah toh, katum thei meikuong a noute hing gawt ding ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Ariel dou nam zousie, ama leh akulpi doute zousie nangawn leh ama sulunggimte zanlai a manglam a mengmuna bang ahi ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Mi gilkielten amang ua ann aneh ua, akhahlaw chieng ua agilva tuomlou bang ahi ding ua, ahisihleh dangta miten amang ua tui adawn ua, akhahlaw chieng ua aphattuomlou bangin Zion muol dou mite nam zousie mipite khu tuomi bang giap ahi ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Um khinkhien unlen, lamdang sa un; na mitte uh tosah unlen mitto in um un, akham uh a, hinanleh zukham ahisih uhi, ahawi vadong ua, hinanleh zukham a hawi vadong ahisih uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Aziehpen Mangpa’n imutduna hagau na tung uah ahing sungbuo hi; namit uh ahing singsahta a guolneite leh mutheite na lu uh ahing khukhumta hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Tuachi’n mengmuna zousie nou a dingin laibu a um thu kikhakhum, tua laibu laisim theimi kungah pie henlen, “Hepitahin hing simpieh in” kichi leh ama’n, “Ka simthei sih, akikhakhum ahi,” achi sanbang ahita hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Tuachi’n laibu khu laisim theilou mi khat kungah kipie in, “Hepitahin tam laibu sim vawi,” kichi leh ama’n “Lai kasiem sih,” achi zel hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />“Tuaziehin Mangpa’n tam miten kam in ahing nai ua, akam un ahing pahtawi ua, hinanleh alungtangun ahing gamlat uhi, tualeh keima ahing giinna ulah mihing thupieh leh kihil thaw maimai ahibou hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Tuaziehin ngaiin, tam mite lah ah sil lamdang ka bawl dinga, nasep lamdang, thumahtah khat, aziehpen a mipilte uh pilna amangthai ding a, tualeh amilunggel siemte uh theisiemna uh phuolguhin a um ding hi,” achi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Athuhilnate uh Mangpa akipat a phuol dinga, thuhtah sui mite atung uh agih hi; anasepte uh miel lah abawl ahi a, koi ahiei ahing mu ding? “Koi ahiei ahing thei ding?” achi uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Adihtahin silzousie na lebul siengta uhi Belkhengpa khu atungman bang lel a ngaisut in a um ding amah? Sil siem in asiemtu khu, “Ama hing siem hikoi sing achi thei diei”? Ahisihleh silbawldoh in abawldohpa khu, “Theisiemna mawngmawng nei vawtsih achi ding amah”?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Hun tomnoukhat nuachieng in Lebanon khu leihoi haichi pienna mun suohsah lou ding amah? Tua leihoi mun khu gammang lah banga ngaiin umlou ding ahiei mah?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Tua ni chiengin bilbingten laibu a thu umte azata ding ua, tualeh mit tote mit in miel nuoi leh khomiel lah apat in amuta ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Mi kingaingiemten zong Mangpa ah kipahna thupizaw anei ding ua, mipite lah a mi zawngten Israelte Misiengthoupa ah anuomta ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Aziehpen migilou zauhuoi lah bangmalou a bawlin a umta a, mi simmawhatte zong suhmang in a umta hi; tualeh silgilou bawl dinga ngahte zousie sattan in a umta uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Tua miten kamteng khat in mite asukhielsah ua, kulpi kotpi a thuhil mite awhna dingin thang akam ua, tualeh midih khu bangmalou in akiheimangsan zel uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Tuaziehin Mangpa Abraham tandoh pa’n Jakob innkuonte tungtang thu ah tambangin agen hi, “Jakob tuin amuolphou nawn sih dinga, amai muol nawn sih ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Hinanleh ka khut suoh atate alah ua, amu chiengin, ka min asiengthousah ding ua, Jakob Misiengthoupa khu asiengthousah ta ding ua, tualeh Israel Pasian agiingta ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Tualeh hagau lam a sil bawlkhielten zong ahing theisiemta ding ua, tualeh phunhatten thuhilnate apom siemta ding uhi.”
  </para>
  <chapter number="30" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />“Mangpa’n ta helhatte tung agih hi,” achi hi, “Mi dangte lemguotna ala ua, kei ahing dong sih uh, sil tup leh guon anei ua, Keima hagau akipat ahi sih hi, Khelna tunga khelna abelap theina ding bep uh ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Izipt gam ah a peisuh ua, ka thuhilna hing donglou in, Pharaoh hatna a kisuhat ding leh Izipt limbel ding muongin, achi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Tuaziehin Pharaoh thahatna khu na zumna uh ahi ding a, Izipt limbel ding na muonna ulah na zalatna uh ahi ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Aziehpen alamkaite uh Zoan ah a um ua, apalaite uh Hanes ah ahing tung uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Amaute aphattuompilou ziehun, mipite zousie azum ding ua, ahisihleh panpina hilou, phattuomna hilou, hinanleh zumna leh minsietna ahi zaw ding hi.”
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Simlam gamsate tunggihna buoina leh lungkhamna gam, tuana kipat in humpibahnei nu leh humpibahnei, gul gupha leh gulpi leengtheite ahing pawtdoh ua, ahausatnate uh sabiltung hatlai tungah apuo ua, tualeh sangawngsau thu-vum tungah agoute uh posahin, ama ua dinga phattuomna neilou mite kung lam ah apeipi uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Iziptte panpina khu phattuomna bei leh bangmalou ahi dinga, tuaziehin Izipt khu “Rahab-Hem-Shebeth” ka chita hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Tuin pei inlen, amasang ua suongpeh tungah giel inlen, laibu ziel sungah giel in, tuakhu hun hing tung dingte a, kumtawn tan a chiemtena ahiden theina dingin.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Aziehpen amauh mi helhatte, ta zuoutheite leh Mangpa dan ngaikhe nuomlou tate ahi uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />“Mutheite kunga mu sih un,” guolneite kunga “Genlawhna dihtah hing hil sih un, azahnop huoi lamlam gen unlen, kisolna thuzuou genlawh un.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Lampi dih nuasie unlen, lamdih apat kiheimang unlen, Israel Mi Siengthoupa ka masang ua kipat sumang un chi ngitnget te.”
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Tuaziehin, Israelte Mi Siengthoupa’n tambangin agen hi; “Tam thu na simmaw zieh uleh nuoisie na leh suhgentheina na muon ziehun tuate ah na kinga uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Tuaziehin tami gitlouna khu noute a dingin kulbang sangtah khi khang chim dinga kisa puoh kengkung thakhat a chim ding bang ahi ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Tualeh aman belkhengpa bel asatguoi dimdem bangin asatguoi ding a, akhawisih ding hi; tuachi’n athemnengte lungthukhua apat mei luohna ding leh tuikhuh akipat tui sawhna ding athem nangawn umlou,” bang ahi ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Aziehpen Mangpa Pasian Israelte Mi Siengthoupa’n tambangin agen hi. “Nua kia unlen khawldam in um ulachin hundam in na um ding ua, dai dide a muonna leh gintatna in na hatna uh ahizaw ding hi; hinanleh na ut sih uhi.”
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Nouten, “Hilou e! Sakol tunga tuongin hattah in ka taimang zaw ding uhi,” na chi uhi, tuaziehin taimang ngut ve ua, “Tualeh sakol hattah tungah i tuong ding nachi u’maw!” Tuaziehin nou hing nuadelten hattah in ahing nuadel ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Mi khat phawn in mi sangkhat ataizah ding ua, mi nga phawn in na taimang ding uhi; muol vum a diellap khaina mung kiphut bang leh muol tunga puonlap kinuasie bang na hi masangsie un na taizah ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Tuaziehin noute ahing hepi theina dingin Mangpa’n noute ahing ngah ding a, tuaziehin na tung ua lainatna anei theina dingin tawisangin a um ding hi. Aziehpen Mangpa khu dihna Pasian ahi a, Ama ngah zousie ahampha uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Jerusalem a teng Zion mite aw, na kap nawn sih ding uhi. Aman na kaa ging husate ua pat in pellou in ahing hepi mama dinga, azahtah chiengin ahing dawng ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Mangpa’n lungkham mangbatna ann leh gimthuohna tui hing na pe nanleh, nou hing zilsah na Siete uh akibu nawnsih ding ua, na mit un noute hing hil na siete uh amuta ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Na zietlam uh ahiei na veilam uh ahiei a na pieltah chiengun, “Tami lampi ahi tanah pei un,” tami zuiun chiin na nualang ua pat na bil un aw khat na za ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Tualeh dangka tui a na luon uh na milimte uleh sana tui a na milim khenthute uh na zepna uh na buasah ding ua, sil nieh bangin na paimang ta ding ua, amaute kungah “Peimangun” nachita ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Tuachi’n Aman buchi lei a natu dingte ua dingin guotui ahing pe dinga, lei a silpiengte apat ann hoitah, pungtah leh atam atam ahi dinga, tua ni chiengin na ganta honte uh gamtatna mun lienpi ah agamta ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Tuamabangin bawngtalte leh sabiltung loukaiten ann chisawsa, suohdul leh phazapa kizap siengsa ane ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Kithana thupitah ni chienga, galvenna inn sangte achip ni chiengin, taang sang chinteng leh muol sang chinteng tungah luipite leh luitate aluong ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />Tuathamlouin Mangpa’n amite kisuhliemna maa atuom pieh a, aliemna maa uh asuhdampieh ni chiengin, ha vah khu ni vah abang dinga tualeh ni vah zong alesagi in, ni sagi vah kigawm bang tuh in avah ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />Ngaiun, Mangpa min khu gamlapi akipat in alungthahna meikuong leh apuohgih tahtoh ahing pei hi; akam khu thangpaina in adim a, tualeh alei zong mikatum thei meikuong bang ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />Anah hu khu luitui luonglet ngawng chieng tum bang ahi ding a, manthaina lawpi a sep a, namchinteng khenzah dingin, namchin kam ah suhkhel sahna kamkaina khau avaw dinga tuami’n mite apielmangsah ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" />Pawi siengthou zan lai a na bawl lai ua, la kisa bangin la nasa ding ua, tualeh Mangpa muol siengthou a, Israel Mihatpa kunga tung dinga, theile toh apei lai ua, lungsim kipahna anei bangun lungtang kipahna nanei ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" />Mangpa’n a aw thupitah akiza sahta dinga, alungthahna huoisetah toh, mi katumthei meikuong toh, huipi leh guopi toh, tualeh gielpi toh akhut a ami vuoh dan ahing ensahta ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" />Mangpa aw thupitah ziehin, khetbuha misat zelpa Assiria khu susiet dimdem in a umta ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" />Tualeh Mangpa’n gawtna chienga amauh asatna mun tengah khuong leh zam ging abang ding a, tualeh kidouna ah akhuttumin adou ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" />Aziehpen Mangpa’n lai peh akipat Tophet aguotsa ahi, Ahi leengpa a dinga guot ahia; athuh athuh, a let alien a ana bawl ahi. Asil koikhawm khu mei leh singtampi ahia; kaat luiluong bangin Mangpa huu in akuong sah vapual ding hi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="31" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Panpina ngen dinga Izipt gam a peisuhte tung agih hi, Sakolte muonga, asakollengte uh tamna muonga, a sakol tungtuongte uh thahat mama na muonga, Israel Mi Siengthoupa lam enlou a, Mangpa sui loute tung agih hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Hinanleh Ama zong piltah ahi a, sietna atungsah dinga, athu gensa aheng sih dinga, hinanleh silgilou bawlte innkuon, dou ding in akipan dinga, khelna bawl mite panpite zong a dou ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Iziptte khu mihing ahi ua Pasian ahi sih uhi, Asakolte u’zong hagau ahi sih a, tahsa ahibou uhi; Mangpa’n aban azahtou chiengin, panpina apua dinga, Panpi a umpa zong apua dinga, ani un amangthai khawm ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Aziehpen Mangpa’n ka kungah, tambangin thu agen hi, Humpibahnei ahum ham a, Humpibahnei lunlai asamat tungah ahum ham hi; Belam chingmi tampite dou dingin, akihatkhawm chiengun, a aw ziehun azau sih dinga, athawmging un asubuoi sih ding hi. Tuachimabangin galkapte Mangpa khu Zion taang leh, amuolte panpi dingin ahing peisuh ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Vaten abu venga a len kawi bangun, galkapte Mangpa’n Jerusalem avengdinga, aven kawmin atandoh dinga, apeikan kawm in ahumbit ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Israel hahlesuonte aw, nasataha na helsanpa uh langah hing kinuahei kiata un,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Aziehpen tuami ni chiengin michin in, na khelna khut ua na bawlthu uh dangka milimte leh, sana milimte na paimangta ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />“Tuachi’n Assiriate khu mihat satpua hilouin, namsau in apua ding ua, mihingte namsau hilou in amauh athatgam ding a, hinanleh namsau akipat ataimang dinga, tualeh akhanglaite uh autlou sasa ua, nasepsah teitei in a um ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Zauna ziehin kulpi kaan in atai ding ua, chiemtena puonlap ziehin a miliente uh azau ding uhi,” tualeh Mangpa meikuong Zion ah a um a, Jerusalem ah haltuina meilipi a um hi, Mangpa’n achi hi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="32" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Ngaiin, dihtat tah a vaihawm leeng khat ahing um ding hi, tualeh milien vaihawm miten dihna toh vai ahawm ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Mi khat huipi lah a kibutna mun leh guopi lah a bitna bang ahi dinga, mun gawa tuiluong bang leh thatawlna gam a suongpi lim bang ahi ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Tualeh amute mit amiel sih dinga, azate bil in angaikhe ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Mi nawthomte lungtangin theina atheisiemta dinga, tualeh mi dang awhte lei chientahin aham theita ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Mi mote khu mikiphal a kichinawn sih ding ua, michippawngte zong mipha achi nawn sih ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Aziehpen mi gilouten thu agen ding ua, alungtang un thulimlouna nna asem ua, Pasian ngaisahlouna abawl ua, Mangpa demna’n thudihlou agen ua, gilkielte anndu a taisahlou in akoi ua, tuidu a dangtate tui dawnsah louin akoi uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Milepchiete lunggel silgilou ahi a, asiltup giloute un mi zawngte leh tasamten thudih agenlai nangawn un zong zuouthu a suhsiet ding dan angaituo nalai uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Hinanleh misilphal in vang silphallam angaituo ding ua, silphaltah in ading det ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Nou numei noplening a umte aw, thou unlen, ka aw ngaikhie un, nou noplening a um tanute aw, ka thugen ah bil daw un.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Nou noplening a um numeite aw, kum khat leh ni bangza ahiei nua chiengin, na buoi ding uhi; aziehpen grep ga alawsam dinga, aga khopkhawm ding a umsih ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Numei nop lente aw chitun unlen, noplening a umte aw, na puonsilte uh hawhkhie unlen, guohtangin um unlen na kawng uah sai-ip puon teng un.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Lou hoi deihuoite leh grepgui ga nuom mamate itna ziehin miten a awm uh atum ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Ka mite gam loulingnei leh khaulingnei in, ahing poukhum dinga, Ahi, khopi nuom tah a, kipahna innte zong apoukhumta ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Leng innpi taisana a um ding ziehin, khopi sunga mitampi husa vengvung nuasie in a um dinga, tualeh kulpite leh inn sangte zong gam sabiltungte noptah a buolna leh ganhonte tatna ahi kumtawnta ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Tunglam akipat a hagau ka tung ua sunbuoh a um a, gamdai gamgaw zong ga piengsahthei lei hoi ahing hi a, tualeh ga piengsah leihoite gammang abah masangsie’n;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Tuachi’n gamdai ah thudih a vaihawmna a um dinga, tualeh dihtatna khu gamhoitah ah a umta ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Dihtatna nasep khu lemna leh muonna ahi dinga, tualeh dihtatna ga khu kumtawn a muonna leh kitheichienna ahi ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Ka mite galmuonga umna mun leh bitna mun ah ateng ding ua, tawldamna mun ah ateng ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Gammang tungah giel hing kesuh in, tualeh khopite suhngiem in um nanleh,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Tui luonna gei a haichi thete leh bawngte leh sabiltungte zalen tah a ha zelte, mi hampha na hi uhi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="33" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Nang mibulu a panga, bulu a um ngailou, lepchietah a bawla, lepchietah a bawl a umngailou, na tung agih hi mi bulu na tawp chiengun, noute min ahing suse ding ua, tualeh lepchietah a na bawlzou chiengin, lepchietah a bawl in na um ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Mangpa aw koute hing hepiin, nang ka hing ngah uhi. Zingmawng chin in ka bantha un hing pang inlen, ka buoi hun chiengun zong ka hundamna uh hing hiin.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Thawmging hehu ah mipite ataimang ua, Nangma na hing kidop sangtah chiengin namte thezah in aum uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Na galvanlahte uh lungnou in sil alahkhawm bangin khopkhawm in a um dinga, khauphete akitawm duom duom bangun, amauh galvanlahte tungah akitawm ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Mangpa tawisangin a umta, aziehpen tunglam sangtah ah a um a, Aman Zion khu thudih a vaihawmna leh dihtatna in adimsahta hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Ama na damsung kingahna dettah ahi dinga, Hundamna, pilna leh theina kiningching mama ahi ding hi, Mangpa zaudan siemna khu Ama gou manpha ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Ngai un, mihangsante kholaidung lah ah patau in akikou ding ua, Lemna palaite hasetah in akap ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Lamliente zuilouin a umta a, khuolzin mi a um nawn sih hi, lemna thuhun abotsie a, kichiemnate asimmaw a, koima kizatatna a um sih hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Gam sung da leh kap in achimaw a, Lebanon maizum in avul ningniengta, Sahron lah gamdai gamgaw asuohta, Bashan leh Karmel in agate uh athing kheta uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Mangpa’n, “Tuin ka thou dinga,” tawisangin ka um ding a, “Ka kitawisang ding hi, achi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Bushi naupai in na pai ding ua, bupawl na hingdoh ding uhi, na nah hu un meikuong bangin, nouma ahing katum ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Tualeh mipite lah lungngou haltum bang ahi ding ua, loulingnei mei in akahtan chet chet bangin,” hal in na um ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Nou gamla tah a umte aw, ka silbawl za un, nainou khat a umte aw, ka hatna thei un.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Zion a mikhielte a zau ua, Pasian ngaisahloute zau a chitutna in amanta hi; I lah ua koi ahiei, katum thei meikuong toh um khawm thei ding? “I lah ua koi ahiei kumtawn a katum thei, meikuong toh um khawm ding?”
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Dihtattah a gamta mi leh thudih genmi, nuoisiena punna bangma a ngailou mi, golguhna sang dinga khut zankhelou mi, sisan suona thuza nuomlou a bilhum mi, sil hoilou en nuomlou a, amit singmi,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Tuabang mi khu tunglam sangtah ah ateng dinga, suongpite akiven bitna kulpi ahi dinga, tanghou pieh ahi dinga, adawn ding tui a um ngei ngei ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Na mitin leengpa kilawmna amu dinga, gamlapi a um gam amu ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Na lungtangin sil zauhuoite angaituo ding a, “Laigielpa hei a um ahiei? Atepa hei a um ahiei? Innsangte simpa hei a um ahiei?” achi ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Mi zauhuoite, a ham uh na theithei lou a ham mite, dang awh ham kitheichien lou a ham mite, na mu nawn sih ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />I pawi bawlna khopi Zion khu envawi, na mit in Jerusalem galmuonga tenna, biehbuh kisuondoh ngailou ding, akaidetna khetphimte bangchih tan a, bawdoh nawnlou ding leh, akhina khaute bangchihtan a tan ngailou ding, khu na muding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Tua mun ah Mangpa thupitah khu eite a ahita ding a, tuanah tembaw azapna chieng neite apei nawn sih ding a; tembaw lien leh thupite apei nawn sih ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Aziehpen Mangpa khu i vaihawmpa ahita ding hi. Mangpa khu eite dan hing pepa ahi a, Mangpa khu i leengpa uh ahi a, Aman eite a hing hundam ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Na tembaw khina khaute akolta a, apuonzahte amungah akikhidet thei nawn sih a, puonzah khu akizahpal thei nawn sih hi. Tualaitah in galvanlah tampi akihawm a, kengbaiten zong galvanlah ala uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Tualeh tua khuo a tengte’n, “Ka chi ana hi” achi sih ding ua, khuna teng mite thulimlouna ngaidam ahita ding hi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="34" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Nou namte aw, ngaikhe dingin hing naiun, nou mipite aw, ngaisah un! Leitung leh asunga um zousie in za uhen, leitung pumpi leh asung apat hing pawtkhie zousie in zong za uhen.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Aziehpen Namte zousie tungah Mangpa alungkim sih a, tualeh agalkapte uh zousie tungah athangpai a, amaute nasetah in asumang kilkel a, amaute tha dingin mithatte kung ah ape dohta hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Amithate uh paidoh in aum ding ua, amishi luongte ua kipat a-ui apawtkhe dinga, muolte a sisan utoh azun ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Van aasite zousie a zunmang ding a, vante zong laibu ziel bangin akiziel ding a, van aasite zousie grepgui akipat anate akieh bang leh theipi ga akung akipat apul bangin apulkhe ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Aziehpen ka namsau van ah silsieng ahi dinga, en in, Edom tung leh ka hamsiet mite tungah thukhen dingin ahing tung ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Mangpa namsau khu sisan in adim a, thauna a suhthau in a umta a, belamnoute leh kelte sisan in, belamtalte kala thauin: Mangpa’n Bozrah khuo ah kithoina anei a, Edom gam ah mithana nasatah anei hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Gam bawngtalte ama utoh ahing puisuh ding ua bawngtal tuoite leh bawngtal hattahte toh; agam un sisan akham ding a, aleivuite uh thauna a suhthauin a um ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Aziehpen Mangpa phubalahna ni ahia, Zion kalna lam thu a thuhna kum zong ahi ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Tualeh aluite uh long-nai asuoh dinga, aleivuite uh kaat asuoh dinga, agam uh zong long-nai meikah luoi luoi asuohta ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Sun leh zan in meikuong amit sih dinga, meikhu kumtawn in azamtou den dinga, akhang akhangin gamsung aseden dinga, koiman a zawtkha nawn sih ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Simbute leh sakuten tua gam aluo ding ua, simbupi leh va ahte zong atengta ding uhi. Mangpa’n atungah lungbuoigawpna khaujen ahung dinga, hawmguohna suong atungah akhai ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Amiliente uh leenggam ah ahan ding ua, hinanleh koima a umsih dinga, aleeng tapate u’zong bangma ahisih ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Tualeh lingte leeng inn huongsungah apouta dinga, akulpi sung uah ling leh khaute apouta dinga, si-alte leh gamva kengsangte tenna ahita ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Gamdai a gamsate leh si-alte akimutuo ding ua, sakelten alawm aguolte ahan ding ua, gamsa zantatte zong tuanah akhawl ding ua, ama a dingin khawlna mun akimuta ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Khunah simbupiin abu abawl dinga, atui atha dinga, akeu dinga, ahalim nuoi ah anoute a awpkhum ding hi; khunah langtate anupa-paun a um khawm ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Mangpa laibu sunga kipat suidoh unlen sim un: tam silte khat zong akimlou a um sih dinga, koppi neilou a um sih ding hi. Aziehpen Ka kam ngelngel in thu ka pie a, tualeh A hagau in tuate alakhawmta hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Aman ama ua dingin ai asan pieh a, akhut a tein ahawmpieh chiet a, kumtawn in anei den ding ua, akhang akhangin tuanah ateng ding uhi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="35" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Gamdai leh gamgawte ama uh ziehin, akipahta ding ua, gamgaw zong nuom in heisa bangin, apallunta ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Nasatah in apallun ding a, nuom a kipah in la asa ding a, Lebanon thupina khu, akunga piehin a umta dinga, Karmel leh Sharon kilawmna thupitah, Mangpa vangletna leh, i Pasian kilawmnathupitah amu ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Khut hatloute hatsah unlen, khup zawte zong khausah un.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Lungsim meipuote kungah, “Hattah in um unlen, zau sih un! En un, na Pasian uh phuba la dingin, ahing pei ding a, Pasian ngei khu thuhna toh, ahing pei dinga, noute ahing hundam ding hi,” chi un.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Tua hun chiengin mittote mit vahsah in a um dinga, bilbingten aza theita ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Tua hun chiengin kengbaite sakhi bangin, a kidieng ding ua, hamtheiloute lei in la asata ding hi; aziehpen gamdaiah tui ahing apuldohta dinga, gamgaw ah luite aluongta ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Sehnel sa mama mun zong diil a suoh dinga, tualeh gam dangtatah zong tuinah ahingsuoh dinga; si-al tenna leh lupna munte ah, hampa leh pumpeng, tualeh gulphitte apouta ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Tualeh khunah lampi leh lamlienpite aum ding a, tua khu Sienthouna lamlien akichi ding a, misienglouten tua lampi azui thei sih ding ua, hinanleh midangte a ding ahizaw ding hi. Tuami lampi zui mi mote nangawn zong, apielmang sih ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Khunah humpibahneite a um sih dinga, sa sielne mawngmawng khunah apeitou sih dinga, mu khah in a um sih ding hi. Hinanleh tatsate khunah avahkawi ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Tualeh Mangpa tatsate ahing kinuale kia ding ua, la sa kawm in, alutung ua kumtawn kipahna toh, Zion ah apeitou ding uhi. Amaun nopna leh kipahna amuta ding ua, lunggimna leh mauna aumnawnsih ding hi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="36" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Leengpa Hezekiah vaihawm kum sawm leh kumli achin kum in, Assiria leengpa Sennakerib Juda gama khopi kulpi nei zousie dou dingin ahing peitou a, alata hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Tuachi’n Assiria leengpa’n Rabshakeh galkap tampi toh Lakish apat in Jerusalem ah leengpa Hezekiah kungah asawl hi. Tualeh Rabshakeh khu dil sahtazaw a tuilahna kunga puonsopmite gamlam zotna lamlien ah a ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Tualeh leengpa innsung vaisaipa Hilkiah tapa Eliakim, laigielpa Shebna, tualeh tanchin gielpa Asaph tapa Joah, ama kungah haw dingin ahing pawtdoh uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Tuachi’n Rabshakeh in akung uah, “Hezekiah kungah gen un: Lengpa thupitah Assiria leengpa’n tambangin agen hi: Bang kimuonna nei na hiei mah, Koi muong na hiei mah? achi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Kidouna dinga thahatna leh lemgelna ka nei nachi viel a, thumanlou gen nahi bou hi. Tuin koi muonga ka tunga hel na hiei?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Ngaiin, tami pumpeng chiengkhut tawngsa Iziptte muong na hi; mi ama tunga akingap leh akhut sung asun dinga, Izipt leengpa Pharaoh khu ama muongte tungah tuabangin a um ngitnget hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />“Hinanleh Mangpa ka Pasian uh muong kahi uh” nachi viel uleh, Ama khu Hezekiah in Judate leh Jerusalem kunga, tami maitam masang maimai a, Pasian na bieh ding uh ahi, chia amunsangte uleh “Amaitamte uh asuhmang pieh khu hilou ahiei mah?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Tuaziehin tuin ka hing ngen ahi, ka pu Assiria leengpa kungah thu chiem inlen, tuachi’n atunga tuong ding mi na mungap pou u’leh sakol sang ni ka hing pe ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Bangchidan a, Sakolleng leh sakol tung tuong thu a Iziptte na muon a, ka pu suohte lah a lamkai neupen nangawn na nangzou na ding amah?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Tam gam dou ding leh suse dingin Mangpa tellou a hing kuontou ka hiei mah? Mangpa’n ka kungah tam gam dou dingin kuontou inlen, susegawp in ahing chi hi, chiin va gen un, achi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Tuachi’n Eliakim, Shebna leh Joah in Rabshakeh kungah “Hepitah in na suohte Siria ham in hing houpi in aziehpen ka theina uhi, kulbang tunga mite zahin ka kung uah Hebru ham in thu gen sin” achi uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Hinanleh Rabshakeh in: “Ka pu in na pu u’leh noute kung maimai a tam thute gen dinga ahing sawl ahiei mah? Kulbang tunga touten noute toh a eeh uh ne a, azun uh dawn dingte kunga zong tam thute gen dinga ahing sawl ka hisih amah?” achi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Tuachi’n Rabshakeh adingdoh a, Hebru ham in aw ngaitah in akikou a, akung uah “Leengpa thupitah, Assiria leengpa thu ngai un,” achi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Tambangin leengpa’n thu agen hi, Hezekiah sol in um sihun, ama’n noute ahing hundoh zou sih ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Hezekiah in, “Mangpa’n ahing hundam ngeingei dinga, tam khopi Assiria leengpa khut ah pieh in a umsih ding hi;” chiin Hezekiah in Mangpa hing muongsah sih heh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Hezekiah thu ngaikhe sih un, aziehpen Assiria leengpa’n tambangin agen hi: Keima toh kilemna bawl unlen, keilam ah hing pang un; tuachi’n michin in ama grepguiga kineh chiet unlen, michin in ama theipi-ga chiet kineh uhenlen, tualeh michin in ama tuikhuh apat tui kidawn chiet u heh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Ka hing pei a, nouma gam bang banga, bu leh bal, zu leh sa tamna gam, tanghou leh grep huonte umna gama kang tut masangsie in;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Pilvang un, tuachilou in, Hezekiah in “Mangpa’n eite ahing hundoh na ding hi” chi’n ahing zawl zou kha ding hi. Namte pasiente lah ah mi khat mawngmawng in zong Assiria leengpa khuta pat in agam ahumbit kha tai mah?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Hamath leh Arpadte pasiente hei a um ahita uoi? Sepharvaimte pasiente hei a um ahi uoi? Ngaiin ka khut sung apat Samaria ahunkhe ngai uh amah?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Tam gamte pasiente zousie lah a koipen in ahiei ka khut sunga kipat agam uh ahutkhieh ngaitah uh, ka khut sunga pat Mangpa’n Jerusalem ahutkhiet thei mawngmawng ding?” chi un, achi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Hinanleh amauh asip dide ua, adawng vawt sih uhi, aziehpen leengpa thupieh khu amauh “Dawng vawt sih un,” chi ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Tuachi’n leengpa innsung vaisaipa Hilkiah tapa Eliakim, laigielpa Shebna, tualeh tanchin gielpa Asaph tapa Joah in apuon uh abotkeh ua, Hezekiah kungah ahing pei ua, Rabshakeh thugente ahilta uhi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="37" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Leengpa Hezekiah in tam thu azah tahin, apuonsilte abotkeh a, sai-ip puon kikhukhum in Mangpa inn ah apeita hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Tuachi’n a innsung vaisaipa Eliakim toh, laigielpa Shebna toh, siempute lah a upate sai-ip puon silin Amoz tapa guolnei Isai kungah asawlta hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Tualeh amaun akungah, Hezekiah in “Tambang achi hi, tuni khu mangbatna leh kihousietna leh Pasian gensietna ni ahi: aziehpen tate apien uh ahunta a, hinanleh amauh hingkhe dingin thahatna a umsih hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Rabshakeh apu Assiria leengpa’n Pasian hing gense dinga asawlpa thugente, Mangpa na Pasian in ana za ngei ngei dinga, Mangpa na Pasian in athuzahte ziehin ama ahouse nuom khamaw sih ding hi. Tuaziehin ashimawh nuasie a umsunte a dingin na thumna lantou in achi hi,” achi uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Tuabanga leengpa Hezekiah miliente Isai kunga ahing tuntah un,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Isai in amaute kungah, “Tambangin na pu uh kungah na gen un, Tambangin Mangpa’n agen hi, Assiria leengpa suohten keima ahing gensietna thu na zahte ziehin zau vawt sin;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Ngai in atungah bang hagau ahiei khat ka sawl dinga, ama’n thuthang khat aza dinga, ama gam lam ah anuakia ding a, ama gam ngel ah namsau in ka puasah ding hi, achi hi,” chi un, achi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Tuachi’n Rabshakeh akinuale ta a, Assiria leengpa’n Libnah adou laitah amu a, aziehpen leengpa’n Lakish khuo anuasieta chi athei hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Tualeh Assiria leengpa Sennakerib in Ethiopia leengpa Tirhakah “Nangma dou dingin ahing kuon hi” chi thuthang aza hi. Tua thu azah tahin Hezekiah kungah mi asawl a,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />“Tambangin Juda leengpa Hezekiah kungah gen un, Na muon na Pasian in Jerusalem khuo Assiria leengpa khut ah pieh ahi sih ding chi in hing sol sih heh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Ngaiin, Assiria leengten gam zousie asuhsiet sieng dan uh na zata uhi, tualeh nang zong ahing kihunkhe tuom ding amah?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Namte pasiente’n, kapu kapate un ana suhsiet uh, Gozan, Haran, Rezeph, tualeh Telassar khuo a um, Eden mite ahunkhe ngel uoi mah?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Hamath khopi leengpa, Arphad khopi leengpa, Sepharvaim khopi leengpa, tualeh Hena leh Ivah leengpate hei a um ata uoi?” Chi’n lai ape sah hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Tualeh Hezekiah in palaite apat in laihah amu a, asimta hi, tuachi’n Hezekiah Mangpa inn ah apeitou a, Mangpa mai ah tuo laihah aphata hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Tuachi’n Hezkiah Mangpa mai ah athumta a,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />“Aw galkapte Mangpa, Israelte Pasian Cherubimte kikaal a tengpa aw, leitung leenggam zousie a nang bou Pasian na hi a, Nangman lei leh van na siem hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Mangpa aw nabil hing daw inlen, hing ngaikhie in; Aw Mangpa na mit hah inlen en in, Nang Pasian hing, hing gense dinga mi hing sawlpa Sennakerib in thu ahing hahte zousie ngaikhie in.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Mangpa aw Assiria leengten namte leh agamte uh asusie uhi chi khu atahtah ahi ngut hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Amaun apasiente uh meikhuh ah apailut uhi, aziehpen tuate pasiente ahisih ua khut a bawlthu sing leh suongte ahi zaw uhi. Tuaziehin tuate asusie uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Tuaziehin tuin, Aw Mangpa ka Pasian uh, leitung leenggam zousie in Nang maimai Pasian na hi chi ahing theina dingun akhut apat in hing hundam in,” achi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Tuachi’n Amoz tapa Isai in Hezekiah kungah mi asawl a, “Mangpa Israelte Pasian in tambangin agen hi: Assiria leengpa Sennakerib toh kisaia ka kunga na hing thum ziehin;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Mangpa’n ama tungtanga athugen tami ahi: “Zion tanu nungah siengthou in, nang ahing simmaw a, simmaw in ahing nuisan hi, Jerusalem tanu in alu ahing thinkhum hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />“Koi ahiei na minsietsah a, na gensiet, Koidou a na aw nasansah a, na mit ha na sangdah sah ahiei? Israelte Mi Siengthoupa dou na hi maw!
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Na suohte mangin Mangpa na simmaw a, ka sakolleng tampite toh muolsangtahte tungah, Lebanon gamgi hasa mama lah ah, ka hing kuontou a, a sidar sing sangte ka phua dinga, ta-sing hoi penpente ka phua dinga, tualeh muolsang gamla pente leh, gammang lei hoina munte ah ka lut ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Tui ka toudoh a, ka dawn hi; ka ketaw in Izipt luitate zousie ka tuon kangta hi, na chi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />“Keima’n ni danglai a ka nabawl, tanglai peh a ka na guotsa ahi chi na za ei? tuazieh a nang kulpi muonhuoite na suhsiet a, inn sie kisievum na bahsah dingin, tuin ka tangtungsah ahi?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />Tuaziehin asung a um miten hatna anei nawn sih ua, mangbangin azalata ua, gamlah hampa pou bang, hampa hing bang, leh inn tunga hampa pou bang leh, akhandoh masang a haivuoi a um, bu hing poudoh bang bep ahi uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />“Hinanleh keiman, na umna mun, na pawtdoh leh na lutdan, tualeh ka tunga na thangpai dante ka thei hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" />Ka tunga na thangpai zieh leh, na ki-uohsahna kamsuote, ka bil a ahing lut ziehin, ka siakawi na nahkuo ah ka vaw dinga, ka kamkaina na kamah ka vaw ding hi. Tualeh na hing peina lampi mama ah, ka hing nuakia sah ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" />“Tualeh Hezekiah aw tami nanga dingin, chiemtena ahi dinga, tukum in bu-li poute nane ding ua, tualeh akum nina ah zong bu-li apat a, hing poudohte nane nalai ding ua, akum thumna ah pen, bu tu-unlen, at unlen, grep-huonte bawl unlen aga nane ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" />Tualeh Juda innkuonte lah a suohta umsunten, nuoi lam ah hui ahasuh ding ua, tunglam ah ga asuong ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" />Aziehpen Jerusalem apat in a umsunte apawtdoh ding ua, Zion muol akipat in asuohta sunte apawtdoh ding uhi. Galkapte Mangpa phattuomngaina in, tami atang tungsah ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" />“Tuaziehin Mangpa’n Assiria leengpa tungtangah, tambangin agen hi: Ama tam khopi sungah ahing lut sih dinga, tuanah thaltang khat zong akap lutsih dinga, amasang ah lum le phaw toh ahing peisih dinga, akimkot ah zong panmun khawin leipal atou sih ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" />Ahing kuonna lampi mama ah anuakia dinga, tam khopi sungah alut sih ding hi; Mangpa’n achi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" />Aziehpen keima ziehin leh ka suohpa David ziehin, tam khopi ka vengbit dinga, ka hundam ding hi, Mangpa’n achi hi,” achi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" />Tuachi’n Mangpa vansawlsieng akuonkhie a, Assiriate giehphuol ah mi tulza leh tulsawmgiet leh tulnga ava thatta hi; tualeh zingmawnga mite ahingthaw tahun, en vawi, mishisa luong ngen ana hita uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" />Tuachi’n Assiria leengpa Sennakerib giehphuol nuasie in apawtkhie a, a inn lam ah akinuale a, Nineveh khuo ah a umta hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" />Tuin hichi ahing hi a, apasien Nisrok inn a pasien bie a aumlaiin, atapate Andramelek leh Sharezer in namsau in ama ava satlum ua, tualeh amautegel Ararat gam ah ataimangta uhi. Tuachi’n atapa Esar-haddon ama thahengin leeng in apangta hi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="38" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Tua hunlaiin, Hezekiah shi ding khopin achina hi. Tualeh Amoz tapa guolnei Isai akungah avahaw a, akungah “Tambangin Mangpa’n achi hi: Na innsung um ding dan geltupsa in koiin, aziehpen shi ding nahi, na damdoh zou nawnsih ding hi,” achi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Tuachi’n Hezekiah banglam nga in akihei a, Mangpa kungah athum a,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />“Aw Mangpa ka hing ngen ahi, na masanga thutah leh lungtang hoibukim puo a ka gamtat dan leh namit mu a silhoi ka bawl dante thei ngitnget in,” achi a, hasetah in akapta hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Tuachi’n Mangpa thu Isai kungah ahing tunga,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />“Pei inlen, Hezekiah kungah va gen in, Mangpa na pa David Pasian in tambangin agen hi: na thumna ka zata a, na hituite zong ka muta hi; Ngaiin, na damsung nite kum sawm leh nga ka belap ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Assiria leengpa khut akipat in nangma leh tam khopi ka humbit ding, tualeh tam khopi ka vengbit ding hi, achi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />“Tami nanga dingin Mangpa akipat chiemtena ahi ding hi Mangpa’n agensa abawl ngeingei ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />En in, Ahaz Kalbi a nisa him tena, tena sawm dong kanua kia sah ding,” achi hi. Tuachi’n nisa khu kalbi sawmna dong akinua khinta a, adiepnasa khu akhawkiata hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Juda leengpa Hezekiah achinatna akipat a ahing damdoh kia bep a alaigel tami ahi:
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Ke’n ka damsung nite vanglaitah in, mishi khuo kotpi a, lut dingin ka kisa a, ka damsung kum um nalaite lahpieh a, um ding kata diei izaw, ka chi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Ke’n, Mangpa mihing gam ah ka mu kia nawn sih dinga; leitunga umte lah ah mihing ka mu kia nawn sih ding, ka chi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Ka damsung kumte abeita a, belamchingpa puon inn kiphelkhie bangin, ka hinna kei akipat lahmangin a umta hi. Siemgan miten apuon a ziel bangin, ka hinna ka ziel a, aman siembu apat in ahing attan a, sun akipat zan dongin, ka hinna na tawpsah hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Zingmawng dongin panpi ngaiin ka kikou a, humpibahnei bangin kagu katang zousie atawng sah a, sun akipat zan dongin ka hinna na tawpsah hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Vakang ahiei, sielpaleng ahiei bangin, ka ham ham a, vakhu bangin ka thum thum a, tunglam etna in ka mit avaita hi. Aw Mangpa suhgenthei in ka um hi, kei hing panpi in.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Bang ka genta diei? Aman ka kungah thu agen a, agen bangin abawl pai hi; ka hinna aningkitel ziehin, ka damsung kum tengteng awlnou nou in, ka vah khien khienta ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Aw Mangpa tam silte in mihingte ahing ua, tualeh tam silte zousie ah ka hagau hinna a um hi. Tuaziehin ka hinna na hing bawlhoipieh dinga, na hing hingsah ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Ngaiin ka hamuonna dingin, ningkitelna nasatah ka nei hi, hinanleh nangman ka hinna na it ziehin, sietna kokhuh apat in na hunkheta a, ka khelnate zousie na nualam ah na paimangta hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Aziehpen hankhuh in ahing kipahpi thei sih a, shina in nang ahing phat thei sih hi; hankhuh sung tungsuhte’n, na thutah ahing kineppi thei sih uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Mihing, mihing dama hing nalaite’n, tuni-a ka bawl bangin Nang ahing phat ding uh a, pa in tate kungah na thutah atheisahta ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Mangpa khu kei hing hundam dingin, kimansain a um ngitnget a, tuaziehin kadam sung nite zousie in, Mangpa inn ah ka late tumging guineite toh kasa ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Isai in: “Theipi ga beu khat la uhenlen, abe a be-thaw dingin bawl uhenlen, a uilut-ma ah beh hen, tuachi’n adam ding hi,” ana chita hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Tualeh Hezekiah in zong: “Mangpa inn ah ka peitou kia ding, chi chiemtena bang hi ding ahiei?” ana chita hi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="39" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Khum hun laiin Babilon leengpa Baladan tapa Merodak Baladan in laithon leh silpiehte Hezekiah kungah ahah hi, aziehpen achina a adam kiata chi aza hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Tualeh Hezekiah khu atung uah ana kipah a, agou kholkhawmna inn, sana, dangka, gimnamtuite leh sathau manphate, tualeh agalvan zousie koinate leh agou koikhawmna a sil um zousie amauh a ensahta hi; a innsung leh a leenggam sung a um zousie etsahlou bangma anei sih hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Khum hun laitah mama in, guolnei Isai leengpa Hezekiah kungah ahing pei a, akungah: “Tam miten bang agen uoi, hei sunga kipata nang kunga hing haw uh ahiei?” achi hi. Tualeh Hezekiah in “Amaute gamlatah a Babilon gam a kipat a ka kunga hing haw uh ahi,” achi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Tuachi’n Isai in: “Na inn sungah bang amu uoi?” achi hi. Tualeh Hezekiah in, “Ka innsunga sil um zousie amu uhi; ka goute lah ah amauh ka etsahlou bangma a um sih hi,” chi in adawnghi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Tuachi’n Isai in, Hezekiah kungah, “Galkapte Mangpa thu na ngaiin:
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Ngaiin, na innsunga umte zousie leh na pu na paten tuni donga ana kholkhawmte uh, Babilon a puohmang nite hing tung ding ahi; bangma nuasie ahi sih dinga.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Tualeh na hah na suon, nangma akipat a piengkhie na tapate lawikhat apomang ding ua, Babilon leengpa inn sungah michilge in a um ding uhi;” achi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Tuachi’n Hezekiah in Isai kungah, “Mangpa thu na gen khu ahoi hi! Azieh pen aman ka damsung teng beh muonna leh thutah a um na lai ding hi,” achi hi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="40" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Hamuon un, hamuon un, ka mite hamuon un, na Pasian un achi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Jerusalem kungah kamnem in gen unlen, galdouna abeita chi’n akungah kikou un, akhelnate uh ngaidam ahita a, akhelna tengteng ziehin, Mangpa khut a ale niin amuta uh chi hil un.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />“Kikou aw khat in, Gamdai ah Mangpa lampi bawl unlen, i Pasian ua dingin gamgaw ah lamlien siem tang un.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Guom chinteng suhdim ahi dinga, muol chin leh taang chin suhngiem ahi ding hi, lampi kawina munte suh tang ahi dinga, abaw na munte akisu mam ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Mangpa thupina khu suhlat ahita dinga, mi zousie in tua khu amu chiet ding uhi; aziehpen Mangpa kam in tua khu ana gensa ahita hi.”
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Tua aw in, “Kikou khie un” achi hi. Tualeh ke’n “Bang thugen a kikou ding ka hiei?” ka chi hi. Tahsa zousie hampa bang ahi a, akilawmna zousie uh gamlah pape bang bep ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Hampate avuoi a, papete apul hi. Aziehpen Mangpa hui in asem a, mihingte hampa bang bep ahi tahpi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Hampa avuoi a, pape zong apul hi; hinanleh Mangpa thu pen kumtawn in aumden ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Aw Zion, thu kipahhuoi hing tun mi, muol sang tungah katou inlen, Aw Jerusalem thu kipahhuoi tun mi, Hatna toh in kikou inlen, zau sin, Juda khopite kungah, “En un na Pasian uh,” chi un.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />En un, Mangpa Pasian ban thahat toh ahing pei hi, aban in ama dingin vai ahawm ding hi. En un, akipahman akungah a um a, tualeh anasep amasang ah a um hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Aman belam chingpa bangin, abelamte ava ding a, Aban in belamnoute ahuoi khawm ding a, A angsunga pom in apeipi dinga, tualeh anou-kaite awl nounou in apui hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Koi ahiei tuite akhut kuoh sunga te a, van akhap a te a, leitunga leivuite tuot a, tena a te thei ding leh, tangte tena chienga te a, muolte tena sel a khai thei ding koi ahiei?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Koi ahiei Mangpa Hagau bawldan ding kohmu a, ahisihleh Ama thumoppa banga thuhilchien?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Mangpa’n ama navah sah ding a koi ahiei adoh a, koi ahiei ama kunga dihtatna lampi hil? Koi ahiei ama theina hil a, ahisihleh theisiemna lampi akunga ensah?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Ngaiin, Namte khu baltin a tui hi khat bang bep ahi ua, sil tena a leivui neng bang banga sim ahi giap hi. En in, Aman tuikuolkhum gamte sil neunou khat bangin, adomkangtou hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Tualeh Lebanon singte sillat halna tham ahisih a, asunga gamsa um zousie zong halmang sillat, dingin akiching sih hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Nam zousie Ama masangah, bangmalou bang bep ahi ua, Ama ngaiin bangmalou sanga neu zaw leh, panna bei ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Tua ahileh Pasian khu, koi toh kibangin na ngaituo ding uoi? ahisihleh bang toh na tekah ding uoi?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Na sempa’n milim pasien akhenga, Sana khengpa’n sana tui in aluonkhum a, dangka khengpa’n dangka khainieng asun pieh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Tua bang silpieh pe zoulou a zawng taluoten, sing muot theilou atel ua, khutsiem mi asui a, atawngsan lou ding suithaw milimte abawl sah hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Theikha nailou na hi uoi mah? Zakha nailou na hi uoi mah? Achiil apat a hing ki hilkhalou ahiei mah? Leitung kisiem chiil apata theisiem nailou na hi uh amah?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Ama khu leitung kuolkhum tunga toupa ahi a, tualeh asunga tengte khauphe bang bep ahi uh, Aman vante puon inn zah bangin azahkhie a, tualeh tenna dingin puon inn zah bangin azahkhie hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Aman leengtapate bangmalou asuoh sah a, leitunga thukhen mite pannabei asuoh sah hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Tasamtah a suon ahi ding ua, Tasamtah a tu ahi ding ua, Tasamtah in akungte un leinuoi ah hui ahading ua Ama’n amaute asem chiengin, ahing vuoi ding ua, pingpei in bushi bangin atawmang ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Kei koi toh na hing te-un, ahisihleh koi toh ka kikim ei? Asiengthoupa’n achi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />Tunglam ah dahtou unlen en un, Tam silte zousie koisiem ahiei en un, Ama’n van aasite khat khat in apuidoha, amaute amin min un ahan hi. Ama vangletna thupina leh, A silbawltheina thahatna ziehin akimlou khat beh zong umsih hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />Jakobte aw bang dinga, hichi banga chi nahi uoi, Israelte aw bang dinga tambang thu gen na hi uoi, “Ka lampite Mangpa akipat phuol ahia, ka dihna ka Pasian lah ah lahmang ahita, chi nahi uoi mah?”
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />Na theikha naisih uh amah? Na za kha ngai naisih uh amah? Kumtawn Mangpa khu Pasian ahi a, leitung tawpnate siempa khu agim ngai sih a, zong aba ngai sih hi, atheisiemnate suidoh guol ahi sih hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" />Ama’n mi hatloute kungah thahatna apie a, basamte kungah thahatna abelap pieh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" />Khanglaite nangawn agim un, aba ding ua, tualeh tangvalte apua ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" />Hinanleh Mangpa ngahte pen ahatna uh, siemtha ahi ding ua, muvanlai bangin ha in aleengtou ding ua, atai ding ua, agim sih ding uhi; tualeh kengin apei ding ua, aba sih ding uhi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="41" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Nou tuipi panga gamte aw, Ka masangah dai dide unlen, mipiten ahatna uh siemtha kia u’henlen, hing pei nai u’henlen, thu gen uhen, vaihawm dingin pei khawm chiet vai.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Suolam akipat a mi tohthou khu koi ahiei? Dihtatna akeng bula ama hanpa koi ahiei? Amasanga namte pie a, a tung ua vaihawm sahpa koi tundoh ahiei? Ama’n amaute anamsau in leivui bangin abawl a, athalpi in bushi hui mut leng a bang sah hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Ama’n amauh anuadel a, ni danga a kenga apei khah ngailouna lampi ah, bittah in apei suoh zel hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Achila kipat a suon zousie han a, tami sem a bawl zou koi ahiei? Kei Mangpa amasapen leh anukhiapen Ama khu, Keima ka hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Tuipi panga gamten tua khu amu ua, azau uhi, Kolmongate zong a zau ua, ahing nai ua, ahing pei uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Michin in a innvengte apanpi ua, a unaupa kungah “Hangsantah in um in,” achi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Khutsiempa’n sana khengpa ahantawh a, seh a khengmampa’n, seh nuoipha siakhengpa ahantawh a, “Asoumatna ding mansa ahi,” achi a, akitollouna dingin akilna in akildet hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Hinanleh nou ka suoh Israel, ka tel tuom Jakob, ka lawm Abraham hahlesuonte nahi uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Noute kawlmong akipat a ka hing lah doh, gam ning gamla pen akipat a ka hing hatdoh, “Noute ka suohte na hi ua, ka teltuomte nahi uhi; Noute ka hing paimang sih hi,” ka chita hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Zau sih un, ka hing umpi hi, Lungke sih un, Keima na Pasian uh ka hi. Ka hing hat sah dinga, Ahi, ka hing panpi dinga, ka dihtatna khut zietlam in ka hing tudet ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Ngai un, noute tunga lungdamlou zousie muol phoutah in aum ding ua, azala ding uhi, bangma ahi sih ding ua, nou hing kidoupite amangthai ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Nou hing kihaupite na sui ding ua, na muzou sih ding uhi, Nou hing doute bangmalou bang ahi ding ua, sil umlou bang ahi ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Aziehpen keima Mangpa na Pasian un na khut zietlam ka hing tudet ding hi, “Zau sihun, ka hing panpi ding hi,” na kung ua chipa khu keima ka hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Jakob nang tangtel leh, Nou Israel mite aw, zau sihun, ka hing panpi ding hi, Mangpa leh noute hing Tanpa, Israel Misiengthoupa’n, achi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Ngai un, bu satna chieng tha ha hiemtah nei in, ka hing bawl dinga, taangte na satnen dinga, muolte bushi bangin na bawl ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Amauh na zap dinga, hui in amutleeng dinga, pingpei in athethang ding hi. Nangpen Mangpa ah na kipah dinga, tualeh Israel Misiengthoupa na suongta ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Mizawng leh tasamten tui asui chiengun a um sih a, aleite uh dangta a agaw chiengin, Kei Mangpa’n amauh ka ngaikhe dinga, Keima Israelte Pasian in, amauh ka nuasie sih ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Muol gumgawta lah ah lui ka luongsah dinga, phaijang lai ah tuinah ka pulsah ding hi, gamdai gamgaw khu tuikul in ka bawl dinga, gamgaw khu tuinah in ka siem ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Gamdai ah sidar singte, gisingte, mui singte, leh Olive singte ka suon ding a, gamgaw ah, tasingte, phante leh singgil chinteng, ka suonkhawm ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Mangpa khut in tua silte abawl a, Israel Misiengthoupa’n asiem ahi chi, amu ua, athei ua, ahing ngaituo ua, ahing theisiem khawm chiet na dinguh ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Na tung thu uh hing gen un, Mangpa’n achi hi, na paulap pansan liente uh hing tahlang un, Jakob leengpa’n, achi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Amaun tuate hing tahlang uhenlen, sil hing tung dingte hing musah uheh, ingaituo a, atawpna nukhialam itheina ding un, ahisihleh sil hing tung ding hing theisah uhen.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Tu nua chienga sil hing tung dingte, hing hil u’lachin pasiente na hi na uh, chi ka hing thei ding uhi; ilungkieh khawm chiet ua, i et khawm chiet theina dingun, silsie ahiei silhoi ahiei, khat poupou hing bawl madi ua-le.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />En un, noute bangmalou na hi ua, na nasep u’zong bangmalou ahi a, noute hing tel dohpa zong, kidah huoi ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Mallam a kipat in mi khat ka tohthou a, ama ahing kuon ding a, Ama’n ni suohnalam akipat in ka min a han dinga, Ama’n leeng tapate sum sunga bu suh bangin, asuguoi dinga, belkhengmi’n tungman achil bangin achil ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />I theina ding ua, a chiil akipat a na genkhie koi ahiei? “Ama adih” ichi theina dinga nagen masa thei koi ahiei? Agenkha mawngmawng a um sih ua, Koiman zong ahilkha mawngmawng sih ua, Na thugente ngaikhe mawngmawng a um sih uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />Amasapen in Zion kungah, En in khunah amauh a um hi ka chi dinga, tualeh Jerusalem kungah, thu kipahhuoi tuntu mi khat ka peding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />Aziehpen ka en a, koima a um sih hi, Ama ulah ka en a, thumop mi koima a um sih hi, Amauh ka doh chiengin, kam khat a hing dawng thei koima a um sih uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" />En un amaute pannabei ngen ahi ua, anasepte u’zong bangmalou ahi a, amilim khenthute uh hui ahia, buoina bep ahi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="42" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />En un, ka tawisang ka suohpa ka teltuom ka hinna hagau in akipahpi mama, Atungah ka hagau ka koita a, Aman namte kungah, dihtah a vaihawmna thu podoh ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Ama akikou sih dinga, aw sangin thu agen sih dinga, gawlzing lah ah a aw akizasah sih ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Ama’n pumpeng kihiehgawpsa asutawng sih dinga, thaumei kuong mem mem asumit sih ding a, dihna in thutah ahing podoh ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Leitunga dihna toh vaihawmna a umsah masangsie, abasih dinga, zong alungke sih ding hi; Tuipi panga gamten adan thu angah zing ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Mangpa Pasian vante siem a, puonbang a jahpa, leitung leh asunga pat a pawtte zousie, puon banga pha-pa, leitunga mihingte kunga nahna hu pepa leh, leitunga tengte hinna hagau pepa’n; tambangin agen hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />“Kei Mangpa’n dihtatna in nang ka hing han a, na khut in ka hing tudet dinga, ka hing keem dinga, tualeh mite thuhun ding leh Jentelte vah hi dingin, ka hing pe ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Mittote mit vah sah ding leh, suongkul tangte suongkul apat suohtasah ding leh, suongkul miellah a toute, puidoh dingin.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Kei Mangpa ka hi a, tua khu Ka min ahi, ka thupina midang kungah ka pesih dinga, Ka patat lawnate zong milim bawlthute, kungah ka pesih ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />En un, sil masate khu ahing tungta a, tualeh sil thate ka phuongkhie hi, ahing poudoh masang un, amaute tanchin nang ka hinghil ahi.”
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Nou tuipi a peisuhte leh asunga um zousiete, tuipi panga um gamte leh asunga umte aw, kawlmong akipat in Mangpa phatna la tha sa unlen, aphatna la sa un.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Gamdai leh akhopiten aw ngaitah suo uhenlen, Kedarte tenna khoneute leh, Sela a tengten la sa uhenlen, muolvum ah kikou uhen.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Thupina Mangpa kungah pie uhenlen, tuipi panga gamte ah, Ama phatna phuongzah uhen.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Mangpa khu mihattah bangin apawtdoh dinga, galdoumi bangin aphattuomngaina atohthou ding hi. Akikoudoh dinga, Ahi, ngaitahin akikou ding hi; agalte tungah aguolzou ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Hun sawtpi hamuongin ka um a, dai dide in ka kideh a, tuin numei nauvei banga kikou ding ka hi, thakhat in ka nah hehu dinga, ka naw-nah ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Muol leh taangte bangmalou ka suohsah dinga, atung a hampa pou zousie ka gawsah sieng dinga, luite khu tuikuol gam in ka bawl ding a, tualeh tuikulte ka kanggaw sah ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Mittote atheingailouna uh lampite ah ka tut dinga, atheingailou uh lampi ah ka pui ding hi. Amasang uah miel khu vah ka suohsah dinga, akawina munte ka tangsah ding hi. Tam silte ama ua dingin ka bawlpieh dinga, ka taisan sih ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Milim bawlthute muonga, milimte kunga “Ka pasiente na hi uh,” chite pen kinuahei sah in a um ding ua, nasatah a maizum in a um ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Nou bilbingten za un, nou mittoten na mu theina ding un en un.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Ka suohpa hilou koi e mitto? ahisihleh ka sawlkawi, ka sawl banga bilbing koi ahiei? Ama a hoibukim banga mitto koi ahiei? tualeh Mangpa suohpa bang a mitto koi ahiei?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Sil tampi na mu a hinanleh, lungsim in navom zing ngaisih hi, abilte a honga hinanleh a za tuom sih hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Adihtatna ziehin Mangpa akipah mama a, ama’n adan atawisanga, tualeh zatathuoi in abawl hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Hinanleh tam mite pen gutate guhpieh leh, suom gawp a umte ahi ua, ahawm lah a thanga awhte ahi ua, suongkul a phuol mang a umte ahi ua, koima huhdoh lou a, sielneh ding ahi ua, galvan lah a lah dingte ahi ua, “Koiman nuasawl kia un,” achi sih hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Na lah ua koi ahiei tam thu a bil daw dinga, hun hing tung ding ngaikhie a za ding koi ahiei um?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Koi ahiei gallah dinga Jakob pekhie a, tualeh Israel suomhatte khut a pie koi ahiei? Atunga ina khelnapa uh, Mangpa pieh hilou ahiei mah? Aziehpen alampi azui nuom sih ua, Adan thute thumang tah a zui nuom koima a um sih uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Tuaziehin Aman atungah alungthahna meisa leh, kidouna thahatna asung buo hi; tuami’n akimvel uah mei akasahta a, hinanleh amaun athei sih uhi; tuami’n amauh akaa a, hinanleh alungtang un a ngaituo sih uhi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="43" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Hinanleh tuin Aw Jakob, nang hing siempa leh, Aw Israel nang hing bawlpa Mangpa’n, tambangin agen hi: “Zau sin, ka hing tandohta a, Na min in ka hing hanta hi, Kei a na hita hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Tuite na pal galkai chiengin, ka hing umpi dinga, luite na pal chiengin, tuiin ang tum sih ding hi. Meikuong lai a na peisuoh chiengin, a hing ka sih ding a, meikuongin zong ang hul khasih ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Aziehpen kei Mangpa na Pasian, Israel Misiengthoupa, nang hing Hundampa ka hi. Noute tatna dingin Izipt ka pie a, Ethiopia leh Seba gamte noute taangin ka pie hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Ka mitmu in manpha mama na hiziehin, zatathuoi nahi a ka hing itta a, tuaziehin na taangin midangte ka pe dinga, na hinna taang un mite ka pe ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Zau sih un, na kung uah ka um hi, suolam akipat in nahah nasuonte, ka hing zawpi ding a, tumlam akipat in ka hing kaikhawm ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Mallam kungah ha un ka chi dinga, simlam kungah amaute tu taang sih un, ka chi ding hi; gamlapi akipat in ka tapate hing pui unlen, kawlmong akipat in ka tanute hing pui un, kachi ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Ka min a kilou pouma, ka thupina dinga ka siem mi pouma, ama khu ka sutuo a, ama ka bawlta hi.”
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Mit nei ngal a, mittote leh bil nei ngal a bilbingte hing puidoh un.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Namte zousie khop khawm in um henlen, tualeh mipite kikhawm uhen, alah ua koi ahiei in tamte phuongzah thei in, sil masate koute kunga hing ensah thei ding? Siemtanga a um theina dingun, amauh theipitute hing puidoh uheh; ahisihleh tami thutah ahi chi za uhenlen, gen uhen.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />“Noute keima theipitute, ka teltuom ka suohte na hi uh;” Mangpa’n achi hi. “Na hing thei ua, na hing gintat ua, kei khu ama kahi chi na hing theisiem theina ding un, Keima masangah Pasian dang a umsih a, ka nua ah zong a umsih ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Keima ngel khu Mangpa ka hi a, Keima chilou hundampa a umsih hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Na lah ua gamdang pasiente a umlou laiin, Keima’n ka phuongdoh a ka hundamta hi, ka tangkoupi a tuazieh in, noute ka thu hing theipite nahi uhi.”
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Ahi, ni um masangin “Kei khu Ama ka hita hi; ka khut akipat hing ladoh thei koima a umsih ding hi; nna ka sema, koi ahiei phel thei ding?”
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Mangpa nou hing tanpa, Israel Misiengthoupa’n tam bangin agen hi, “Noute ziehin, Babilon ah mi ka sawl dinga, tuachi’n Kaldai mite zousie abawn un, akiletsahpi uh tembawte in, mi vahvai zawpi bang in ka zawpi suh ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Kei Mangpa na Misiengthoupa uh, Israel siempa na Lengpa uh ka hi.”
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Mangpa tuipi tunga lamlien sielpa leh, tui thuhpitah tunga lampi sielpa;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Sakolleng leh sakolte, galkapte leh asilbawltheina a, hing puidohpa’n alumkhawm sah dinga, athou nawn sih ding ua, suhchimit in a um ding ua, thaumei kuong mutmit abangta uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />“Tumasanga sil umsate theingitnget sih unlen, ni danglai a silte ngaituo nawn sih un.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Ngaiun sil tha khat ka bawl ding hi, tu in ahing poudoh ding a, na theisih ding uoi mah? Gamdai ah lampi ka siel dinga, tualeh gamgaw ah luite ka luongsah ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Gamlah a gamsaten kei ahing zatat ding ua, si-alte leh gamva ngawnsaute nangawn in zong ahing zatat ding uhi, aziehpen gamdai ah tui ka pie a, ka telsa ka mite dawn dingin, gamgaw ah luite ka luongsah hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Tam mite keima a dinga kabawl ahia, amaute kei hing phat ding a ka bawlte ahi uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />“Hinanleh Jakob aw, na hing han nai sih a, Israel aw, kei na hing chimtah zawsop hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Halmang sillat dingin na belamte uh, na hing tawi sih ua, Na kithoinate un na hing zatat nawn sih uhi. Sillat eng in puohgih ka hing guon sih a, gimnamtui eng in ka hing sugim sih hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Phai humtah sum in nang leipieh ngai sih ua, na kithoina thaute un zong na hing taisah ngai sih uhi. Hinanleh na khelnate ziehun, puohgih na hing guon zawsop uhi. Na khelnate un na hing lunggim sah zaw uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />“Kei, keima mama, ka hi, Keima zieha na tatkhielnate uh nawtmangpa ka hi a, na khelnate uh ka thei ngitnget nawn sih ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />Hing theipi un, ngaituo khawm vai, siemtansah a na um theina dingun, na tungtang thu uh gen un.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />Na pu masapen un akhielta a, tualeh na palaite u’zong ka tungah atakhielta uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />Tuaziehin munsiengthou a miliente, ka buasah dinga, tuachi’n Jakobte hamse thuoh dingin ka bawl dinga, Israelte gensiet dingin ka bawl ding hi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="44" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Mangpa’n, “Tuin ka suoh Jakob leh ka telsa Israel aw, ngai un.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Mangpa noute hing siempa leh, naubu sunga kipat hing siempa, nou hing panpi dingpa’n tambangin agen hi: ka suoh Jakob leh, ka telsa nang Jeshurun aw, Zau sin.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Dangtate tungah tui ka buoh khum dinga, gamgaw tungah lui ka luongsah ding a; nahah nasuonte tungah ka hagau ka sungbaw dinga; tualeh na tate tungah guolzawlna ka sung ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Tualeh amaute pen lui panga huisumte bangin, hampa lah ah apoudoh ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Mi khat in, Mangpa a kahi, achi dinga, midang Jakob min in ama leh ama akihan dinga, tualeh midang khat main, Mangpa a ding, chiin akhut agiel in, ama leh ama Israel min akivaw ding hi,” achi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Mangpa Israelte Lengpa amaute Tanpa leh, galkapte Mangpa’n tambangin agen hi: “Keima amasapen leh keima a nukhia pen ka hi, Keima loungal Pasian dang a um sih hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Ka phuondoh banga phuongdohthei koi ahiei? tuachi’n aman phuongdoh henlen, ka masang ah luikhie heh, nidanglai mite ka guot akipat sil umte leh, sil hing um dingte amaute kungah sulang uheh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Zau sih unlen, giing sih un, Ken tam thu na kung uah khum hun lai akipat, noute ahing theipite nahi uhi, chiin ka hing hil masa sih amah? Kei loungal Pasian dang a um amah? Ahi, Pasian dang a um sih hi, khat zong ka thei sih hi.”
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Milim khenthu bawlte zousie bangmalou ahi uhi; sil manpha asahte un phattuomna anei sih ding uhi, amauh theipite amauh ma ahi ua, azum theina dingun, amusih ua athei sih uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Koi ahiei bangma phattuomna neilou pasien leh, sunthaw milim na bawl?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />En in, alawm aguolte zousie azala ding ua, akhutsiemte ulah mihing bep ahi bou uhi, abawn un kigawm khawm uhenlen, pangkhawm uheh, khuchi in zong azau ding ua, azala khawm ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Siakhengpa’n taite toh mei-am lah ah sia a em a, seh toh milim akhenga, abantha hat in pum azap a, ahing gilkiel a athahatna abei a, tui adawn sih a, tuachi’n abata hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Singbawlpa’n tena khau in sing ate a, chiemtena laikungin amelchi a, sing nawtna in anawt tuoh a, tena chiengin ate tuoh a, mihing lim bangin abawl a, innsung a koi dingin mihing kilawmna bangin azem hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Aman sidar singte ama a dingin aphua a, se sing leh gangpi singte ala a, gammanga singte lah ah khat ama a dingin akhawi a; ta-sing asuon a, tua khu guotui in akhangsah hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Tuachi’n mihingte dinga singvah ding ahita dinga, tua khu ahal ua a awilum ua, meiin atawkuong ua, tanghou a em uhi; tua singte ma in pasien abawl ua, abie uhi. Milim bawlthu akheng ua, amai ah akuun uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Tua singte kimkhat mei ah a vanga, ann huonna in anei a, sa zong a em a, taitah in ane hi, tua mei a awi a, “Ah! lum e, mei ka muta” achi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Tualeh avalte in milim pasien abawl a, amilim bawlthu mai ah bie in akuun a, akungah thu angen a, “Hing hundoh in ka pasien na hi” achi zel hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Amauten athei sih ua, atheisiem sih uhi, Aziehpen amu theilouna dingun amitte uh asingsah hi; tualeh atheisiemlouna dingun, alungtang uh a suhmiel pieh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Koiman alungtangun angaituo ngai sih ua, Koiman; “Kimkhat singvah dingin ka zanga, mei-amte tungah tanghou ka kanga, sa ka em a, ka ne hi, tualeh avaltenga sil kidah huoi bawl ding ka hi diei? Singtun val mai a kun a be ding ka diei? chitheina leh theisiemna nei a um sih uhi.”
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Vut in akivah a, ahinna ahumbit theilouna ding leh, ka khutzietlam ah zuou thu umlou ahiei mah? “Achi theilouna dingin alungtang sol zou a um in,” ama aleheita hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Jakob aw, tamte thei ngitnget in, Israel aw ka suoh na hi; Ka hing siema ka suohpa na hi; Aw Israel ka hing manghil sih ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Na tatkhelna zousiete uh meipi satah bangin, ka phietmangta a, tualeh na khelnate meilum bangin ka phietmang ta hi; ka hing tatdoh tah ziehin, ka kungah hing kinuale un.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Vante aw, la sa un, aziehpen Mangpa’n, abawl zouta hi! Leinuoi thuhtahte aw kikou un; Aw nou muolte leh gammangte leh, asunga sing chinteng aw, la sa in kikoukhie un, aziehpen Mangpa’n Jakob atankheta a, Israel ah amaleh ama akipah tawita hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Mangpa nang hing tanpa, naubu sunga kipat a hing siempa’n, tambangin agen hi: “Kei Mangpa sil zousie siempa ka hi a, keima ka hi vante amatanga kizahkhesahpa, leitung kiphasahpa zong keima ka hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Zuou thu gente chiemtenate bangmalou suohsah a, aisan siemte mimaw suohsah a, mipilte nuakia sah a, atheinate uh motna suoh sahpa keima ka hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />Asuohpa thugen tangtung sah a, asawltahte lemguotna subukimpa keima ka hi, Jerusalem kunga, mite ahing teng ding uhi, chipa leh Juda gam khopite tungthu a, lamtha in na um ding ua, amun sesate kitungding kia ding hi, chipa keima ka hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />Tuithuhtah kunga, Kanggaw in, na lui tuite kanggaw sah ding ka hi, chipa keima ka hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />Sairas tungthu a; Ama ka belamchingpa ahi a, Aman ka kipahna lam zousie abawl dinga, Aman Jerusalem kung nangawn ah, kilamtha kia ding na hi, chipa leh Biehinnpi kunga, na suongphum lep in a um ding hi; chipa khu keima ka hi,” achi hi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="45" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Mangpa’n asathaunusa Sairas kungah, amasanga namte kipesah ding leh, leengte kawnggah sutpieh ding leh, amasanga kotpi nite hongsah ding leh, kulpi kot khate honlou a, um sah dinga, akhut zietlam a ka tuhpa kungah, tambangin agen hi:
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />“Keima na masangah ka pei dinga, akawina munte ka sutang dinga, sum-eng kotpite ka satguoi dinga, kotpi kalna sia zawlte ka hiehtawng ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Kei Mangpa na min a hing hanpa khu, Israelte Pasian ka hi chi na theina dingin, miel lah a um gou kikoikhawmte leh mun simthama gou kiphuolte ka hing peding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Ka suoh Jakob leh ka telsa Israel ziehin, na min in ka hing han a, nangman hing theikha ngai sih nanlachin, na min ka hing phuopieh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Keima Mangpa ka hia, adang a um sih hi, Keima chilou Pasian dang a umsih hi, hing theikha ngai sih nanlachin, na kawngah ka hing gah ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Keima loungal koima dang a um sih chi nisuonalam akipat nitumnalam donga miten atheina ding un, Keima Mangpa ka hi a, adang mawngmawng a um sih hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Keima’n khovah ka umsah a, khomiel zong ka siem hi, vangphatna ka bawl a, vangsietna zong ka siem hi. Kei Mangpa’n tam silte zousie ka bawl hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />“Nou vante aw, tunglam akipat in zu sah un, tualeh vanlaizawlin dihtatna guo bangin zu sah henlen; leitung kihong henlen, hundamna hing pawtdoh hen, tualeh dihtatna toh hing pawtdoh khawmsah heh, kei Mangpa’n ka siem ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />“Ama siempa toh kihau mi tung agih hi! Ama leibel kehgawp leh leibel themneng khat bang leltah hilou amah? Tungman in akhengpa kungah, bang ahiei na bawl? Achi thei diei? Ahisihleh na nasep in khut aneiloupi, achi thei diei mah?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Apa kunga bang ta ahiei na nei? Ahisihleh anu kunga, bang ahiei na hinkhiet?” Chi mite tung agih hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Mangpa Israelte Siengthoupa leh amauh bawlpa’n tambangin agen hi: “Ka tapate tungtanga sil hing tung dingte hing dong ding na hiei mah? Ahisihleh ka khut nasepte tungtang a thupieh hing pe ding na hiei mah?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />leitung ka bawl a, atunga mihingte siempa keima ka hi; ka khut mama in vante ka zah a, asunga aasihonte thu ka pie hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Dihtatna in Sairas ka tungdingta a, alampite zousie ka tangsah ding hi; Ama’n ka khopi alam dinga, tualeh ka mi saltangte ahadoh ding hi; tatnaman leh kipahman deina hi sese lou in,” galkapte Mangpa’n achi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Mangpa’n tambangin agen hi: “Izipt gama sepgimna ga leh Ethiopia summet bawlte van zuate leh Sebean mi, dinsangpipite, na kung uah ahing tung ding ua, tuate nou a ahi ding hi. Na nua ahing zui ding ua, khainienga hensain ahing pei ding ua, na kungah ahing kun ding ua, na kungah ngetna abawl ding ua, nangma ah Pasian a um tahtah a, adang malmal a um sih a, Pasian dang a um sih hi,” achi ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Aw Israelte Pasian, Hundampa, akiphuol Pasian na hi tahtah hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Amaute azum ding ua, abawn un a zala khawm ding ua; milim khengte pouma, alungbuoi khawm chiet ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Hinanleh Israelte pen kumtawn hundamna in, Mangpa’n ahundam ding a; kumtawn kumtawn in na zumsih dinga, na zala sih ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Aziehpen Mangpa vante siempa’n, tambangin agen hi; Pasian leitung siem a bawlpa ngel in asukip a, bangmalou dingin asiem sih a, mihing tenna dingin abawl zaw hi. “Kei Mangpa ka hi a, adang mal mal a um sih hi.”
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Leitung mielna mun ah, aguh in thu ka gen ngai sih a, Jakob hahlesuonte kungah, amawhna in, hing sui un kachi ngaisih hi. Kei Mangpa’n dihtatna thu kagen a, thudih ka phuongdoh zel hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />“Hing kikhawm unlen, hing pei khawm un, Nou namte lah akipata suohta te’n, hing nai khawm chiet un; amilim bawlthu singte uh viel puoh a, hundam theilou pasien kunga thungente’n, bangma theina anei sih uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Phuongdoh unlen, na tungthu uh hing pawdoh un, amauten ngaituokhawm uheh, nidanglai akipat a tam thu phuongdoh koi ahiei? khanglui lai apat tua thu na gen koi ahiei? Kei Mangpa hilou ka hiei mah? Kei chilou Pasian dang malmal a um sih hi; Pasian dihtah leh Hundampa ka hi a, Kei chilou adang malmal a um sih hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />“Kawlmong donga um zousiete aw, Kei lam hing en unlen, hundam in um un! Aziehpen Kei Pasian ka hi a, adang malmal a um sih hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Keima min lou in ka kichiemta hi, dihtatna in ka kam a kipat in thu apawt a, ka thu gensa a hing ki le kia nawn sih ding hi; Tua thu khu: khup chin teng ka masang ah akuun dinga, lei chinteng akichiem ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />“Amaun: Adihtah in, Mangpa ah dihtatna leh, hatna ka mu hi achi ding ua, akungah mite ahing pei ding ua, tualeh atunga lungkimlou zousie, azala ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Israel hahlesuon zousie Mangpa ah, siemtansah in a um ding ua, tualeh thupitah in a um ding uhi, achi ding uhi,” achi hi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="46" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Bel akhupboh a, Nebo a kun suh hi; amilimte uh ganhingte leh gantaten apuo ua, na kangtalaite un gihtah in na viel puohsah ua, ganta thatawlte a dingin puohgih ahi giap hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Akuunsuh ua, akhupboh khawm chiet ua, vangihte lah adawnjang thei tuom sih ua, hinanleh amauh mama sal a puimangin a um zawta uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />“Jakob innkuonte aw, ka thu ngaikhie un, asuohta umsun Israel innkuonte aw, naubu sunga na um lai ua pat a Kang kep leh, na pien ua pat a ka hing vielpuoh kawite aw, na bawn un ka thu ngaikhie un.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Na hing tehsiet dongun, kei khu Ama ka hia, tualeh nasam akaan dong nangawn un zong, noute ka hing poding hi! Ke’n ka bawlta a, ka po ding hi, nou ka hing po dinga, ka hing hunkhe ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />“Kei koi toh hing te ding nahi uoi? koi toh kikim a hing bawl ding nahi uoi? koi toh kibang hing chi ding nahi uoi?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Amaun a ip ua kipat sana abungkhie ua, atena in dangka ate ua, sana khengte aguoi ua, tualeh amaun pasien lim a kheng ua, tuachi’n khupboh in abie uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Aliengkou uah akhang ua apuo ua, akoina ding mun ah akoi ua, tuanah a umden hi. Tua mun apat akisuon thei sih a, mi’n ahan dinga hinanleh adawng thei sih ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />“Nou sil bawlkhielte aw, tami thei ngitnget un, kipasal sah unlen, ngaituo kia un.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Khanglui lai a sil um masate, thei ngitnget un, Aziehpen Kei Pasian ka hi a, adang malmal a um sih hi; Kei Pasian ka hi a, Keima bang koima dang a umsih hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />A chiil akipat in a tawpna ding ka phuong a, tanglai hunte akipat in sil tung nailoute ka gen zel a, ka sil guotte akipden ding hi, tualeh ka dei bangbangin ka bawl ding hi, ka chi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Suolam akipat in va sasielne leh, gamla tah akipat ka guotsate semkhe dingin, mi ka han a ahi, ka genta a, ka tangtungsah dinga, ka tumta a, ka bawl ngeingei ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />“Nou kilungtang khausahte leh, dihtatna apat a gamlate aw, ka thu ngaikhie un.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Ka dihtatna nainou khat ah ka hing koi hi, gamlapi a um ahisih hi; ka hundamna akiheh sih ding hi, Ka hundamna Zion ah ka koi dinga, Aziehpen ka thupina Israel,” ahi ding hi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="47" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Kumsuh inlen, leivui lah ah touin, Aw nang Babilon tanu nungah siengthou; Mangtoupha tung hilou in tuol ah touin, nang Kaldai mite ta nu aw! Aziehpen dawng thinthen leh nou-ngingei, hing kichi nawnlou ding na hita hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Bu hehna suong la inlen, tangbuong bawl in, na kikhuna lakhie inlen, na nih lemtou inlen, na malpi dawhsah inlen, luite pal galkai in.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Guohtang na hina khu, khulou in a um dinga, Ahi, na zamaw akimu ding hi; Phuba ka la dinga, koima ka hinkhawi sih ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Eite hing tanpa ahileh, Amin galkapte Mangpa, Israel Misiengthoupa ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Kaldai mite tanu aw, sip khinkhien in tou inlen miel lah ah lut in, aziehpen nang koiman leenggamte leengnu, ahing chi nawn sih ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Ka mite tungah ka na lungthah a, ka goutan ka bua sahta a, na khut ah ka hing pekhie hi. Nang atung uah hepina malmal na sulang sih a, tehsete nangawn na hahkol gihtah na posah hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />“Tualeh nang lah kumtawn in, leengnu hiden vang na chi a,” tam silte lah na lungtangin na ngaituo ngai sih a, atawpna ding zong na thei sih hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Tuaziehin tuin nang mi kinoptal, khohsah neilou, na lungsim a keima ka hi, “Kei lou midang koima a umsih, meithai in tousih vangin, tate zong taan ngai sih vang, chi nu’n tam thu ngaiin.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Hinanleh tam sil nite, tate taanna leh meithaina in, thakhat in, ni khat thu in, ahing tung ding hi. Na dawithusiemna leh, nabum siemna nasatah in tam mama nanleh, tam silte na tungah kimtah in ahing tung ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Aziehpen na gitlouna na muonga: koiman ahing musih na chi a, kei ka hi, “Kei chilou koima dang a umsih” na chi laiin, na pilna leh na theinain nang ahing suseta hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Tuaziehin, na tungah sil hoilou ahing tung ding a, hei a hing kipan ahiei chi na thei sih ding hi; vangsietna in ahing buohkhum dinga, na thoidam thei sih ding hi. Tualeh thakhat in, na tungah man thaina ahing tung dinga; Nang na thei sih ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Na naupan lai akipata na sepgimna, na dawithusiemna leh, na aisan siemna tampi toh tuin pangin: na phattuompi khamaw sih dinga; na lawching khamaw sih ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Thuhilna tampi na don zouzaite’n, nang ahing lunggim sah hi. Tuin na vanlam aasi suisiemte leh, aasi en siemte leh ha china, ha tha en a thumavang gen mite’n, hing dinpi uhen len, na tunga sil tung dingte apat hing hunkhie u’leh asih diei!
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />En in, amauh bupawl bang giap ahi ding ua, mei in akatum ding uhi; meikuong lah akipat in amauleh amauh, akihundam thei sih ding ua, kisuhlumna ding mei-am ahi sih dinga, tualeh awithaw ding meikuong bep hilou ding a hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Na neulai apat a na sepgimpi leh, na summet bawlpite tambang bep ahi ding uhi. Amaute amauh lampi chiet ah, avahvai ding ua, noute hing hundam ding koima a um sih ding hi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="48" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Tam thu ngaikhie un, nou Israel min a, kihan Jakob innkuonte aw; tami ngaikhie un, Nou Juda khanggui thutah hilou, dihtatna lah hi samlou, Mangpa min lou akichiema, Israel Pasian min lou zelte aw tami ngaikhie un.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Aziehpen khopi siengthou a mi akichi ua, tualeh Israel Pasian tungah akinga ua, galkapte Mangpa khu amin ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />“Achiil akipat in sil um masate ka phuongkhie a, ka kam akipat in apawtdoh a, amauh ka theisah hi, thakhat in ka bawl a, ka gensate atangtung pai hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Noute migenha nahi uh chi ka thei a, na ngawng thagui uh sia bang ahia, na talpang u’zong sum eng ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Achiil a kipat tamte na kung uah ka genta a; ahing tun masangin ka hing theisahta hi, tuachilouin, nouten ka milim in abawl a ka milim khenthute leh, ka milim sunthuten thu apieh ahi, na chikha ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />“Na zata a tamte en in, tualeh gendohlou ding na mah? Tua kipat sil thate, sil kiphuol nathei ngailoute ka hing theisah ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Amaute tu a kisiem ahi ua, achiil asiem ahi sih uhi; tu masang in tamsilte na za-khangai nai sih uhi, khuchilou in vang, ngai in tuate ka thei na chikha ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Na za kha ngai sih ua, na thei ngai sih uhi, Ahi, hun sawtpi na bil uh akihong naisih a, lepchie tahin na bawl uh chi ka thei hi. Naubu sunga kipat a mikhiel hing kichi ahita hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />“Ka min ziehin ka lungthahna ka khawlsan tadi dinga, phat ka law theina ding leh, noute ka hing suhmang louna dinga kideh ka hi bou hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Ngai un, ka hing susieng a, hinanleh dangka suhsieng bang hilou in, suhgentheina haltuina mei ah kahing enchienta hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Keima ziehin, Keima mama ziehin, tami ka bawl ding hi; bang zieh a ka min buasah a um ding ahiei mah? Tualeh ka thupina midang kungah ka pesih ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />“Jakob leh ka hatdohsa Israel aw, ka thungaikhie un, Kei Ama ka hi a, Kei amasapen ka hi a, Kei anukhiapen ka hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Ahi ka khut in leitung kingah na ka phum a, tualeh ka khut zietlam in vante ka zahpal a, ka hat chiengin ading khawm zel uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />“Na bawn un kikhawm unlen, ngai un, amau’lah a koipen in tam silte aphuongdoh ei? Mangpa’n ama a it a; aman Babilon tungah a ut dan dan abawl dinga, tualeh akhut in Kaldaimite a dou ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Kei, Keima ngelin ka genta a, Ahi, ama ka hanta a, ka hing zawpita a, tualeh anasep alawching ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Ka kunglam hing nai unlen, tam thu ngaikhie un; Achiil akipat in thu kadap gen ngai sih hi. Khum hun lai akipat in, Kei ka umta hi.” Tualeh tuin, Mangpa Pasian leh, Hagau in kei ahing sawl hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Mangpa nou hing tanpa Israel Mi Siengthoupa’n, tambangin agen hi: “Kei Mangpa na Pasian, na phattuomna dinga nangma hing hilpa leh, na peina ding lampi a hing zawpipa ka hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Oh! nou ten ka thupiehte ana ngaikhie himai u’lachin izaw, na hamuonna uh lui-luongbang himai ding hi a, na dihtatna uh tuihuol bang himai ding hiven.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Nahah nasuonte zong senel banga tam ahita ding a, na khal a pieng na tate zong senel bang ahita ding a, amin ka masanga kipat in phiet mangin a um sih dinga, suhmangthai a umlou ding uh hima ven maw,” achi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Babilon akipat pawt unlen, Kaldai mite apat in taimang un, Lungnop lasah aw toh, tami phuong unlen, Kawlmong dongin phuongzah unlen, “Mangpa’n asuohpa Jakob atandohta,” chi un.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Tualeh gamdai gamgaw a amaute apui lai in adangta sih ua, amaute dawn ding suongpi apat tui aluongsah a, Aman suongpi akhipawh sah a, tuite apuldoh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />“Mangpa’n migiloute a dingin, galmuonna a um sih hi,” achi hi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="49" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Tuipi panga gamte haw, ka thu ngaikhie unlen, gamlapi a um miten na bil uh hing daw un, Mangpa’n naubu sunga kipat in, kei ahing handoh a, ka nu sunga kipat in Ama’n ka min alouta hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Tualeh Ama’n, ka kam namsau hiemtah bangin abawlta a, akhut lim nuoi ah ahing phuol a, tualeh thaltang nawttet sitset bangin ahing bawl a, athaltang bawm ah ahing phuol hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Tualeh ka kungah, “Israel aw nang kasuoh na hi a, nangma ah pahtawi in ka um ding hi,” achi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Tuachi’n ken akungah, “Amawhna a semgim ka hita, ka hatna bangmalou leh pannabei a zangbei ka hita; hinanleh ka dihna kipahman khu Mangpa kungah a um a, ka nasep zong ka Pasian kungah a um hi,” ka chi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Tuin Mangpa Jakob te nua puikia ding leh, Ama kunga Israelte puikhawm dinga, naubu sung a kipat a. A suoh a hingbawlpa Mangpa’n, tambangin agen hi. Aziehpen Mangpa mitmu in thupitah kahi dinga, tualeh Mangpa khu ka hatna ahita ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Ahi, “Ama’n Jakob namte tungding ding leh, Israel humbit a umte siempha dinga ka suoh a na um, nanga dinga sil neu noukhat ahi. Jentelte lah a vah tuntu hi dingin, ka hing bawl dinga, kawlmong donga ka hundamna na hi theina dingin,” achi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Mangpa Israel Tanpa leh Mi Siengthoupa’n, tambangin agen hi: Mite simmawpa, namte kidah leh huotpa, vaihawmte suohpa kungah, Mangpa muonhuoi leh Misiengthoupa’n, nangma ahing tel ziehin, “Leengten ahing mu ding ua, adingtou ding ua, leengtapaten zong ahing be ding uhi.”
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Mangpa’n tambangin agen hi; “Hun kipah um ah ka hing ngaikhie a, Hundamna ni ah ka hing panpi hi, Gamsung tungding ding leh, Goutan sesate luosah kia dingin, nang ka hing keem dinga mipite thuhun dingin, ka hing peding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Suongkul taangte kungah hing pawtdoh un, na chi dinga, miel lah a umte kungah, hing kilah un nachi theina ding un. Lampite ah ne in akivah ding ua, mun sang kieu zousie atatna mun uh ahi ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Agilkiel nawn sih ding ua, adangta nawn sih ding uhi. Kholum in asugenthei sih dinga, nisa in zong asuna sih ding hi. Aziehpen amauh hepipa’n a zawpi dinga, tuinah nei kungah apui ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Ka muolte zousie lamlien ka suohsah dinga, ka lamliente ka sangsah ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />En in, tamte gamla tah a kipat in ahing pei ding ua; En in, tamte mallam leh tumlam a kipat in ahing pei ding ua, tualeh Sinim gam a kipat in ahing pei ding uhi.”
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Vante aw la sa unlen, leitung aw nuom in, muolle taangte aw lasa in kikoukhie un, Mangpa’n amite ahamuonta hi; Ami hasatna thuohte tungah khotuona aneita ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Hinanleh Zion in, “Mangpa’n ahing taisanta a, Ka Mangpa’n ahing manghilta,” achi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />“Nu in ata nawine lai amanghil thei diei mah? a gil a pieng ata alainat lou thei diei mah? Ahi, amanghil mai thei uhi; hinanleh Ken vang kang manghil sih ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />En in, ka khutphang sungte gel ah ka hing gielta hi, na kulbangte ka masangah a um ngitnget hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Na tapate akintat ding ua, nangma hing sumangthaite leh, bangmalou a hing bawlte nanga kipat, apawtmang ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Dahkhie’n len na kim na pam en in, tamte zousie akikhawm ua, na kungah ahing pei uhi. Ahin a ka hin bangin, Nang pahtawina kisil bangin tamte zousie kizepna in, na silta ding mou akizep bangin na kizemta ding hi, chiin Mangpa’n agen hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />“Aziehpen na munte suhsietsa leh nuasiesa leh, na gam suhsietsa a um khu atengte ziehin, a neu sengta dinga, tualeh ahing pumvalte khu gamla tah ah a umta ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Adangte na taan nua a na ta nei kia dingten, tam mun koute adingin aneu seng hi, tenna ding mun lien zaw hing pie in, chi in na bil kawmah ahing gen ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Tua hun chiengin nang na lungtangin tam mite, koi hahlesuon ahi uoi? Kei lah tate suun a nuasie leh taisan a um hi inga, saltaanga sah leh hang a vahvai hilou ka hiei mah? Koi ahiei tamte khoilien, Keima tanga nuasie a um hilou ka hiei mah? Tamte hei a um ahi uoi? na chi ding hi,” achi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Mangpa Pasian in tambangin agen hi: “Ngai vawi, Jentelte lam ah ka khut ka zahtou ding a, mite adingin ka chiemtena diellap ka tadoh dinga; Amaun na tapate uh a ang ua pomin, tualeh na tanute u’zong aliengkou ua puo in, ahing pui ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Tualeh leengpate nou hing keem na pa uh ahi dinga, leengnute zong na nau donnu un apang ding hi; amaun amai ua tuol suin a kun ding ua, na kenga leivuite alieh ding uhi. Tuachi’n kei Mangpa ka hi chi na hing thei ding uhi; aziehpen kei hing ngahte a muolphou ngai sih ding uhi.”
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Mihat khut akipat a gallahte koiin alahpieh zou diei, ahisihleh saltang dihtatte hutkhiet in a um diei mah?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Hinanleh Mangpa’n tambangin agen hi: “Mihattah khuta saltangte nangawn lahpieh in a um dinga; mizauhuoite gallahte zong hutkhiet in a um ding hi; aziehpen nang hing doute ka dou ding a, na tate ka hundam ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />Tualeh nou hing simmawte khu, amauh sa mama ka nesah dinga, tualeh zu humtah kham bangin amauh sisan akham ding uhi. Tua hun chiengin michin in Kei Mangpa na hundampa uleh, na Tanpa u’leh Jakob mihatpa ka hi,” chi athei ding uhi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="50" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Mangpa’n tambangin agen hi: “Na nu Israel ka naw khiet in, khulna lai ka pekha amah? Ahisihleh, Ka leibatnate koipen kungah noute ka hing na zua ei? Ngai in, na khelnate ziehun, nou leh nou na kizua ua; na tatkhielnate ziehun na nu uh khul in a um hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Bangzieh a ka hing peilai a koima umlou ahiei? tualeh ka hing hatlai a kei hing dawng ding, koima umlou ahiei? Noute hing tandoh theilou dinga, ka khut suhtom a um ahiei mah? Ahisihleh hing hunkhe dinga, silbawltheina neilou ka hiei mah? Ngai in, ka phawhthopna in tuipi akangsat a, luite gamdai ka suohsah hi, tui umlou ziehin ngate dangta in ashi ua, a ui uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Vante meivom in ka khu a, tualeh akituomna dingin sai ip puon ka bawlpieh hi.”
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Mi lunggim leh basamte kunga ahuntah a thu gen ding, ka theina dingin Mangpa Pasian in, thuhilsiemte lei ahing pie a, Aman zingmawng chin in ahing phonghal a; thuhilsiemte banga za dingin, ka bil aphawnghal zel hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Mangpa Pasian in ka bilte avangsah a, ka hel sih a, ka le-ngatsan sih hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Ang satte ka elduong ka daw a, khamul botkieute kungah ka bieng ka daw hi. Zumna leh chilphitkhumna akipat, ka maitang ka phuol ngai sih hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Aziehpen Mangpa Pasian in ang panpi dinga, tuaziehin ka zala sih ding hi; tuaziehin meisa suong bangin ka mai ka tahsah hi, tualeh ka zala sih ding chi ka thei hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Kei siem hing tangsahpa anai hi, koi ahiei hing dou ding? Ka dingkhawm ding ua, Koi ahiei melma? Aman hing nai heh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Ngai un, Mangpa Pasian in ahing panpi tahtah dinga, koi ahiei siemlou hing tangsah ding? Ngai un, amaute abawn un puonsil bangin, alui ding ua, nget in anekhawng ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Na lah uah koi ahiei Mangpa zaudan siem? Asuohpa thumang koi ahiei? Miel lah a vah a, meivah neilou koi ahiei? Mangpa min muong henlen, a Pasian tungah kinga hen.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Nou mei tawkuonga, meisi a ki-im kuolkhumte ngai un, na meikuong vah uah leh, na meisi halkuongte uah vah un. Tami ka khuta kipat a na tan ding uh ahia, genthei thuoh in na lum ding uhi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="51" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />“Nou dihtatna zuite leh nou Mangpa suite, ka thu ngaikhie un, satkhieh a na umna uh suongpi leh, nou hing kitawdohna kokhuh lam en un.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Na pu uh Abraham en unlen, tualeh nou hing na hing nu Sarah en un; Ka hat laiin amatang ahia, tualeh ama ka guolzawl a, ka pungsah hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Aziehpen Mangpa’n Zion ahamuon dinga, amun sesate zousie ahamuon dinga, agamdaite Eden bangin abawl dinga, tualeh agamgawte Mangpa huon abangsah ding hi; lungnopna leh kipahna asungah mu in a um ding a, kipahthugenna leh ginglawm a um ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />“Ka mite aw ka thu ngaikhie un, Aw, ka namte na bil uh daw un, aziehpen keima apat in dan apawt dinga, tualeh ka vaihawmna khu mite vahna dingin, khawldamna in ka bawl ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Ka dihtatna anaia, ka hundamna apawtdoh a, tualeh ka bantha in mite thu akhen dinga, tuipi panga gamten ahing ngah ding ua, amauten ka bantha muong ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Dahtou unlen vante en un, tualeh nuoi langa leitung en un, aziehpen vante meikhu bangin azammang dinga, tualeh leitung zong puonsil bangin alui dinga, asunga tengte zong tuamabangin ashi ding uhi. Hinanleh ka hundamna kumtawn in a umden dinga, ka dihtatna zong suhmangin a umsih ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />“Nou dihtatna theite leh, ka danthu lungtang sunga vom mite aw, ka thu ngaikhie un, mihingte gensietna zausih unlen, ahing housiet ziehun zong zausih un.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Aziehpen nget in puonsil aneh siet bangin, amauh anese sieng dinga, tualeh puonhih in Samul anehsiet bangin, amauh a nese sieng ding hi. Hinanleh ka dihtatna kumtawn in a umden dinga, tualeh ka hundamna zong akhang akhangin, a umden ding hi.”
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Mangpa banthahat aw, khanglou in, khanglou in, hatna in kivon in, tanglai nite leh nidanglai khangte bangin, khanglou in! Rahab satnen a, gulpi satliempa nang hilou na hiei mah?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Tuipi kangsahpa leh tuithuh tahte kangsahpa, nang hilou na hiei mah? Tatsate galkai masangsie tuipi thuhtah a, lampi bawlpa nang hilou na hiei mah?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Tuabangin Mangpa tatsate ahing kinuale kia dinga, lasa kawm in Zion ah ahing pei ding ua, kumtawn lungnopna alu tung uah akhu ding ua, lungnopna leh kipahna atang ding ua, lungkhamna leh dana ataimangta ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />“Kei keima mama noute hing hamuonpa ka hi, ashi thei ding mihing giing ding leh, hampa banga bawl mihing tapa giing ding, nang koi na hiei?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Nang vante zahpal a, leitung kingahna suongphum phumpa, nang hing siempa na manghil a, ahing sumang dinga kimansa nuoisiemi, lungthahna zieh a nisim a zau na hi. Tua nuoisiemi lungthahna hei a um ahiei?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Sal puimanga umte kintah a hadoh pai ahi ding ua, kokhuh sungah neh ding atasam sih ding ua, si zong ashi sih ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Hinanleh kei Mangpa na Pasian uh, tuihuol ging zuo zuote kikhentansahpa ka hia, Amin galkapte Mangpa ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Na kamsungah ka thute ka koita a, ka khut limnuoi ah ka hing phuol a, Vante ka zahpal theina ding leh, leitung kingahna suongphumte ka phum theina ding in; Zion kunga noute ka mite na hi uh,” chipa ka hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Aw Jerusalem Mangpa khut a, alungthahna nou a dawnnu, khanglou in khanglou in, nangman hawi dongdongna noua na dawn a, ahi nangawn na dawnbei siengta hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Jerusalem tapate zousie lah ah ama pui ding, koima a um sih a; akhanletsah atapate zousie lah ah ama khut a tu, koima a um sih hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Tam silnite na tungah ahing tungta, koi ahiei nang hing dapi ding? Sietna leh manthaina, kiel leh namsau ahing tungta, koi ahiei hing henem ding?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Na tapate abata ua, sapeng len a awh bangin, kholai lamkathuom chin ah alum phengphung uhi; Mangpa lungthahna leh na Pasian uh phawhna toh, kidim ahi uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Tuaziehin nou hasatna thuohte, zukham hilou a, thangpaina khamte hepitah in tamthu ngai un.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Mangpa na Pasian uh amite dinga, genpiehpa’n tambanga khama na hoi dong dongna uh nou, “Ka lungthahna nou ka lakheta hi, tua khu na dawn nawn sih ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Hinanleh tam pen nangma hing sugentheite, khut ah ka koita ding hi; na kung uah, na tung ua ka hing pei theina ding un lum un, ahing chi uh hi. Tuachi’n nouten na tung ua hing totkhumte adingin, na sapum uh tuol bangin na pha ua, tualeh gawlzing bangin na pumpi uh na dawta uhi.”
  </para>
  <chapter number="52" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Aw Zion khanglou in, khanglou in, na hatna in kivon in, Khopi siengthou Jerusalem aw, na puonsil kilawmte silin! Teptanloute leh siengthou loute na sungah, a lut nawn sih ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Aw Jerusalem leivuite lah a kipat kithing sieng inlen, thou inlen, touin; Zion tanu saltang aw, na ngawnga na kolbutte sutkhie in.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Aziehpen Mangpa’n tambangin agen hi: “Nou leh nou bangmalou in na kizua ua, tualeh sum panglou a tatdoh na hi ding uhi, achi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Aziehpen Mangpa Pasian in tambangin agen hi: Achiil in ka mite Izipt gama um dingin apeisuh ua; tuachi’n azieh umlou in Assiriaten ana sugenthei uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Tuaziehin tuin ken tanah bang ka neita diei, Mangpa’n achi hi. Ka mite lah bangmalou a lahmang ahita ua, amaute tunga vaihawmten amauh kap leh mau in, abawlsie uhi, Mangpa’n achi hi, tualeh sunnitumin, ni chin in ka min agensie uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Tuaziehin ka miten ka min athei ding ua, tuaziehin tua ni chiengin agenpa keima ka hi,” chi athei ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Muol leh taangte tunga khantanhoi tun-a, lemna thu tangkoupi a, tanchin kipahhuoi, silhoi tun a, hundamna thupha tangkoupi a Zion kunga, na “Pasian in vai ahawm hi” chi mite, keng kilawm hina va-ia e.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Na galvengmite aw ngaitah in akikou ding ua, aw ngaitahin la asa khawm ding uhi. Aziehpen Mangpa Zion a ahing kinuale kia chiengin, amauten amit ngei un amu ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Nou Jerusalem mun sesate aw, lungnopna toh la sa khawm un, aziehpen Mangpa’n amite ahamuon a, Jerusalem atandohta hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Mangpa’n nam zousie mitmu in aban siengthou a lemta a, tualeh kawlmong donga mi zousie in, i Pasian hundamna amu ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Pawtkhie un! Pawtkhie un! tua mun apat pawtkhie unlen, sil sienglou khoi sih un; nou Mangpa bel pawte aw, amanu lah apat hing pawtkhie unlen, Siengthou un.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Aziehpen kinawtah in na pawtkhe sih ding ua, na taikhieh thawlou ding uh ahi. Aziehpen Mangpa na masang ua pei ding ahia, tualeh Israelte Pasian na nua uh dalpa ahi ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Envawi ka suohpa’n piltah in abawl dinga, pahtawi leh sangtah a tawisangin a um ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Mi tampiten nang lamdang ahing sah bangun, amel khu mihing mel sanga suhsiet zoh in a um a, amel piendan lah mihing tate mel puohdan sanga, suhmelsiet in a um zaw nalai hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Tuachi’n Aman nam tampite athekhum dinga, Ama ziehin leengten akam uh ahum ding uhi; aziehpen ama’ukunga kihil khalou silte amu ding ua, azah khalou uh silte atheisiemta ding uhi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="53" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Ka thu puoh uh koi ahiei gingta? Tualeh Mangpa khut zong koi kunga kihil ahiei?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Aziehpen ama khu amasang ah, singnou dawng banga hing khangdoh bang leh, leigaw a ahui apat hingkhangkhie bang ahia, lim leh mel kilawmna mawngmawng anei sih a, ama imu chiengin i lunggulna dingin hoina leh, kilawmna mawngmawng aum sih hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Ama mite simmaw leh nuol in a um a, danate nei mi leh lungkhamna theimi ahi; ama lah ah imai phuol bangmai ihi ua, Ama simmaw in a um a, eiten lah ingaisah tuom sih uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Adihtah in Aman inatnate apuo a, i danate apo tahpi hi hinanleh eiten lah, Pasian vuoh leh bawl genthei in ingai uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Hinanleh itatkhelnate ziehin Ama liemsahin a um a, igitlounate ziehin vuohsidup in a um hi; ilungmuonna dingun gawtna atungah atung a, akivuohna huoltaite ah suhdam in i umta hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />I bawn un belam bangin ina vahmangta ua, michin eima lampi chiet ah ina pielta uhi; tualeh Mangpa’n ibawn ua, igitlounate uh ama tung ah angata hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Ama simmaw leh suhgenthei in a um a, hinapiin ama’n akam akeeh sih hi, sa thana mun a, gawding belamnou banga peipi in a um a; belam amulmette masanga adai dide bangin, akam akeeh sih hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Ama suongkul apat leh vaihawmna apat a, lahdoh in a um a, Koiin ahiei ama tungthu sut a genta ding? Aziehpen Ama mihing gam akipat, satkhieh in a um a, Ka mite tatkhelna ziehin suhgenthei in a um hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Tualeh amaun ahan migiloute toh, abawlpieh ua, tualeh ashi nuain mihausa kungah a um zawta hi, gumtatna abawl ngai sih a a kam a, zehotna mawngmawng a um ngailou ziehin.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Ahivang in Mangpa’n ama vuohsidup a a um khu, hoi anasah mawng ahia, dana athuohsahta ngut ngei a, Ahinna khelna ding a sillat a na bawl chiengin, aman ahah asuonte amu dinga, adamsung nite asau sah ding hi. Tualeh ama khut ah Pasian deilam alawching ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Aman ahinna nauvei thuohgimna amu dinga, alungkimta ding hi. Ka suoh dihtatin atheinain, mi tampi siem atangsah ding hi; Aziehpen aman athulimlounate uh apuoh pieh ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Tuaziehin, miliente tanvou ama ka hawm ding a, tualeh mihatte toh gallah sum ahawm ding hi; Ahinna shikhop hiela a sunbuoh zieh in; tualeh takhielte toh simkhawm in aumta a, tualeh mi tampite khelna a puo a, Tualeh mikhielte a dingin thu anget pieh hi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="54" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />“Aw ta nei ngailou a chiing nu, nuomsatah in la sa in! Nang nauvei ngailou nu la sa in kikou khie inlen, ngaitah in kikou in! Aziehpen pasal nei nu tate sangin, lungzuongnu tate atamzaw uhi, Mangpa’n achi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Na puonbuh mun kehlien inlen, na tenna puonbuh tungte zahlien inlen, khet sinlen, na khaute susau inlen, na khetphimte detsah in.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Aziehpen zietlang leh vei lang ah na kehlien dinga, nahah nasuonten namte gou aluo ding ua, tualeh khopi Kisesa te ah tenna abawl ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />“Zau vawt sin, aziehpen na zum sih dinga, na zalasih ding a, selphou in zong na um sih ding hi. Na khangdawng zumna na manghilta dinga, tualeh na meithai minsietna, na thei ngitnget nawn sih ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Nang hing siempa khu na pasal ahita dinga, galkapte Mangpa khu amin ahi; tualeh nang hing Tanpa khu Israel Mi Siengthoupa ahi a, Ama pen leitung pumpi Pasian akichi ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Aziehpen nang zi khulsa lungsim a chimaw nu, tualeh khanglai zi khensa hatkia bangin, Mangpa’n ahing han hi, na Pasian in achi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Hun tomnoukhat sung kang taisan a, hinanleh lainatna thupitah in ka hing pui kia ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Ka thangpaina sousan laitah in, hun tomnoukhat ka mai ka phuol a, Hinanleh kumtawn khotuona toh na tungah, lainatna ka nei ding hi; Nang hing Tanpa Mangpa’n achi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />“Aziehpen tami kei a dingin Noah damlai tuite bang ahi a, Noah damlai tuite in leitung atum nawn sih ding, chi’n ka kichiemta a, tuamabangin na tungah ka lungthah nawn sih dinga, ka hing phawh nawn sih ding hi, chi-in ka kichiemta hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Taangte peimangin, muolte kisuonta nanleh, ka hepina nang akipat apeimang sih dinga, ka hamuonna thuhun zong, nang akipat akisuon mang sih ding hi, Mangpa na tunga khotuona neipa’n achi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />“Aw nang suhgenthei, huipi mut leng leh hamuon lou, En in, suongmantam chi tuom tuom a na suongte lem ding ka hi, na suongphumte Saphire suongmantam in ka lem ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Na inntung sipvum Rubi suongin ka bawl dinga, na kotpite kristal suongin ka bawl ding a, na kulbangte suongmantam ngen a bawl ding ka hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Na tate zousie Mangpa’n thu ahil dinga, tualeh na tate hamuonna athupi mama ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Dihtatna a phudet nahi dinga, bawlgentheina in ahing gamlat dinga, na zau nawnsih ding hi, tualeh sil zauhuoite apat na gamlata dinga, na kung nai a aum nawn tahlou ding ziehin.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Ngai in, adihtah in akikhawm ding ua, kei zieh hilou in. Nang hing dou dinga kikhawm pouma, nangma ziehin apua ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />En in, Pum zap a, meihol amsah a, anasepna ding vanzah hiem-hei bawl, siakhengpa bawlpa Keima ka hi a, Tualeh suse ding in, suse mi zong ka siem hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Nangma douna ding galvan bawl pouma, alawching sih dinga, tualeh vaihawmna a nang hing kal, lei chinteng siemlou na tangsah ding hi. Tami Mangpa suohte goutan ahi. Adihtatna uh keima akipat ahi,” Mangpa’n achi hi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="55" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />“Hingpei un! nou dangta poumate aw, tam mun a tui a um hi, nou sum neiloute zong hing pei unlen, lei unlen, ne un! Ahi, hing pei unlen, uoin leh bawngnawi sum pelou in, aman bei in lei un.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Bangdinga ann hiloupi sum seng na hi uoi? gilvana lou dinga bangdinga tha seng na hi uoi? Pilvangtahin ka thu ngai unlen, ahoi hoi ne un. Na hinna uh ann neh hoi in kipah sah un.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Na bil uh hing daw unlen, ka kungah hing pei un, na hin theina ding un, ngai un. Noute toh kumtawn thuhun David kunga, hepina ka chiem hingpe vang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Ngai un, ama mipite a dinga theipitu dingin ka bawl a, mipite lamkaipa leh houtu in ka guot hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Ngai un, na thei ngailou uh namte na han ding ua, Mangpa na Pasian leh Israelte Mi Siengthoupa ziehin, nou hing thei ngailou namte na kungah ahing pei ding uhi, aziehpen Aman noute ahing pahtawita hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />“Mu bai dinga a um lai in Mangpa sui unlen, anai lai in ama han un.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Migilouin a umdan tawpsan henlen, midihtatlou in angaituonate tawpsan henlen, Mangpa kungah hing kinuale kia heh. Aman ana khotuo dinga, i Pasian kungah kile kia heh, Aman ana ngaidam mama ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Aziehpen ka ngaituonate lah, ka ngaituonate uh ahisih a, na umdante uzong ka umdan ahi sih hi, Mangpa’n achi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Aziehpen vante leitung sanga asan zoh mabangin, ka umdante na umdante uh sangin asangzaw a, tualeh na ngaituonate uh sangin, ka ngaituonate asangzaw hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />“Van akipat guo leh vua ahing zu suh a, akiatou nawn sih a, bu chi thepa kungah haichi apie a, ane mi kunga ann apieh theina dingin tui abuoh a, apousah a, adawnsuong sah hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Tuamabangin ka kam akipat in thu apawt dinga, bangma louin ka kung ah ang kile kia sih dinga, Ka deilam atangtung sah dinga, tualeh ka sawlna zieh khu alawching sah ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />“Lungnopna toh na kuonkhe ding ua, Lungmuong tah a puiin na um ding ua, muol leh taangte na masang uah la sain akikou ding ua, gamlah singkungten khut abeng ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Ling taangin tasing apou dinga, tualeh khauling nei taangin mui sing apou ding hi, tua khu Mangpa a dinga min phatna ding leh, kumtawn a chiemtena ahi dinga, suhsiet in a um nawn sih ding hi.”
  </para>
  <chapter number="56" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Mangpa’n tambangin agen hi: “Dihtahin vaihawm unlen, dihtattah in sil bawl un. Ka hundamna hing tung ding ahita, tualeh ka dihtatna zong suhlat a um pai ding ahita hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Tami bawl mi leh tami tudet chinten mi leh, Khawlni subua lou a, tang hoi mi, sil gilou bawllou dinga khut veng hoi mi,” ahampha hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Mangpa toh kizop gamdang mi in: “Mangpa’n amite lah akipat ahing tuom-khen vawt ahita,” chi sih henlen, tualeh michilgein zong, “Kei pen singkung gaw ka hibou hi” chi sih heh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Aziehpen Mangpa’n tambangin agen hi: “Michilge ka khawlni tanga, ka deilam telte leh ka thuhun tudet chintente kungah;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Ka inn sung leh ka kulbang sung ah, amaute a dinga, tapate leh tanute sanga manphazaw, kumtawn a mang nawnlou ding, mun leh min ka pe ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />“Gamdang mi Mangpa nasem ding leh, Mangpa min it te, Ama be dinga, Ama toh kizop a, Khawlni subua lou a tangte leh, ka thuhun tudet poumate zong;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Amaute nangawn ka taang siengthou ah ka pui dinga, tualeh ka thumna inn ah lungnop tahin ka um sah dinga, ahalmang sillatte uleh akithoinate uh, ka maitam tung ah pom in a um ding hi. Aziehpen ka inn namte zousie adingin, thumna inn akichi ding hi, achi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Nawmanga um Israelte puikhawmpa Mangpa Pasian in, akung apuikhawmsate ban ah, adangte zong akungah ka puikhawm nalai ding hi,” achi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Nou gamsate zousie hing pei un, gammang sate zousie, anetum sieng dingin hing pei un.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Israel galvengte mitto ahi ua, bangma theilou ngen ahi uh, amaute ui ham theilou ngen ahi ua, akawh thei sih uhi, alusu ua, alum suh ua, imut du mi ahi uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Ahi, amauh ui huoiham, hunta chi nei ngailou ahi ua, tualeh theisiemna neilou belampute ahi uhi. A bawn un amauh lampi chiet aki-et ua, michin in ama metna ding asui uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />“Hing pei un,” zu ka va la dinga, zu chia idawnkhawm ding hi, “Zing chiengin zong tuni mabang ahi dinga, tu a sangin ahoizaw tham nalai ding hi,” achi uhi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="57" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Midihtatte amangzel ua, Koiman lungtangin angaituo ngai sih hi. Zangai thei mite zong lahmangin a um ua, sil hoilou hing tung ding akipat midihtatte lahmang in, a um uh chi koiman angaituo ngai sih hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Lungmuonna ah alut ding ua, alupna uah akhawl tawldam ding ua, michin ama dihna a umpoumate.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Hinanleh nou aisansiem nu tapate, angkawm leh kizuate, hahlesuonte aw, tanah hing pei un.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Nuizat bawlna a nanei uh koi ahiei? koi tungah ahiei na kam uh golpi a na kaah ua, nalei uh nahah khum uh? mi khielte tate leh zuou theite tate hilou nahi uoi mah?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Noute sing hing bawh chinteng nuoi a, milimte toh kinou a, phai zang leh suongpi kawmte lah a, tate that zelte hilou na hi uoi mah?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Lui guom sung suong mam lah ah, na tanvou uh a uma, tuate mama na tanvou uh ahi, amaute kungah dawn sillatte na sungbuo ua, ann sillatte na lan uhi. Tamte kitheimaw bawla, kilungkim sah ding ka hiei mah?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Muolsang tungah na lupna uh napha ua, tua mun mama ah kithoina lan dingin na kuontou uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Kotkha nualam leh kotbiengte ah, theizingna na tung ua, Kei ding hilouin midangte a dingin na lupna uh, na hawhkhie ua, na kaltou ua, na lupna uh na sulien ua, amautoh thuhun na bawl ua, akhut ua ang kawina uh, lupna tung na lunggul denta uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Sathau namtui kinuthaw toh Molek kungah na haw ua, na gimnamtuina uh na belap ua, na palaite uh gamlapi ah na sawl ua, sheol nangawn ah na sawlsuh uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Na peina uh lampi sau ziehin na gim ua, hinanleh “Kinepna a um sih na chi ngai sih ua,” na hatna uh siemthana na mu ua, Tuaziehin na basam ngai sih uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Koi giing leh zau a, Kei hing theikhata lou a, zuou na gen ua, na lungtang ua zong na ngaituo ngailou uh? Hun sawtpi ka khongai zieh hilou ahiei mah, agiin a nang giinlou uh?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Na dihtatnate uleh na nasepte uh ka genlang ding, bangma na phattuompi lou ding ziehun.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Na kikou chiengun, na milim koikhawmte un hing hundoh uheh. Hinanleh amauh hui in atawmang sieng dinga, nahna hu in amauh amut mang ding hi. Hinanleh kei hing muongten gam anei ding ua, ka muol siengthou aluo ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />“Tualeh sungvum un, sung vum un, alampi bawl unlen, ka mite lampi akipat akipalpua theinate uh hemkhie un,” achi ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Aziehpen Mitungnung tawisang a umpa kumtawn Mi, “Amin Siengthoupa’n tambangin agen hi; Kei mun sang leh siengthou ah ka tenga, mi kingaingiemte hagau suhhal ding leh, mi kisia tentunte lungtang suhal dingin, lungtang a kisia tentunte leh, kingaingiemte kungah zong ka um hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Aziehpen kumtawn in kadou sih dinga, ka lungthah ngitnget sam sih ding hi. Tua chilouin, ka masang ah mihing lungsim aba gawp dinga, ka bawlsa ahinna uh zong agim gawp kha ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />A huoihamna khelna ziehun kana lungthah a, ka vuo a, ka kiphuol a, ka thangpai hi. Hinanleh a lungtang dei dan dan un anuatol kia ta uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />A umdante uh ka muta a, ka damsah dinga, amauh ka pui nalai dinga, amauleh, asuunpite hamuonna toh ka siemtha ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Keima’n akam ga uh ka siem a; lungmuonna, lungmuonna, gamlapi leh, anai a umte kungah um hen, Mangpa’n achi hi; tualeh amauh ka damsah ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Hinanleh migiloute pen, tuipi kihot um khinkhien theilou bang a, atuite’n buonnawi leh, sil nieh ahing nawkhiet zel bang ahi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Migiloute a dingin lungmuonna a um sih hi,” ka Pasian in achi hi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="58" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />“Ngaitah in kikou inlen kidiem sin, Pengkul banga ngaiin na aw suo vengvong inlen, ka mite a tatkhelnate theisah inlen, Jakob inn kuonte kungah akhelna uh hil in.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Nichin in kei ahing sui ua, tualeh ka lampite thei akilawp ua, dihtatna bawl leh, a Pasian uh danpiehte taisan ngailou namte bang in, vaihawmna dih kei ahing dong ua, Pasian nai akilawp uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Bangziah a ka ann ngawl uh, nang mulou ahiei? ka hinna uh sugenthei unga nang theilou ahiei? achi uhi. Ngai un, na ann ngawl ni chiengun, nouma nopsahna ding na kibawl ua, na nasemte uh na nuoisie uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Ngai un, kihauna ding leh kinielna ding, tualeh gitlouna khuttum a kituptuona bep a, ann na ngawl uh ahibou hi; Na aw uh tunglam a akizahna dingin, tuni a na ann ngawl bang ua, na ngawllou ding uh ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Tambanga ann ngawl ka deilam leh, mihing khat a dinga nikhat ahinna suhgenthei, ka deilam ahiei mah? luonglau kung banga alu uh kunsuh a, saiip puon pha a, vut lah a lup khu, ann ngawlna ahiei mah? Tua khu ann ngawlna leh Mangpa dinga, ni kipahhuoi na chi ding uoi?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />“Ka deilam ann ngawlna ahileh, gitlouna kolbute sutkhiet a, puohgih gihtahte lahkhiet a, suhgenthei deldoh a umte zalen sah a, hahkol chinteng suhtan pieh ahi zaw sih amah?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Na tanghou gilkielte kunga hawm leh, mi zawng deldoh a umte na in sunga, hing puilut ahi sih amah? Saguoh a umte na mu chienga puon silsah a, nangma tahsa bang puo apat a, kibuh lou ahisih amah?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Tua hun chiengin na vah zingmawng ni suoh bangin, ahing taangkhe dinga, na damna ahing kilang pai dinga, na dihtatna na masangah apei dinga, Mangpa thupina khu na kipahman, ahing ahita ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Tua hun chiengin na han dinga, Mangpa’n ang dawng ding hi. Na kikou dinga, Aman tanah um inge, ahing chi ding hi. “Na lah ua kipat hahkolte, khutme a kikohnate, leh gitlouhamte na koimang uleh;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Gilkiel dangtate a dinga na hinna na zah a, suhgenthei a umte hinna na taisah leh, na vah miel lah ah avah dinga, tualeh na mielna khu suntanglai abang ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Mangpa’n ahing pui ngitnget ding a, gamgaw chiengin zong na hinna a taisah dinga, na gute zong ahatsah ding hi; tualeh tui in atapnom huon bang na hi dinga, tuinah kang ngailou tuikhuh bang na hi ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Tualeh nangma akipat a hing pieng ding miten, mun lui sesate alamtha kia ding ua, Khang tampite suongphumte, nangman na tungding kia dinga, tualeh nangpen Asesate bawltha kia pa leh, tenna dinga gawlzingte siemtha pa ahing kichi ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />“Khawlni tanglou ding leh ka ni siengthou, nangma deidan dan a bawllou dinga, na kengte na lehei a; Khawlni kipahhuoi ahi na chi a, Mangpa ni siengthou zatathuoi na chi a, Ama na zatat a, nangma ut dan dan a umlou a, nangma deidan a zong umlou a nangma deidan thu, na mawhgen sih pou leh;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Tuachi’n Mangpa tungah na kipah dinga, tualeh Ken leitung muol sangte ah ka hing tuongsah dinga, na pu Jakob gouluo, neilelamte in ka hing va ding hi; aziehpen Mangpa kam in tami ana genta hi.”
  </para>
  <chapter number="59" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Ngaiun, Mangpa khut hundam theilou dinga, suh tom ahi sih a azah theilouna dinga, abil binsah ahi sih hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Hinanleh na thulimlounate un, na Pasian ua kipat in noute ahing khenkheta hi; tualeh na khelnate un, nouma akipat in, amai aliemangta a, tuaziehin ahing za thei sih ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Aziehpen na khutte uh sisan a buasah in a um a, na khutmete uh khelna in abua hi, na kam un zuouthu agen a, na leite uh gitlouna thu gen in aphun nem nom hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Koiman vaihawmna dih ahan ngai sih a, koiman thutah agen pieh ngai sih hi; ama un thumanlou agingta ua, zuouthu agen uhi. Silgilou apai ua, thulimlouna ahingkhie uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Thangtom tui opkhum in akeusah ua, Momlen puon in agan uhi; atui nekha pouma ashi ua, tualeh suhkeh a umte apat in gulsie ahing keudoh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />A momlente ulah puonsil in apang sih dinga, anasepte uh asil vawt sih ding ua, anasepte ulah gitlouna nasep ahi a, gumtatna nasep akhut uah a um hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />A kengte uh silgilou del in atai a, mawnaneiloute sisan suo dingin anawtat uhi, angaituonate uh thulimlouna ngaituona ahi a, sietna leh manthaina alampite uah a um hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Lungmuonna lampi athei sih ua, alampi uah dihna a um sih hi; ama ua dingin lamkawi akibawl ua, tuami lampi a pei poumain, lungmuonna athei sih ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Tuaziehin thudihna eite akipat in agamlata hi, dihtatna in zong ahing nuaphah sih hi; khovah ingah ua, hinanleh mielna ahizel hi; khovahna isui ua, hinanleh khomiel lah ah ivah zel uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Mittote bangin baang imai kawi ua, tualeh mitneilou bangin ikimai kawi kawi ua, suntang lai nangawn in khomielzui a pei bangin, i kisuikha zel uhi; mihatte lah a mishi bang ihi uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Vompite bangin ibawn un iham leulou ua, vakhu bangin ithum ngut ngut uhi; thudih a vaihawmna ingah ua hinanleh a um sih, Hundamna ingah ua, hinanleh eima akipat in, gamla tah ah a um zel hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Aziehpen ka suhkhelnate uh na masangah a um a, ka khelnate un kouma ahing heh hi; ka suhkhelnate uh ka kung ua a um zing ziehin, ka tatkhelnate uh ka thei uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Mangpa tung a takhiel leh zuou in, i Pasian akipat in ipeimang ua, nuoisiena leh helna thute gen in, lungtanga zuouthute pai in, igenkhie uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Thudih a vaihawmnain ahing kinua hei santa a, dihtatna gamlapi ah a ding hi; thutah gawlzinga apuatah ziehin, dihna alut thei nawn sih hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Tuachi’n thutah a umnawn sih a, sil hoilou tawpsante lah, gallah in akibawl zel a, Tuachi’n Mangpa’n amuta a, thudih a vaihawmna a um sih a, Mangpa alungkim sahta sih hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Ama’n mi koima umlou athei a, thunget pieh ding mawngmawng a umlou, lam dang asa hi; Tuaziehin Ama ban mama in, Hundamna akibawl a, Ama dihtatna mama in atukip hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Aziehpen dihtatna khu awmphaw bangin asil a, Hundamna lukhu alu ah akhuh a, Phubalahna puonsilte puonsil in anei a, phatuomngaina puonahtuol bangin asil hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />A silbawlte uh dungzui in, Aman asilbawlte uh dungzui mama in athuh ding hi, Ama doumite lungthahna in, amelmate thuhna in athuh ding a, tuipipanga gamte thuhna in phuba ala ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Tuachi’n Mangpa min khu tumlam akipat in, agiing ding ua, tualeh athupina zong nisuohna lam akipat in, agiing ding uhi; Tuisanglet banga galte ahing kuon chiengin, Mangpa hagau in, amauh dou in puonlap a domsang ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />“Zion ah Tanpa ahing pei ding a, Jakobte lah a khelna kiheimangsante kungah, ahing tung ding hi, Mangpa’n achi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />“Kei ka hileh, amaute toh ka thuhun tami ahi, Mangpa’n achi hi: Ka hagau na tung ua um leh, ka thu na kam ua ka koiten, tua kipat kumtawn dongin na kam uleh, nahah nasuonte kam leh nahah nasuonte, hahlesuonte kam a pawtsan nawn sih ding hi,” Mangpa’n achi hi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="60" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Thou inlen taangkhie in, aziehpen na vah ahing tungta a! Mangpa thupina na tungah ahing suohta hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Aziehpen ngai in, mielna in leitung akhu khum dinga, miel satah in mite akhu ding hi; hinanleh Mangpa na tungah asuoh dinga, tualeh athupina khu na tungah akimu ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Tualeh Jentelte na vah ah ahing pei ding ua, tualeh leengte khu na hing suohdohna vahna ah, ahing pei ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Dahkhie inlen, na kim na pam en vel in abawn un akikhawm ua, na kungah, ahing pei uhi; na tate uh gamlapi akipat in ahing pei ding ua, na tanute uzong amauh kemten, a ang uah ahing pom ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Tua hun chiengin na mu dinga, na vahta dinga, na lungtang kipah in akithing dinga, suhlet in a um ding hi. Tuipi hausatnate nang lam ah ahing kihei dinga, Jentelte hausatna in nang ahing zuon ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Sangawngsau tampiten na gam atuom dim dinga, Midian leh Ephah gam leh, Sheba gam akipat in, sangawngsau tung tuong mite ang pei ding, amauten sana leh gimnamtui ahing puoh ding ua, Mangpa phatna aphuongzah ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Kedar ganhon zousie na kungah ahing kikhawm ding ua, Nebaioth belamtalten na nna asem ding ua, ka maitam tungah kipahtahin akaltou ding ua, ka thupina inn khu ka pahtawi ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Tam meilum banga lengkawi kawite leh, vahui a bu zuon a leengte banga, lengkawi kawite koite ahi uoi?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Adihtahin, tuipipanga gamten keima ahing ngah ding ua, Tarshish tembawte ahing masa ding ua, Mangpa na Pasian min Israelte Misiengthoupa, pahtawi dingin gamlapi akipat in na tapate uh, a sana uleh a dangkate utoh ahing puo uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Gamdang miten na kulbaang alamtha ding ua, tualeh aleengpate un na nna asem ding uhi; ka thangpaina ziehin, ka hing sat a, hinanleh kang deisah a, na tunga khotuona ka nei ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Tuaziehin na kotpite akihong ngitnget dinga, sun leh zan in kha ahi sih ding hi, tuachi’n miten Jentelte hausatna ahing polut ua, aleengte uzong kizui a ahing puilut theina ding un.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Aziehpen nangma nna sem utlou nam leh, leenggamte abeimang ding ua; Ahi, tua namte suhsiet dimdem in a um ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Lebanon thupina na kungah ahing pei dinga, tasingte phan singte leh vongnam singten, ka mun siengthou kilawmtah in azem ding ua, ka keng ngapna mun thupitah in ka bawl ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Nou hing sugentheite tapate zong na kung uah, kun in ahing pei ding uhi; tualeh nou hing simmawte zousie, na kengtaw nuoi ah abohkhup ding uhi; tualeh nangpen Mangpa khopi Israelte Mi Siengthoupa, Zion ahing chi ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Koima totkhah ngailou, muda leh taisan hinanlachin, kumtawn a suon umpen khang tampite kipahna dingin, ka hing bawl ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Nam zousie nawitui na tep dinga, tualeh leengte nawitui zong na tep ding hi. Tuachi’n kei Mangpa na Hundampa uleh, nou hing Tanpa leh Jakob mi hatpa ka hi, chi nang thei ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Sum-eng taangin sana, kang puoh dinga, sia tangin dangka, sing tangin sum-eng, ka hing puoh ding hi; na vaihawmte uh dihtatna ka guon ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Na gamsung uah gumtatna mawngmawng, akiza nawn sih dinga, sietna leh manthaina na gamgi sungah, zah ahinawn sih ding hi. Na kulbaangte uh Hundamna na chi ding ua, na kotpite uh phatna, ahi zawta ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Ni khu, sun chienga nangma hing salvah ahinawn sih ding a, hapi zong nangma hing salvah ahi tuom sih ding hi. Mangpa na kumtawn vah ahita dinga, na Pasian khu na thupina ahi zawta ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Ni atum ngai nawn sih dinga, hapi zong amang ngai nawn sih ding hi; Mangpa khu na kumtawn vah ahita ding a, na da leh kana nite abeita ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Na mite zousie zong mi dihtat ahita ding ua, kumtawn in gam aluodenta ding ua, pahtawi a ka um theina dingin, keima phudoh, ka khutsuoh ahita ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Na lah ua tawmpen zong tulkhat a hing pha dinga, aneupen zong nam hattah ahing hi ding hi. Kei Mangpa ka hi a, a huntah a bawl pai ding ka hi, achi hi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="61" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Mangpa hagau khu ka kungah aum a, Aman gentheite kunga khantan hoi gen dingin, Mangpa’n sathau ahing nuta hi. Aman lungtang hasete damsah ding leh, saltangte kunga suotatna thu gen ding, tualeh suongkul taangte hadohna ding, thu phuong dingin, kei ahing sawl hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Mangpa lungdam kum thu leh, i Pasian phubalahna ni phuongdoh ding leh, da leh kapte hamuon dingin,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Zion a dalekapte henem ding leh, vut taanga pahkhi pe ding, da leh kaana taanga lungnopna sathau pe ding leh, nguina hagau taanga phatna puon pe dingin, kei ahing sawl hi; Mangpa pahtawi a a um theina dinga, amauh dihtatna singte, Mangpa phusa akichi theina ding un.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Tualeh amaun munlui sesate alamtha kia ding ua, masanglai a kitaisansate atungding kia ding ua, Khang tampi luolou a um khopite abawlpha kia ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Gamdang miten na belamhonte uh, ahing vah pieh ding ua, thei ngai lou gamdang mite na loute uh hou leh, na grep huonte uh hing kep piehin apang ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Hinanleh noute pen Mangpa siempute, chi a min law in na um ding ua, miten i Pasian nasemte ahing chi ding uhi. Nouten namte hausatna na ne ding ua, athupina uh na kiletsahpi ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Na zumna taang un aleni a zatatna na mu ding uhi; lungbuoina taangin atanvou uah akipah ding uhi; tuaziehin amauh gam sungah, aleni a gouluona atang ding ua, kumtawn lungnopna ama ua ahita ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Aziehpen Kei Mangpa’n thudih a vaihawmna ka it a, halmang sillat dinga, guhtatna ka huo hi, anasep uah keiman thutah ka kohmu dinga, amaute toh kumtawn thuhun ka hung ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Ahah asuonte uh namte lah ah akithei dinga, tualeh atate uzong, mipite lah ah thei in a um ding uhi; amauh mu poumain Mangpa guolzawl ahi uh, achi ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Mangpa ah nahpitahin ka kipah dinga, ka Pasian ah ka hinna anuom ding hi; aziehpen ama’n mouneidingpa pahkhigui a akizep a, mounu ding zong suong manpha a akizep bangin, Aman kei hundamna puonsilte ahing silsah a, dihtatna puonahtuol ahing silsah hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Leitung in sil adawn suong sah a, huon in haichi akhankhieh sah bangin, Mangpa Pasian in dihtatna leh, phatna apoudoh sah ding hi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="62" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />A dihtatna uh vahpha mama banga ataankhieh a, ahundamna thaumei kuong banga akuon masangsie’n, Zion ziehin hamlouin ka um sih ding a, Jerusalem ziehin ka mawh um sih ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Nam zousie’n na dihtatna amu ding ua, tualeh leengte zousie in na thupina amu ding uhi; Mangpa kam in aphuo ding minthain, ahing kihanta ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Nang pen Mangpa khuta thupina, Manglukhu na hi dinga, tualeh na Pasian khut a thupina leenglukhu na hi ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Taisansa chi na hinawn sih dinga, na gam zong nuasiesa akichi nawn sih dinga, Hephzibah ahing kichi zawta dinga, na gam zong Beulah chi ahi zawta ding hi. Mangpa na tunga akipah ziehin na gam akitenpi ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Tangval in nungah siengthou akitenpi bangin, na tapaten nang ahing kitenpi ding uhi; Mouneipa mounu tunga akipah mabangin, Tuamabangin na Pasian na tungah akipah ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Aw Jerusalem na kulbang tungah galveng mi ka koita a, amauh sun leh zan in amawh um sih ding ua; Nou Mangpa theiphah a um mite aw, ham lou in um khinkhian sih un.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Ama zong um khinkhian sah sih un, Jerusalem asuhkip a leitunga phat huoi a, abawl masangsie in.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Mangpa akhut zietlam leh ahatna ban lou in akichiemta a, “Adihtahin na butangte uh na melmate uh ann neh dingin, ka pe nawn sih ding a; gamdang miten na sepsa na uoin tha uh, adawn nawn sih ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Hinanleh a lakhawmten ane ding ua, Mangpa aphat ding uhi; tualeh ahing tawikhawm miten, ka inn-huongsung siengthou ah adawn ding uhi.”
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Pei suoh un, ka kotpite ah pei suoh unlen, mipite a dingin lampi bawlpha un, Siel un, lamlienpi siel unlen, suongte tom sieng unlen, mite adingin puonlap domsang un!
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Ngai un, kawlmong dongin Mangpa’n aphuongzahta a, Zion tanu kungah “Ngai in, na hundamna ahing tungta, en in akipahman akungah a um a, anasep zong amasangah a um hi;” chi in gen un, achi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Tualeh ama ukhu, Mi Siengthou Mangpa tatsa mite achi ding ua, tualeh Nangpen, Suidoh taisanlou khopi, ahing chi ding uhi, chiin achi hi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="63" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Edom akipat a hing pei, Bozrah khuo akipat a, asandupa-kibum puon sil a hing pei, leengpuon thupitah a kizem a, athahatna thupitah toh kal suon a hing pei koi ahiei? “Keima dihtatna thugen a, hundam ding a hattah ka hi.”
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Bangzieh a na puonsil san a, na sil naten grep chilna khuh a kidie bang ahiei?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />“Keima tangin in grep chilna khuh kachilta a, mipite lah akipat koiman ang chilpi sih ua, lungthah pum a amauh ka totden ziehin leh, ka lungthah man a ka totchil ziehin, a sisan uh ka puonsilte tung ah akithe a, ka puonahtuol ah abaang hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Ka lungtang ah phuba lah ni a um a, tualeh ka Tatsate kum ahing tungta hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Ka en a, ang panpi ding koima a um sih a, tualeh atutang ding koima a umlou ziehin, lamdang ka sa hi; Tuaziehin keima ban mama in hundamna ahing tut a, ka lungthahna in keima ahing tudet hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Ka lungthahna ziehin mite ka tuonchil a, ka thangpaina ka dawnkham sah a, athahatna sisan uh tuol ah ka sungbota hi.”
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Mangpa’n sil bangkim ahing vua dungzui in, Mangpa itna hepina leh, Mangpa phatna thute ka gen ding a, akhotuona leh ahoina thupitah dungzui a, Israel innkuonte tunga asilbawl tampite, ka gen ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Aman amauh ka mite ahi tahtah ua, zuou lou ding tate ahi uh, achi hi. Tuachi’n Ama khu a hundampa uh ahing hita hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Suhgentheia a umna pouma uah, ama zong suhgenthei in a um a, A umpina vansawlsieng in amaute a hundamta hi; A itna leh khotuona in amauh a Tanta a, nidanglai nite tengteng ah amauh, puoin apom zel hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Hinanleh amaute ahel ua, A Hagau Siengthou alungkhamsah uhi. Tuachi’n Ama akihei a, amelma un alepanta a, amauh adouta hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Tuachi’n amaun khanglui lai a asuohpa Mosi leh, amite damlai nite athei zing ua, Tuipi akipat a abelamhonte uh chingpa toh, amaute hing puidohpa hei a um atai? Asung ua A Hagau Siengthou koipa, hei a um atai mah? Achi uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />A ban thupina toh, Mosi khut zietlam zanga, amauh puipa, Ama adinga kumtawn minthanna anga na ding a, amaute masanga tuipi kikhensahpa hei a um ahiei?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />A kipal pua louna ding ua, amauh gamdai a sakol puibanga, tuithuhpi kantan a puipa hei a um ahiei?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Phaijanga ganhon peisuh bangin, Mangpa Hagau in amauh akhawldamsah hi. Tuachi’n Nangma min thupitah a kibawlna dingin, na mite na pui zel hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Van akipat in hing en suh in, Na Sienthouna leh, na thupina umna mun akipat hing mu in. Na phattuomngaina leh na thahatna, koute nang ngaina leh hepina lungtang hei a um atai? phallou leh tawpsah atai mah?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Abraham in koute hing theilouin, Israel in hing donpha sih nanleh, ka pa uh na hi a, Aw Mangpa Nang ka pa uh na hi a; Namin kumtawn akipat ka Tanpa uh, ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Aw Mangpa, bangzieh a na lampi akipat a nang pielmang sah a, Nangma giinna apat a, ka lungtang uh nang suhkhau pieh ahiei mah? Na suohte Nangma goutan namte ziehin, hing kinuale kia in.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Na mi siengthouten na mun siengthou ka tang uh a, hinanleh hun tomkhat sung ahi bou hi; Ka melmate un na mun siengthou atuonchil gawpta uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Koute nidang lai a, na vaihawm khah ngainalou leh, na min a kihan ngailou mite ka bang khongkhongta uhi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="64" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Na masang a taangte akilinna dingun, vante phukeh in hing kum suh lachin aw!
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Mei in singkangte ahal kuong bangin, mei in tui asousah bangin, nang hing doute’n na min atheina ding uleh, na masanga namte akilinna dingin.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Ka kinepphah lou uh, sil chizat huoi na bawllai in, na hing kumsuh a, na masangah muol leh taangte akithing hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Leitung umchil akipat in ama ngah mi a dinga, bawlpieh nangma loungal Pasian dang, athei ngai sih ua, bil in aza ngai sih ua, mit in zong amu ngai sih uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Nang kipah tah a um leh dihtattah a bawlmi, tualeh na lampite a nangma hing thei ngitnget mi khu na kimupi zel a, Ngai in ka kheltah ziehun, Nang na lungthah a, tambang in ka khiel toupeh ua, tuachi’n hundam ngai ka hi uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Hinanleh ka bawnpi un sil sienglou bang ka hi ua, ka dihtatna zousie u’zong puonse nieh bang giap ahi, ka bawn un singna bangin ka vuoi sieng ua, ka khelnate un hui bangin ang tawmang zel hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Tualeh koiman na min ahan sih a, koima nang hing tu chinten dingin, akithathou sah sih a, aziehpen kou akipat na mai na phuolta a, ka gitlounate ziehun, nang mangthai sahta hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Hinanleh tuin vang Mangpa aw, ka pa uh na hi; Koute atungman ka hi ua, Nang belkhengpa na hi. Koute zousie na khut suoh ka hi uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Aw Mangpa lungthah seng sinlen, ka khelna uh kumtawn in thei ngitnget sin, Ahi, hing en in, Koute ka bawn un Na mite ka hi uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Na khopi siengthoute gamdai asuohta, Zion khopi nangawn gamdai asuohta hi, Jerusalem nangawn zong akilawita hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Ka pu le pate un nangma ahing phatna uh, ka biehinn siengthou uleh ka inn kilawmtah ukhu, mei in akatumta a, ka sil manphate uleh, deihuoi zousie asegawp siengta hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Aw Mangpa tambangteng nua a zong, kideh nalai ding na hiei mah? Hamlou phunlou a nasa sem a, hing sugenthei nalai ding na hiei mah?
  </para>
  <chapter number="65" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Ahing kan ngailoute sui in ka um a, ahing sui ngailoute mu in ka um a, Ka min a kihan ngailou namte kungah, “Tanah ka um hi, tanah ka um hi,” ka chi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Amauh ngaituona dungzui a, lampi hoilou a peite leh mi helhatte adingin, sun nitum in ka ban ka zah hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Ka maitang mama a hing phin lungthah ngitnget mite, huonsung pou a kithoi a, tehlei maitam tungte a gimnamtui hal te,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Haan lah ah atou ua, hanmuol lah ah agieh zel ua, vohsa ane ua abel sungte uah, sil kidahhuoi satui-hang ahuon uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />“Ki hemkhie in hing nai sin, nang sangin ka siengthou zaw hi,” achi uhi; tuate khu ka nahkaw hawm a meikhu um, sun nitum a meikuong ahi uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />En in, ka masang ah gelsa in a um hi; “Hamlou in ka sip khinkhien sih dinga, ka thuh dinga, a angsung ngei uah ka thuh ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Noute khelna leh na pu na pate uh khelnate toh, kang thuhkhawm ding hi, Mangpa’n achi hi; Amaun taang tungte ah gimnamtui ahal ua, muol tungte ah ka min agensie uhi; tuaziehin anasep masate uh a angsung ngei uah, kimtah in ka te ding hi.”
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Mangpa’n tambangin agen hi: “Grepga bom a uoin tha akimu a, miten suse sih un, asungah guolzawlna a um hi, achibang un, ka suohte zal in tuabangin ka bawl dinga, amaute abawn un ka sumang sih ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Jakob akipat in hahlesuon ka umdoh sah dinga, Juda akipat in ka muol leh taangte, luo ding mi ka umdoh sah dinga, Ka mi telten tuo khu aluo ding ua, ka suohte tuanah ateng ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Kei hing sui ka mite a dingin, Sharon khu belam hon huong ahi dinga, tualeh Akor phaijang khu ganhonte, lupna mun ahita ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Hinanleh noute pen, Mangpa na taisan a, Ka taang siengthou manghil a, Gad pasien a dinga annkuong luite leh Meni pasien a dinga, dawn sillat na lan mite na hi uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Tuaziehin ka hing hat laiin nang dawng sih ua, thu ka gen laiin na ngai sih ua, ka mit mu ah sil hoilou na bawl ua, ka kipahpi lou silte na tel zoh ziehun, namsau a shi dingte lah ah, Kang simkhawm dinga, kithana mun a tha dingin na bawn un, na kun chiet ding uhi.”
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Tuaziehin Mangpa Pasian in tambangin agen hi: “En in, ka suohten ane ding ua, hinanleh noute na gilkiel ding uhi; En in, ka suohten adawn ding ua, hinanleh noute na dangta ding uhi; En in, ka suohten nuom asa ding ua, hinanleh noute na zum ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />En in, ka suohten lungnuom tah in la asa ding ua; hinanleh noute pen lungtanga dana toh nakap ding ua, Hagau a lungkhama chimaw in, Kap leh mau in na um ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Nouten na min uh hamse dingin ka mitelte kungah, na nuasie ding uhi; aziehpen Mangpa Pasian in noute ang that dinga, asuohte min tuom in ahanta ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Tuachi’n leitunga ama leh ama thupha kipepa khu, thutah Pasian ah thupha akipe ding hi; leitunga mi akichiem leh, thutah Pasian min in akichiem ding hi; aziehpen masanglai a lungkhambuoinate manghil ahita a, ka mitmu akipat akiselmangta ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Aziehpen “En vawi, van tha leh lei tha ka siem hi; sil masate kithei ngitnget nawnlou dinga, lungsim ah zong kiphawhkha nawnlou ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Hinanleh ka sil siemte ah kumtawn in kipah in, lungnuom un; Aziehpen Envawi, Jerusalem lungnopna in ka siem a, amite zong kipahna in ka siem hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Jerusalem tungah ka lungnuom ding a, ka mite tungah zong ka kipah ding hi; a sungah kaana aw akiza nawn sih ding a, mauna aw zong a kiza nawn vawtsih ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Asungah naungeh ni tomnoukhat dam chi a um nawn sih dinga, tehsia a damsung nite kuitung lou a um sih ding hi; naupang kum zakhat a upa in ashi dinga, hinanleh mikhiel kum zakhat damte hamse thuoh ahi ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Inn alam ding ua, asung ah ateng ding uhi, grep huonte abawl ding ua, aga ane ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Midang tenna dingin inn alam nawn sih ding ua; midangte neh dingin grep huonte abawl nawn sih ding uhi. Aziehpen ka mite dam kum, singte dam kum toh kibang ding hi. Ka mi tel tuomten akhut nasep ga uh sawtpi ane ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Amaun amawhna’n na asem sih ding ua, vangse ding giap in tate anei nawn sih ding uhi, aziehpen ama uleh atate uh pum in, Mangpa guolzawl hahlesuonte ahi ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Tualeh hichi ahi dinga, ahing hat masang un ka dawng dinga, agen lai lai un ka za ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Ngie leh belamnou agamta khawm ding ua, humpibahnei in zong bawngtal bangin, bupawl aneta ding hi; tualeh leivuite gulpi ann neh ahita ding hi. Ka taang siengthou ah akisuna nawn sih ding ua, akisuse nawn sih ding uhi,” Mangpa’n achi hi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="66" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Mangpa’n tambangin agen hi; “Van ka mangtoupha ahi a, leitung ka keng ngapna ahi; Kei a dinga na hing inn bawlpieh dinguh, hei a um ahiei? Ka khawlmun ding heisung hi ding ahiei?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Aziehpen tam silte zousie ka khut in abawlta a, tua silte ahing um uhi; Mangpa’n achi hi. Hinanleh mi gentheitah a um, lungsim kisia tuntun, tualeh ka thu a chitun zel mi ka en zaw ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />“Bawngtal that mi pouma pen, mihing that bang ahi, Belamnou a kithoi mi zong, ui ngawng hehtan bang ahi; ann sillat lan mi zong voh sisan lan bang ahi. Gimnamtui hal a lan pouma zong, Milim bie bang ahi. Amauh lampi chiet akitel ua, ahinna un akidahhuoina uh akipahpi uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Tuaziehin ken zong amaute adingin, vangsietna ka tel dinga, agiin pen uh atung uah ka tungsah ding hi. Aziehpen ka hat chiengin koiman ang dawng sih ua, thu ka gen chiengin, koiman ang ngaikhe nuom sih uhi.”
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Nou Athuza a chitunte aw, Mangpa thu ngaikhie un, “Noute hing muda a, ka min zieh a, hing notdoh na unaute un, na kipahna ka mu theina dingun, Mangpa pahtawi in umta hen, achi uhi. Hinanleh azum ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />“Khopi sung akipat husa vengvung ngai un, biehinn akipat aw ging, amelmate tung a kimtah a, Mangpa phuba lahna thawm ging ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />“Amanu’n anauvei masangin ta anei a, nauvei natna anei masangin, tapa aneikhie hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Tambang sil koi in azakha ngai ei? Tambang sil koi in amukha ngai ei? Nikhat thu in gam khat apieng thei diei? ahisihleh thakhat thu in nam khat apieng thei diei? Hinapiin Zion in nau aveitah in tate aneikhe pai hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Nau nei hun tungsah ngal inga, ka suohkhesah pai sih ding amah? Mangpa’n achi hi. Kei nau piengsah zelpa’n, naubu ka bing sah ding amah? na Pasian in achi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />“Nou Jerusalem it zousiete aw, ama lungnoppi unlen, ama toh kipah khawm un, ama nada nakapite zousie aw, ama kipahpi in lungnuom un.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Na tep ua ahamuonna nawite a, na tai theina dingun leh, na dawn tam ua athupina kiningchingtah a, na kipah theina ding uh ahi,” achi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Mangpa’n tambangin agen hi: “Ngai un, ahamuonna lui bangin akungah, ka luongsah ding a; tualeh Jentelte thupina zong luitui luong bang in, ka luongsah ding; tuachi’n a angsungah ang pom dinga, na kiva ding a, aphei tungah ahing kitomsah ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Nu in ata ahamuon bangin, ka hing hamuon dinga, tuachi’n Jerusalem ah hamuon in na umta ding uhi, achi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Tami na mu chieng un na lungtang uh anuom dinga, na gute zong hampa bangin, adawng thinthen dinga, Mangpa khut khu asuohte kungah theisah ahi ding a, athangpaina khu amelmate tungah theisah ahi ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />“Aziehpen En vawi, Mangpa khu meikuong toh, a sakolleng pingpei bang toh hing pei ding ahi, alungthahna thangpaina, huoisie atung ding a, athuhilna meikuong toh azawh ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Aziehpen Mangpa’n meikuong leh namsau in, mihing zousie tungah vaihawmna atungsah dinga, Mangpa’n athate atampi ahi ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />“Huon sung lah ah apei ua, alaikim a milim nualam ah amauleh amauh kisiensuo a, kisieng sah a, vohsa leh sil kidahhuoi nete leh, chiapi sa nete, amangthai khawm sieng ding uhi, Mangpa’n achi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />“Aziehpen asilbawlte uleh angaituonate uh ka thei a, nam chin leh ham chin ka puikhawm ding a, ahing pei ding ua, ka thupina amu ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />A lah uah chiemtena ka koi dinga, tualeh alah ua pat a suohta namte kungah: Tarshish ah, Pul ah, thalkap siem mi lud te kungah, Tubal ah, Javan ah, leh ka minthan dan za ngailou leh, ka thupina mu ngailou, tuipipang gam a gamlapi tah a umte kung ah, ka sawl ding hi. Tualeh amaun Jentelte kungah, ka thupina aphuong ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Tuachi’n Israel taten asillat uh bel siengthou a, Mangpa inn sunga ahing tawi lut bang un, amaun Mangpa kunga sillat dingin, nam zousiete laha pat in na unaute zousie uh, sakol tungte sakollengte kizawn nate, sabiltung tungte leh sangawngsau tungte ah, ka muol siengthou Jerusalem ah, ahing pui lut ding uhi, Mangpa’n achi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Tualeh ken amaute lah a pawl khat, siempu ding leh, Levi hi dingin ka pang sah ding, Mangpa’n achi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />“Van tha leh lei tha ka bawl dingte, ka masanga umden ding ahi bangin, nahah nasuonte uleh na min uzong a umden ding hi, Mangpa’n achi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Tualeh hichi ahing hi dinga, ha tha khat akipat ha tha dang khat, Khawlni tha khat a kipat Khawlni tha dang khat dongin, mi zousie ka masangah ahing pei ding ua, keima ahing be ding uhi, Mangpa’n achi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />“Tualeh amaute apei doh ding ua, ka tunga takhielte mishi luong haw ava en ding uhi. Athante uh ashi sih dinga, ameikuong uzong amit sih dinga, ama upen mi zousie a dingin, kidahhuoi mama ahi ding uhi.”
  </para>
</usx>
